re his new friends help him face tough challenges to develop his racing talent.'),('s78','Kid cop Little Singham loses all his superpowers while trying to stop the demon Kaal’s new evil plans! Can his inner strength help him defeat the enemy?'),('s79','A budding politician has devious plans to rise in the ranks — until an unexpected new presence begins to interfere with his every crooked move.'),('s80','A budding politician has devious plans to rise in the ranks — until an unexpected new presence begins to interfere with his every crooked move.'),('s81','When his home is threatened by humans, a young dragon summons the courage to seek a mythical paradise where dragons can live in peace and fly free.'),('s82','Slipped a fatal poison on her final job, a ruthless assassin working in Tokyo has less than 24 hours to find out who ordered the hit and exact revenge.'),('s83','Bored with being the Lord of Hell, the devil relocates to Los Angeles, where he opens a nightclub and forms a connection with a homicide detective.'),('s84','On this competition show, a group of metal artists torch, cut and weld epic, badass creations from hardened steel. Only one will win a $50,000 prize.'),('s85','Twins are reunited as a good-hearted female gangster and her uptight rich sister take on family, crime, cops and all of the trouble that follows them.'),('s86','As Ash battles his way through the World Coronation Series, Goh continues his quest to catch every Pokémon. Together, they\'re on a journey to adventure!'),('s87','A hiking trip into the wild turns into a desperate bid for survival for five friends on the run from a mysterious shooter.'),('s88','Titipo the train is out to prove that he\'s got what it takes to help the folks of Train Village ride the rails safely and reliably.'),('s89','From a chance meeting to a tragic fallout, Malcolm X and Muhammad Ali\'s extraordinary bond cracks under the weight of distrust and shifting ideals.'),('s90','Born with superhuman abilities, young Raj