 her dreams at a dance before returning to toil in her stepmother\'s diner. Can her lost cell phone bring them together?'),('s129','When a detective investigates the death of his ex-lover\'s grandfather, he uncovers secrets about the tycoon\'s manipulative family.'),('s130','A grieving widow and her daughter move in with her estranged father-in-law in Wyoming, where time allows them to heal and forgive.'),('s131','At a summer performing arts program in New York City, Barbie from Malibu meets Barbie from Brooklyn, and the two become fast friends.'),('s132','In a smog-choked dystopian Los Angeles, blade runner Rick Deckard is called out of retirement to snuff a quartet of escaped \"replicants.\"\"\"'),('s133','A group of superheroes sets out to rid the world of evil — only to realize they may not be standing on the side of justice. Based on a popular comic.'),('s134','In a futuristic society where an indestructible robot police force keeps crime at bay, a lone droid evolves to the next level of artificial intelligence.'),('s135','When the president\'s friend is murdered, CIA Deputy Director Jack Ryan becomes unwittingly involved in an illegal war against a Colombian drug cartel.'),('s136','Ranger Gabe Walker and his partner are called to rescue a group of stranded climbers, only to learn the climbers are actually thieving hijackers.'),('s137','This drama follows a wounded Civil War soldier making the long journey home, while his faraway love fights for survival on her deceased father\'s farm.'),('s138','When Mick \"Crocodile\"\" Dundee and his family land in Los Angeles'),('s139','While on summer leave, a U.S. soldier falls for a college student. But when he\'s forced to reenlist, their handwritten letters hold the lovers together.'),('s140','On a sweltering day in Brooklyn, simmering racial tensions between residents rise to the surface and ignite rage, violence and tragedy.'),('s141','A lawyer defends an illiterate man whose exploitation by a cruel boss while working as a butcher in Buenos Aires led to tragedy. Based on a true case.'),('s142','When a retired CIA agent is kidnapped, his son, a government analyst, embarks on an unauthorized mission to find him and halt a terrorist plot.'),('s143','While her at-risk students are reading classics such as \"The Diary of Anne Frank'),('s144','Test pilot Hal Jordan harnesses glowing new powers for good when he wears an otherworldly ring and helps an intergalactic force stop a powerful threat.'),('s145','Grounded by his strict father, Kid risks life and limb to go to his best friend Play\'s big bash but experiences one obstacle after another.'),('s146','Kid goes off to college with scholarship money but when Play loses Kid\'s tuition funds to a shady music promoter, they devise a wild plan to raise cash.'),('s147','After Kid gets engaged, Play plans to throw the biggest bachelor party ever. But every celebration for these two always comes with complications.'),('s148','Dale Brisby uses social media savvy and rodeo skills to keep cowboy traditions alive — and now he\'s teaching the world how to cowboy right, ol\' son.'),('s149','When a family run barber shop in the heart of Lagos is threatened by real estate developers, they\'ll do whatever it takes to stay in business.'),('s150','After getting their hands on a misdirected shipment of cell phones, two hustlers try to cash in by hawking the merchandise from the back of their van.'),('s151','Rookie cop Jeffrey Cole poses as a drug dealer to take down a crime lord and soon gets caught up in an underworld of bribery, intimidation and murder.'),('s152','By day, an 18-year-old delivers tofu for his father, a retired race car driver; but by night, it\'s the teen\'s turn to take the wheel.'),('s153','Follow the story of three Australian brothers and their two friends who became an international sensation by posting pranks and gags on YouTube.'),('s154','Cookie, Pudding and Candy are kitten siblings whose favorite things are sweet treats and letting their curiosity lead them on adventures in learning.'),('s155','Five middle school basketball stars went to separate high schools, and now Tetsuya Kuroko and Seirin High are making their play for glory.'),('s156','In Jim Henson\'s fantasy, teen Sarah embarks on a life-altering quest to rescue her little brother from the clutches of a treacherous goblin.'),('s157','By responding to a letter addressed to Shakespeare\'s tragic heroine Juliet Capulet, an American woman in Verona, Italy, is led in search of romance.'),('s158','In a bleak academy that teaches girls the virtues of passivity, two students uncover the ghastly purpose behind their training and resolve to escape.'),('s159','A nerdy teen tries to make himself cool by association when he convinces a popular cheerleader to pose as his girlfriend.'),('s160','When the Hong Kong government enacts a ban on smoking cigarettes indoors, the new law drives hard-core smokers outside, facilitating unlikely connections.'),('s161','When he marries a journalist and becomes stepdad to her daughters, a U.S. Marine finds his once-orderly life no longer entirely under his command.'),('s162','As flying saucers head for Earth, the president of the United States prepares to welcome alien visitors but soon learns they\'re not coming in peace.'),('s163','This biopic of Thurgood Marshall, the first Black U.S. Supreme Court justice, centers on his pivotal work in a sensational case as an NAACP lawyer.'),('s164','A young man house-sits for his mean boss, hoping to use it as an opportunity to win the heart of the boss\'s daughter, on whom he\'s long had a crush.'),('s165','A team of far-from-super heroes try to earn respect by springing into action when brave and dashing Captain Amazing disappears.'),('s166','Three friends in their 70s step out of retirement to become a band of outlaws whose mission is to help those let down by the justice system.'),('s167','Director Sergio Leone\'s sprawling crime epic follows a group of Jewish mob