n.'),('s193','Three broke friends pose as an underworld gang for extortion, but their plan takes on a life of its own when their phony company becomes famous.'),('s194','A young private’s assignment to capture army deserters reveals the painful reality endured by each enlistee during his compulsory call of duty.'),('s195','A multimillionaire fakes his death and forces his relatives to live together in his mansion for one year to see who\'s worthy of inheriting his fortune.'),('s196','A bank hires an enigmatic and unorthodox debt collector to recover money from four borrowers who are unable to pay their loans.'),('s197','An influencer specializing in makeovers bets she can transform an unpopular classmate into prom king in this remake of the teen classic \"She\'s All That.\"\"\"'),('s198','It\'s a whole new world for Arlo and his one-of-a kind pals when they set out to restore a run-down New York City neighborhood — and make it their own.'),('s199','Alhaja Eniola Salami starts anew and sets her sights on a different position of power, fueled by revenge, regret and ruthlessness.'),('s200','Star athlete Rohan has his eye on a beautiful art student. But when his best friend Simran experiences a crisis, he drops everything to help her.'),('s201','True love is put to the test when another woman comes between a pair of star-crossed young lovers in this thriller.'),('s202','A student tries to steal a test from a teacher\'s home, leaving him for dead after an accident. A string of murders may be the professor\'s revenge.'),('s203','Longtime friends Rahul and Karan head to Mumbai intent on making their dreams come true, but both men are suddenly saddled with bad luck.'),('s204','When an unlikely porn actor falls for a woman outside the industry, he employs his co-stars as a stand-in traditional family to impress her father.'),('s205','An aspiring actor and a struggling DJ team up to pursue the ladies they love and a diamond that rightfully belongs to their oversexed dog.'),('