 Man.'),('s296','After reuniting as middle-aged men, three kung-fu prodigies must set their differences aside and dust off their skills to avenge their beloved mentor.'),('s297','A man searching for the truth behind his wife\'s death becomes caught up in a dangerous web of secrets and intrigue stretching from New York to Tel Aviv.'),('s298','From amusement to awe, the nine human emotions of Indian aesthetic theory are explored in this anthology series.'),('s299','In this sequel to \"New Money'),('s300','A single mother breeds locusts as high-protein food, but has trouble getting them to reproduce — until she finds they have a taste for blood.'),('s301','A music-loving kinkajou embarks on the journey of a lifetime to fulfill his destiny and deliver a love song for an old friend.'),('s302','What could have been a sad journey turns joyful for Rahul when he falls in love with a woman en route to submerging his grandfather\'s ashes.'),('s303','A decade after the seminal Brazilian film \"City of God'),('s304','Cora has three sons and a daughter and she´s almost 80. One day during a family reunion the big question comes up: who will be her heir?'),('s305','\"Queen of Sleaze\"\" or feminist pioneer? Powerhouse novelist Jackie Collins created a brash sex-positive persona while hiding her private struggles.\"'),('s306','One of the first rock stars in Argentina, Tango leads a full life during an era of social unrest – one of both glory and despair.'),('s307','When her husband is accused of taking part in an attempted military coup, a pregnant woman\'s life takes an emotional turn. Inspired by true events.'),('s308','Desperate to save their marriage, a young couple takes a deal and moves into their dream home, but disturbing events reveal the house\'s troubled history.'),('s309','The son of Jewish immigrants, David Geffen emerged from a humble upbringing to become one of the most powerful media personalities in America.'),('s310','The colorful crew at Gotham Garage overhauls an eclectic collection of cars and trucks, trading up to a showstopper they can sell for big bucks.'),('s311','Two childhood friends go from high school dropouts to the most powerful drug kingpins in Miami in this true story of a crime saga that spanned decades.'),('s312','When a hacker begins releasing students\' secrets to the entire high school, the socially isolated but observant Sofía works to uncover his/her identity.'),('s313','With an anyone-can-cook attitude, Paris Hilton adds her own flair to every dish. Fun is just one edible glitter bomb away on this unique cooking show.'),('s314','After losing all memories of his past, a wealthy lawyer travels to a rural village where a woman he once loved now lives with her son.'),('s315','Overweight Victor hides from the world making pizzas in his mother\'s gloomy dive until a new waitress blows in and disrupts his isolation.'),('s316','When her sister is accused of multiple murders, a Nigerian woman travels to Los Angeles to uncover the truth and fight for her sibling’s freedom.'),('s317','A department store mogul has his son work incognito in a menial job to prove his worthiness, while female co-workers teach him how normal people live.'),('s318','Ex-leaders and a survivor of the so-called \"conversion therapy\"\" movement speak out about its harm to the LGBTQ+ community and its devastating persistence.\"'),('s319','Max S. reveals how he built a drug empire from his childhood bedroom in this story that inspired the series \"How to Sell Drugs Online (Fast).\"\"\"'),('s320','Before his wedding, a cold CEO is hit by a car and awakens a changed man. As he and the driver fall in love, more changes appear on the road ahead.'),('s321','Though claims of extraterrestrial encounters have long been dismissed, many believe the existence of UFOs is not just likely, but a certainty.'),('s322','When two single guys learn a woman they both slept with disappeared after giving birth, they decide to raise her baby girl together as a family.'),('s323','A young woman\'s romantic cruise ends in a twist when she gets pregnant after a one-night stand with a rich executive, turning their lives upside down.'),('s324','Liz Lemon juggles the demands of running an NBC sketch comedy show with trying to fix her disaster of a personal life and eating her night cheese.'),('s325','Paw-esome tales abound when singing furry friends Lampo, Milady, Pilou and Meatball band together.'),('s326','A father reluctantly agrees to let his children keep a St. Bernard puppy, but the playful pooch soon turns into a full-grown engine of destruction.'),('s327','After St. Bernard Beethoven sires a brood with Missy, he and the Newton kids must intervene when Missy\'s owner tries to sell the puppies.'),('s328','This deftly animated take on a legendary Old English epic tells the timeless tale of a Scandinavian hero who\'s known for slaying dragons.'),('s329','The fourth film in the action franchise finds Boyka taking on brutal gangsters to protect the widow of a man he unintentionally killed in the ring.'),('s330','An FBI agent makes it his mission to put cunning con man Frank Abagnale Jr. behind bars. But Frank not only eludes capture, he revels in the pursuit.'),('s331','When inventor Flint Lockwood makes clouds rain food, the citizens of Chewandswallow can feed themselves. But a bowl of disaster is about to overflow.'),('s332','High schooler Kaname activates a mysterious mobile app and unwittingly joins a game pitting players with supernatural abilities against each other.'),('s333','Scientists conduct research on sharks in search of an Alzheimer\'s cure. But a dangerous shortcut leads to huge sharks with near-human intelligence.'),('s334','After faking an illness to skip school, popular teen Ferris Bueller enjoys a fun-filled day in Chicago with his girlfriend and his uptight best friend.'),('s335','A teen with cystic fibrosis shakes up her daily routine and challenges hospital protocol when she falls for a fellow patient.'),('s336','When a woman reports that her infant son was kidnapped by a black man, an African American detective and a white activist team up to dig for details.'),('s337','Eric Taylor faces enormous pressure when he signs on as the new coach of a small-town Texas football team that\'s poised to win the state championship.'),('s338','Every time Chuck breaks up with a girlfriend, she ends up engaged to her next boyfriend. Soon, women are dating Chuck in hopes of meeting Mr. Right.'),('s339','To fulfill his dreams of becoming a legendary Hunter like his dad, a young boy must pass a rigorous examination and find his missing father.'),('s340','A workaholic reconnects with two men she blocked on social media five years ago and begins to reflect on her past life choices.'),('s341','A troubled thief who extracts secrets from people\'s dreams takes one last job: leading a dangerous mission to plant an idea in a target\'s subconscious.'),('s342','Through chance, history and divine intervention, a cast of eclectic characters weaves and warps through each other\'s lives on a random day in California.'),('s343','A hardened Marine is given his marching orders and must now lead a disorderly group of mismatched cadets into a junior ROTC competition.'),('s344','This coming-of-age charmer follows a summer in the life of an 11-year-old girl who learns about love and loss as she grapples with profound changes.'),('s345','A teen makes surprising discoveries when she talks to her dead mother\'s high school friends for an essay about someone she admires but has never met.'),('s346','When a spooky werewolf tale scares Boog out of joining the annual camping trip, his friends hatch a plan to cure him of his fear.'),('s347','After witnessing a murder, a perpetually stoned process server and his good-natured dealer go on the run from a drug lord who\'s out to kill them.'),('s348','After landing on a planet reminiscent of 1950s suburbia, a human astronaut tries to avoid capture, recover his spaceship and make it home safely.'),('s349','After moving to a retirement community, loner Martha befriends a fun-loving neighbor and forms a cheerleading club for young-at-heart seniors.'),('s350','An ungainly-looking colt becomes a winning thoroughbred in this Depression-era drama based on the true story of champion racehorse Seabiscuit.'),('s351','A retired engineer agrees to help NASA prevent a Russian satellite from falling to Earth if he and his over-the-hill pals can man the mission.'),('s352','In this musical satire, an all-marionette police force takes on the challenging role of keeping the peace on a troubled planet.'),('s353','A troubled teenager finds high school life even less bearable after she catches her childhood best friend hooking up with her popular older brother.'),('s354','A couple\'s Georgia dream home becomes a living nightmare when their daughter begins to have frightening visions from the property\'s terrible past.'),('s355','Private eye Joe Hallenbeck is forced to team up with a disgraced quarterback to uncover a conspiracy by a politician and a football team owner.'),('s356','A street-wise defense lawyer who operates out of the back seat of his Lincoln lands a high-profile case that soon puts him and his family in danger.'),('s357','After a search-and-destroy mission leads to betrayal, an elite black ops squad seeks revenge. But they must remain deep undercover to even the score.'),('s358','Haunted and gaunt after a prolonged bout of insomnia, factory worker Trevor Reznik begins to question his sanity amid a series of mysterious events.'),('s359','A computer analyst becomes a target after she stumbles onto a conspiracy via a mysterious floppy disk, forcing her to go on the run to clear her name.'),('s360','Comedians Steve Harvey, Cedric the Entertainer, D.L. Hughley and Bernie Mac hit the stage in an iconic stand-up concert directed by Spike Lee.'),('s361','The tripwires of modern love are exposed in a carousel involving relationships and the si