omes one of Europe\'s biggest dealers.'),('s387','Catch a ride with the Mighty Express — a team of trains and their kid friends who overcome trouble on the tracks with quick thinking and teamwork!'),('s388','An aspiring actress in a small town agrees to bear a child for a visiting couple seeking a surrogate mother, but her experience takes unexpected turns.'),('s389','Comedy collective The Plastic Cup Boyz pour out the punchlines in Atlanta during a trio of raw and lively stand-up specials.'),('s390','Working as a Mossad spy assigned to Tehran, Rachel reaches her breaking point. Now it’s dangerously hard to tell whose side she’s on.'),('s391','In the wake of a zombie apocalypse, survivors hold on to the hope of humanity by banding together to wage a fight for their own survival.'),('s392','The outcast descendant of lawman Wyatt Earp teams up with an immortal Doc Holliday to rid the world of demonic revenants from the Wild West.'),('s393','Accompanied by a German bounty hunter, a freed slave named Django travels across America to free his wife from a sadistic plantation owner.'),('s394','Crushed when she doesn\'t qualify for the Olympics, a now-grown Maddy Cornell finds new purpose coaching young gymnasts going up against a rival team.'),('s395','A disgruntled South African woman leaves her fiancé and embezzles money from her job to pursue her dream of being a Broadway star in New York City.'),('s396','Two directionless millennial bros get high and pitch a bold new social justice app that raises millions. Then they have to come up with the app.'),('s397','When a group of terrorists hijacks an overnight transatlantic flight, a mysteriously ill woman must unleash a monstrous secret to protect her young son.'),('s398','Short films follow young adults as they navigate the gamut of emotions that come with finding romantic connection in unexpected places.'),('s399','Tragedy, betrayal and a mysterious discovery fuel a woman\'s vengeance for the loss of her tribe and family in this special episode of \"Kingdom.\"\"\"'),('s400','After a calamitous battle fractures Eternia, Teela and an unlikely alliance must prevent the end of the Universe in this sequel to the ’80s classic.'),('s401','Take a behind-the-scenes look at “Masters of the Universe: Revelation” as showrunner Kevin Smith and others interview the cast about their iconic roles.'),('s402','A fatal turn of events at a brothel sends three women haunted by their pasts on a wild run from their pimp and his henchmen.'),('s403','After finding a trove of love letters from 1965, a reporter sets out to solve the mystery of a secret affair — while embarking on a romance of her own.'),('s404','These blockbusters brought us together and gave us the time of our lives. Meet the actors, directors and industry insiders who made them happen.'),('s405','In this documentary, female office workers in \'70s Boston inspire change with a call for better pay, more opportunities and an end to sexual harassment.'),('s406','When a scientist has trouble caring for his secret baby dinosaur, he takes Bheem and friends back in time to return the pet to its natural habitat.'),('s407','Things get spooky when Bheem and his buddies travel to the border of Dholakpur, known for its eerie history and rumored to be haunted.'),('s408','Bheem and Lord Ganesha join forces to save Dholakpur from fire-spitting dragons, who have also captured Ganesh’s mouse companion!'),('s409','Young lord Krishna has fallen for demoness Maayandri’s revenge plot against him! Can Bheem rescue him and thwart Maayandri’s other destructive plans?'),('s410','Krishna needs Bheem’s help: The ruined city of Pataliputra has been cursed! Can the friends do what it takes to bring light back into this town?'),('s411','When a stranger tries to steal an amulet from the palace, Bheem learns the sad story behind the ornament and heads to Africa to defeat the real villain.'),('s412','To save the kingdom of Valhalla from invasion by Vikings, Bheem is gathering his army of friends, who are ready to put up a formidable fight!'),('s413','When Dholakpur’s princess is kidnapped, Bheem is off to the land of the Incas to save her, but he’s in for an even bigger challenge upon his arrival.'),('s414','After learning of a samurai village under threat by their own emperor, Bheem sets off for Japan to offer his help.'),('s415','When two evil entities kidnap a princess in a plot to build a new kingdom, Bheem takes them on with the help of the courageous monkey god Hanuman.'),('s416','Centuries after the end of a conqueror\'s rule, he is mysteriously back from the dead. It’s up to Bheem to save Dholakpur from being taken over!'),('s417','A demon of darkness is plotting world domination — but when Bheem and Krishna catch wind of his plans, they’ll stop at nothing to destroy him.'),('s418','Bheem’s plans for an exciting African safari are interrupted when he finds that an evil ruler is using magical powers to cause drought through the land.'),('s419','A faulty transportation machine lands Chhota Bheem and his friends in Russia, where they must save a princess from an evil, power-hungry magician.'),('s420','Space invaders have kidnapped Dholakpur’s king and princess! The only way Bheem can rescue them? Defeat the aliens in a cricket match.'),('s421','Bheem’s holiday in Nepal takes an unexpected turn when he is called on to save a monkey cub from snow leopards and reunite him with his father.'),('s422','After a precious temple stone is stolen under his watch, Bheem trains in a special martial art to prepare for a showdown with the thief.'),('s423','The king has been away to meet an old friend, but when he sends for urgent help, Bheem finds himself on an action-packed rescue mission to Egypt!'),('s424','Summoned by a monk to help reclaim a temple from a dangerous leader, Bheem must master the Shaolin kung fu techniques if he wants a fighting chance!'),('s425','Bheem and young lord Krishna team up to protect the world against the wicked and powerful Kirmada and his equally dangerous bat army.'),('s426','The doctors and nurses of Gaffney Chicago Medical Center juggle the busy ER\'s dramas and dangers in this spinoff of \"Chicago Fire\"\" and \"\"Chicago P.D.\"\"\"'),('s427','Separated as children, three cousins with an unshakeable bond confront their painful pasts and embark on an emotional journey to find each other.'),('s428','When his newlywed wife becomes disenchanted because he failed to protect her from danger, Omar seeks the help of a quirky psychiatrist to win her back.'),('s429','After meeting one bright, sunny day, a shy boy who expresses himself through haiku and a bubbly but self-conscious girl share a brief, magical summer.'),('s430','Two cops must contend with the uncooperative tenants of an apartment complex as they try to solve a murder before the crime scene is wiped clean.'),('s431','Hoping to say goodbye to superficial dating, real-life singles sport elaborate makeup and prosthetics to put true blind-date chemistry to the test.'),('s432','Sizzling hot young Brazilians meet at a dreamy beach resort. But for a shot at R$500,000 in this fun reality show, they\'ll have to give up sex.'),('s433','Heroes from \"Trollhunters'),('s434','Aimless 20-something Milo impulsively becomes a gay man’s surrogate and wrestles with the emotional complexities of her non-traditional decision.'),('s435','In 2000, a group of young men takes over a house in Buenos Aires, becoming squatters, while dealing with an increasingly violent and hostile city.'),('s436','Hoping to make a comeback after a bad scandal, an actress agrees to research a new role by taking a job as a secretary for a prickly attorney.'),('s437','In an impoverished neighborhood, the son of a swordsman falls in love with the daughter of a wedding singer — a taboo match in a traditional society.'),('s438','In the year 2524, a disgraced retired general is called back into combat to help prevent an interstellar war against a hostile alien fleet.'),('s439','A businessman returns home to Nigeria and falls in love with a friend\'s sister despite his family’s plan for him to marry a politician’s daughter.'),('s440','Four insomniac med school students are lured into a neuroscience experiment that spirals out of control — and must find a way out before it’s too late.'),('s441','This enlightening series from Vox digs into a wide range of topics such as the rise of cryptocurrency, why diets fail, and the wild world of K-pop.'),('s442','Thrust back to 1666, Deena learns the truth about Sarah Fier. Back in 1994, the friends fight for their lives — and Shadyside’s future.'),('s443','How much trouble could one imaginative boy, his faithful dog and two science-loving sisters possibly get into? Hmm, that sounds like a challenge!'),('s444','Following the brutal 1949 murder of a small Mexican town\'s mayor, genteel and humble janitor Juan Vargas is appointed his successor.'),('s445','This intimate series follows Naomi Osaka as she explores her cultural roots and navigates her multifaceted identity as a tennis champ and rising leader.'),('s446','During the Civil War, a wounded Union soldier takes refuge at a Southern girls school, rupturing the calm amid growing sexual tension and infighting.'),('s447','An 11-year-old vows to help a new neighbor who he suspects is in danger, and documents his efforts in a series of written entries and audio recordings.'),('s448','After a dream wedding, Bella and Edward enter a new nightmare when a shocking development forces life-or-death decisions.'),('s449','In the epic series\' final chapter, Bella and Edward\'s newborn daughter forces the couple into a life-altering confrontation with the Volturi.'),('s450','With a bloodthirsty enemy on a quest for revenge, Bella must reconcile her love for vampire Edward and her growing feelings for werewolf Jacob.'),('s451','Still reeling from the departure of vampire Edward Cullen, a heartbroken Bella Swan finds comfort in her friendship with were