ey must fight desperately to get out alive.'),('s465','When an assassin veers off mission to rescue a child, she triggers a war with a powerful crime syndicate — and reunites a gun-wielding sisterhood.'),('s466','Millions in stolen cash. Missing luxury bourbon. Watch ordinary people almost get away with these extraordinary heists in this true crime series.'),('s467','Follow Julia Haart, Elite World Group CEO and a former member of an ultra-Orthodox Jewish community, and her adult kids in this reality series.'),('s468','A deep dive into the work of renowned Mexican journalist Manuel Buendía looks to unravel his murder and the ties between politics and drug trafficking.'),('s469','A couple in Québec deals with the pitfalls, pressure and high expectations of raising kids in a society obsessed with success and social media image.'),('s470','In rural Pennsylvania, a working-class single mom must pick up the pieces and step up to raise her grandson after her daughter suddenly disappears.'),('s471','\"Bridgerton\"\" cast members share behind-the-scenes stories from the hit show'),('s472','With their family facing financial woes, two teen brothers seize an opportunity to reverse their bad fortunes by traveling 20 years back in time.'),('s473','Curious kid Ridley and her friends protect the Museum of Natural History’s treasures and keep its magical secret safe: Everything comes alive at night!'),('s474','This documentary follows the Boston Renegades — an all-woman, tackle football team — as they risk their time, families and day jobs for the game.'),('s475','He\'s just a weed fiend going nowhere, or so he thinks. When the CIA tries to eliminate him, his long-dormant superspy training comes roaring back.'),('s476','Members of the comedy group Na Stojáka take the stage and the mic by storm for a special night of stand-up comedy.'),('s477','Miloš Knor brings comedians Lukáš Pavlásek, Tomáš Matonoha, Ester Kocicková, Michal Kavalcík and Richard Nedved on a tour around the Czech 