e classic TV series.'),('s568','Eight people, some with ulterior motives, go on an expedition to the Congo, where they find a lost city protected by killer apes.'),('s569','The bane of George\'s life is a little boy named Dennis. But when a cunning thief attempts to rob George, Dennis may be the only one who can stop him.'),('s570','Through heartbreak and betrayal, Ngan\'s unrequited love for his childhood best friend Hà La endures for a generation in this sweeping romance.'),('s571','Warlords, warriors and statesmen wage a battle for supremacy in this fantasy tale based on the hit video games and the \"Romance of the Three Kingdoms.\"\"\"'),('s572','A chance encounter leads two 30-somethings to remember 1998, the year their teenage hormones kicked in — and the internet changed their lives forever.'),('s573','An American widow in London forms an unexpected relationship with a man living off the grid in a beautiful park ripe for development.'),('s574','When a powerful villain comes after peace in his valley, a lazy panda rises to the challenge to realize his destiny and become a kung fu warrior.'),('s575','With his fists up and belly full, Po embarks on a perilous journey with the Furious Five to take on a frightful new enemy and save the art of kung fu.'),('s576','Holly and Eric discover reciprocal hatred during their first date, but must put their feelings aside after becoming guardians of their friends\' baby.'),('s577','A woman with healing powers abandons her village life to become a devout disciple of Jesus, the founder of Christianity.'),('s578','A humorous view on a changing Saudi, this season includes stories about a global media war, a long-standing tribal feud and a health craze gone too far.'),('s579','Sold to a geisha house as a child, a fisherman’s daughter becomes the most sought-after geisha in Kyoto, but rivalries threaten the destiny she desires.'),('s580','A cop-turned-bounty hunter runs into trouble as he races from New York to Los Angeles with a 