tmosphere to any home.'),('s761','For the first time in 4K Ultra-HD, everyone\'s favorite Yuletide fireplace snaps and crackles in crystal clear, high-def holiday warmth.'),('s762','Cutting-edge science and captivating personal stories collide in this illuminating docuseries about the incredible workings of the human body.'),('s763','Faced with real-world opportunities and challenges, a couple endures the highs and lows of trying to make a long-distance relationship survive.'),('s764','On a perilous adventure across a post-apocalyptic world, a lovable boy who\'s half-human and half-deer searches for a new beginning with a gruff protector.'),('s765','To rekindle their marriages, best friends-turned-in-laws Shanthi and Jennifer plan a couples\' getaway. But it comes with all kinds of surprises.'),('s766','In this fast-paced and action-packed thriller, a retired hitman — along with his sister and a troubled teen — takes revenge on his lethal stepbrother.'),('s767','Mexican comedian Alan Saldaña is back, poking gentle fun at himself and parceling advice, especially about how to stay married and how to be parents.'),('s768','Comedian Ryuji Akiyama satirizes top “creators” in Japan with a deadpan, unerring eye for humor, with help from some surprising celebrity guest stars.'),('s769','A dancer who gets a job cleaning at a struggling drag club dreams of being in the show, and her talent catches an ambitious choreographer\'s eye.'),('s770','A stressed-out documentary filmmaker goes on a journey of discovery with a pair of monks, one of whom is known as \"the happiest man in the world.\"\"\"'),('s771','From pregnancy to album preparations, Lebanese singer and “Queen of the Stage” Myriam Fares documents her experiences with her family while in lockdown.'),('s772','When a dark power enshrouds the Earth after a total solar eclipse, the scattered Sailor Guardians must reunite to bring light back into the world.'),('s773','Two young adults from very different backgrounds fall in 