 institutes share the harsh realities, pleasant surprises and transformative journeys of their college experiences.'),('s878','A struggling rickshaw driver’s life takes a rollicking turn when he comes upon an expensive camera and decides to make a film with his fellow villagers.'),('s879','Before he built a drug empire, Ferry Bouman returns to his hometown on a revenge mission that finds his loyalty tested — and a love that alters his life.'),('s880','His name built an empire. His style defined an era. American fashion designer Halston skyrockets to fame before his life starts to spin out of control.'),('s881','Real people sit down with friends and family to share terrifying true stories from their past, re-created through chilling re-enactments.'),('s882','A relentless detective finds common ground with a killer systematically targeting the perpetrators running a powerful child-trafficking ring.'),('s883','When a lost and lonely alien crash-lands on Earth, his new crew of talking animal friends helps him get back home — and try to save the world!'),('s884','Terrifying creatures, wicked surprises and dark comedy converge in this NSFW anthology of animated stories presented by Tim Miller and David Fincher.'),('s885','Finding life in all that’s left behind, a detail-oriented trauma cleaner and his estranged uncle deliver untold stories of the departed to loved ones.'),('s886','When a housewife\'s picture-perfect life comes crashing down, she finds solace and hope through cooking, family and love.'),('s887','As pregnant women vanish in a remote Nigerian village over decades, a doctor with child finds herself extremely close to uncovering dangerous secrets.'),('s888','When a big-city family moves to a remote town, two young brothers and their new friends try to solve the menacing mystery that haunts their home.'),('s889','The comedic dream team from \"The Upshaws\"\" discuss the hit series'),('s890','Confined to her home by agoraphobia, a psychologist becomes obsessed w