er a nuclear battleship. Standing in their way is one tough cook.'),('s957','Zack and Miri make and star in an adult film to bring in easy money. But their unspoken feelings for each other might threaten the whole enterprise.'),('s958','Follow talent management company Pets on Q as they work with the biggest animal influencers on social media in this reality series.'),('s959','After his affluent father passes, a man must survive seven days in the Nigerian neighborhood of Ajegunle, where obstacles keep him from his inheritance.'),('s960','Self-doubt, sacrifice and struggle converge into an existential crisis for a devoted classical vocalist as the mastery he strives for remains elusive.'),('s961','An accidental killing leads a man down a dark hole of intrigue and murder. Just as he finds love and freedom, one phone call brings back the nightmare.'),('s962','A robot apocalypse put the brakes on their cross-country road trip. Now it’s up to the Mitchells — the world’s weirdest family — to save the human race.'),('s963','Home-invasion horror comes to the trailer park when a family arrives at a mobile home community to find nobody there but a trio of masked murderers.'),('s964','An inept magician pulls off the trick of his life: accidentally disappearing a wanted criminal during a police raid. Now he\'s going to pay for that.'),('s965','A young woman discovers that both her husband and their new home harbor sinister secrets after they leave Manhattan for small-town life.'),('s966','A peaceful boatman once known as the Black Samurai is pulled back into conflict when he takes a little girl with mysterious powers under his wing.'),('s967','After a botched scam, Clóvis bumps into Lohane, his estranged foster sister. In a bind, they soon realize the only way out is to band together.'),('s968','Learn how to sleep better with Headspace. Each episode unpacks misconceptions, offers friendly tips and concludes with a guided wind-down.'),('s969','To build an innovative sex app and 