034','In the 1970s, a rivalry propels race car drivers Niki Lauda and James Hunt to fame and glory — until a horrible accident threatens to end it all.'),('s1035','Two paramedics begin to question their realities after coming across several bizarre deaths linked to a new narcotic with mind-bending effects.'),('s1036','When the Nazis invade Poland, Warsaw Zoo caretakers work with the underground resistance to save Jews from the horrors of the Third Reich.'),('s1037','While searching for their missing archaeology professor, a group of students discovers a cave where time passes differently than it does on the surface.'),('s1038','To avoid the burden of commitment, a young lawyer and a writer agree to be romantic partners only two days a week. That won’t get complicated — right?'),('s1039','A group of aspiring young musicians yearn for stardom while navigating the ups and downs of friendship, romance, and life at school.'),('s1040','In this documentary, TT the Artist captures the irrepressible bounce and infectious beats of a Baltimore club scene that demands to be seen and heard.'),('s1041','A young man looking for excitement moves to Ikebukuro, a district in Tokyo, where he finds a world of mystery in which the past and present mesh.'),('s1042','Teams of recently deceased people who\'ve been revived and given high-tech weapons must cooperate to defeat an army of monsters in Tokyo and Osaka.'),('s1043','Revealing interviews and archive footage tell the story of Garth Brooks\' humble beginnings, rise to fame and unprecedented impact on country music.'),('s1044','Fiercely independent single mom Lorelai raises gifted, Ivy League-bound daughter Rory amid a continual stream of quick-witted repartee.'),('s1045','High schooler Yuri finds herself atop a skyscraper in a strange world, where she must survive against masked assailants bent on killing their prey.'),('s1046','Talented designers from around the world compete for $250,000 and the chance to become the next big thing 