elps the villagers build a school – and inspires a path to hope for them all.'),('s1213','In the streets of Istanbul, ailing waste warehouse worker Mehmet takes a small boy under his wing and must soon confront his own traumatic childhood.'),('s1214','An eager young rookie joins the ragtag small-town police force led by his dad as they bumble, squabble and snort their way through a big drug case.'),('s1215','The lives of three Chilean teenage misfits converge as they try to find their place in an unequal society through hip-hop and lasting friendships.'),('s1216','Bored with her life and inspired by a friend\'s wedding, Esra quits her job and dumps her boyfriend, leading to a series of romantic misadventures.'),('s1217','Didem tries everything to get actor Cem to propose to her, but he\'s got other things on his mind: a beautiful new co-star and a secret bachelor party.'),('s1218','Love — and lies — spiral when a DNA researcher helps discover a way to find the perfect partner, and creates a bold new matchmaking service.'),('s1219','A mom and dad who usually say no decide to say yes to their kids\' wildest requests — with a few ground rules — on a whirlwind day of fun and adventure.'),('s1220','When an old fling shows up with their infant child, a dallying man-child must take on the role of father and create a fairytale world for his daughter.'),('s1221','Basque Country, 1609. To postpone their execution, a group of women accused of witchcraft lure their inquisitor into witnessing the witches\' Sabbath.'),('s1222','After the devastating loss of a loved one, Abby forms a bond with his sister\'s best friend as he struggles to move on.'),('s1223','On an island, a fisherman\'s family faces horrors and dark truths when an ominous force begins killing the wildlife and puts their own lives in danger.'),('s1224','Tensions erupt when two filmmakers infiltrate an area ruled by gangs to shoot a music video for a rapper in this gritty found-footage series.'),('s1225','“Last Chance U” hits the hardwood in East Los Angeles as a coach with strong convictions leads young men who hope to fulfill major college potential.'),('s1226','A wedding planner and a real estate agent compete to win the hearts and budgets of spouses-to-be. Will they pick fairy-tale nuptials or a dream home?'),('s1227','With plenty of passion and little know-how, two musicians undertake a daunting project: turn a late singer\'s houseboat into a creative musical space.'),('s1228','From boardrooms to society\'s margins, five ambitious women from various walks of life navigate dreams, desires and disappointments in modern Mumbai.'),('s1229','Amidst the bustle of a magnetic and multifaceted city, the budding love between two dreamers is tested.'),('s1230','In the 1970s, an aspiring singer struggles to prove herself in the face of challenges posed by her strict upbringing and romantic choices.'),('s1231','A son stoically returns to his village upon his father’s death, recalling their chilly dynamic before a bizarre event disrupts his visit.'),('s1232','Meet the Ghost Club! Their adventures take them all around Los Angeles as they interview ghosts, solve problems and learn about their city\'s history.'),('s1233','When a narco past his prime refuses to pay a debt to an upstart, only a secret stash of money can save his men. But guess what the gardener just found?'),('s1234','Faking her way through any situation, a social media influencer poses as an event planner and is tasked with throwing an extravagant, star-studded bash.'),('s1235','Nevenka Fernández, the plaintiff in Spain\'s first successful lawsuit against a politician for sexual harassment, breaks her silence after 20 years.'),('s1236','Young trainer Ash and his new friend Goh become research fellows at Professor Cerise\'s laboratory, traveling all over the world to learn about Pokémon.'),('s1237','Transferred home after a traumatizing combat mission, a highly trained French soldier uses her lethal skills to hunt down the man who hurt her sister.'),('s1238','New student Acha falls for Iqbal, a high-achieving student who\'s torn between love and family pressure.'),('s1239','After Kaiju ravage Australia, two siblings pilot a Jaeger to search for their parents, encountering new creatures, seedy characters and chance allies.'),('s1240','Parker is a thief – but he has scruples. So when his crew double-crosses him, Parker teams up with an unlikely partner to even the score.'),('s1241','When a mysterious woman arrives in a small North Carolina town, she begins a new life but remains haunted by a terrifying secret.'),('s1242','Inspired by her mom\'s rebellious past and a confident new friend, a shy 16-year-old publishes an anonymous zine calling out sexism at her school.'),('s1243','High-stakes exploits turn deadly — and shake a global church to its core — in this extraordinary true crime story.'),('s1244','A widowed lawyer struggles to retain custody of his biracial granddaughter when the girl\'s paternal grandmother questions his competence.'),('s1245','A spirited but naive young woman seeks a one-night stand, but after discovering her date’s real identity, things quickly go from casual to complicated.'),('s1246','Meet Bailey, Franny, Kip and Lulu. They\'re adorable baby animals, and they want you to join the party and help them learn!'),('s1247','An eclectic group of people encounters zany situations in this anthology of surreal, offbeat tales from Hong Kong. Based on Mr. Pizza\'s hit novel.'),('s1248','In this stage performance filmed for the big screen, an innocent man seeks revenge after breaking free of the prison he was held in for ten years.'),('s1249','Featuring rare footage and in-depth interviews, this documentary celebrates the life of The Notorious B.I.G. on his journey from hustler to rap king.'),('s1250','With self-deprecating humor, French comic Blanche Gardin offers stream-of-consciousness observations on environmentalism, gender relations and herself.'),('s1251','Argentine DJ Hernán Cattáneo, known for his house music innovations, invites a symphonic orchestra for a four-night run at Buenos Aires\' Teatro Colón.'),('s1252','On the frontier, a Civil War soldier bonds with a Sioux tribe and adapts to their way of life, becoming their ally amid growing threats.'),('s1253','The devil\'s sassy (and bored) daughter makes a deal with her dad: If she can turn a good person evil, she gets to ditch hell and stay on Earth.'),('s1254','When Green Goblin and Venom team up for a disastrous scheme, Spider-Man calls in a wall-crawling ally and must rely on his Spidey senses to stop them.'),('s1255','Motivated by money, a selfish workaholic seeking a piece of his late father\'s inheritance takes a life-changing road trip with his estranged brother.'),('s1256','In this cinematic distillation of the electrifying stage performance, seven spirited souls take on the dark threat growing in shadowy Skull Castle.'),('s1257','Dreaming of being a rock god, Midwesterner JB heads to California, where he crosses paths with idler KG – giving rise to the musical duo Tenacious D.'),('s1258','In an alternate New York City protected by a band of superheroes called NEXT, veteran Wild Tiger is forced to team up with rookie Barnaby Brooks Jr.'),('s1259','Bigfoot’s now a big deal. So when he goes missing, his shy but tech-savvy teen son must take on an evil CEO to save his family and a wildlife preserve.'),('s1260','A father raising his children off the grid begins to question his anti-establishment, utopian views when a tragic loss pulls them back into society.'),('s1261','After spending a wild night together, Adri discovers the only way to see Carla again is to become a patient at the psychiatric center where she resides.'),('s1262','A struggling music student discovers and tries to complete an unfinished symphony begun by a famous composer, whose career was ended by a past trauma.'),('s1263','Cast members of the hit Netflix show join the hosts to unpack the drama of Season 1, and Cristela Alonzo offers tips for being the new kid at school.'),('s1264','Soon after relocating to Southeast Asia, an American family lands in the midst of a violent coup that could cost them their lives.'),('s1265','A seemingly clueless idealist relies on his exasperated sisters for shelter and support after his girlfriend dumps him and his dog is taken away.'),('s1266','A troubled divorcée fixates on a seemingly ideal couple from afar until a shocking observation sends her spiraling straight into a knotty murder case.'),('s1267','Amid the violence of Pinochet\'s reign in 1978 Chile, emotionally dead Raúl finds escape in his obsession over the protagonist in \"Saturday Night Fever.\"\"\"'),('s1268','After his compatriots are murdered by Russian gangsters, a hacker confesses the history of his elite, fame-seeking group to a Europol investigator.'),('s1269','In Colombia, the DEA\'s new director targets a gang of dealers pushing a powerful drug while contending with an enemy who possesses a deep network.'),('s1270','After falling for Geez, a heartthrob at school, Ann must confront family opposition, heartache and deception as their romance struggles.'),('s1271','Born into a small town controlled by the mafia, an irate young woman seeks revenge on the forces that tore apart and wrongfully imprisoned her family.'),('s1272','The Robles family, born and raised in the Americas, experiences the highs and lows of the revolutionary drive to Peru\'s independence.'),('s1273','Dynamic reenactments and expert commentaries bring to life the tumultuous history and power struggles of a warring 16th-century feudal Japan.'),('s1274','Kaede and Hisano form a club to change the world. When Hisano vanishes, Kaede throws himself into bringing the club back to its idealistic roots.'),('s1275','No dog, no breed, no behavior is unfixable for Cali K9\'s Jas Leverette. Follow the Oakland dog trainer as he works with a range of canines and owners.'),('s1276','Free-spirited Georgia and her two kids, Ginny and Austin, move north in search of a fresh start but find that the road to new beginnings can be bumpy.'),('s1277','When Maurício becomes a student at a top medical school, he becomes obsessed with a mystery linked to the dead bodies used for dissection.'),('s1278','This anthology series of terror features diverse characters facing primal fears in spine-chilling situations that stretch past daily routine.'),('s1279','Brian Regan tackles the big issues weighing on him, including aging, time, obsessive behavior, backpacks on airplanes, ungrateful horses and raisins.'),('s1280','A woman walks into a New York gallery with a cache of unknown masterworks. Thus begins a story of art world greed, willfulness and a high-stakes con.'),('s1281','Against the backdrop of a turbulent era in Brazil, this documentary captures Pelé’s extraordinary path from breakthrough talent to national hero.'),('s1282','A murder investigation leads police to a photo of a suspect, but when two men are found with faces that match the picture, the case gets doubly tricky.'),('s1283','Complicated marriages, digital romances, domestic dilemmas and schoolyard bullies get the spotlight in these seven, slice-of-life short films.'),('s1284','When a family starts experiencing supernatural terrors after moving into a Rhode Island farmhouse, they seek the help of a pair of noted demonologists.'),('s1285','After her daughter unwittingly releases a malevolent spirit in their house in London, a woman enlists the Warrens\' help to confront the evil presence.'),('s1286','During a visit to his motherland, a Korean-Italian mafia lawyer gives an unrivaled conglomerate a taste of its own medicine with a side of justice.'),('s1287','Four school buddies — a director, a temp worker, an insurance salesman and a paper craftsman — grapple with unfulfilled dreams amid middle age ennui.'),('s1288','Stars of the fiery hit discuss the show\'s magic, play trivia and chow down on hot wings. Then, Taylor Tomlinson shares how she would use fairy powers.'),('s1289','In 1960, Israeli spies undertake a daring mission to capture notorious Nazi war criminal Adolf Eichmann and bring him to justice. Based on real events.'),('s1290','Featuring a mix of film footage and special performances, this virtual concert honors the memory and music of revered Indonesian singer Glenn Fredly.'),('s1291','A court-appointed legal guardian defrauds her older clients and traps them under her care. But her latest mark comes with some unexpected baggage.'),('s1292','The troubling inner workings of a toxic marriage reveal themselves in surprising ways after one of the couple’s feuds spins out of control.'),('s1293','It\'s a country steeped in cultural traditions that stretch back more than 1,000 years. But Peru is also a land of surprising natural riches.'),('s1294','From secrets and lies to jealousy and control, four stories in this anthology film explore the darker, deceptive sides of love.'),('s1295','In post-apocalyptic Europe, amid wars among microstates, three siblings fight for survival as a greater threat looms over the continent.'),('s1296','Hired as a monkey repeller upon moving to Delhi, a young man struggles to find his footing in his unenviable job and his place in the unforgiving world.'),('s1297','Miserable and unsuccessful, a woman thinks she\'s lost all her spark — until one day, her spunky younger self appears in front of her demanding change.'),('s1298','A lighthearted bonding opportunity takes a dark and decidedly dangerous turn when a father and daughter try out an escape room in a small town.'),('s1299','An unfathomable incident introduces a genius engineer to dangerous secrets of the world — and to a woman from the future who\'s come looking for him.'),('s1300','A popular manga creator becomes enmeshed in paranormal events while conducting research: Stand User Kishibe Rohan visits Italy, goes bankrupt and more.'),('s1301','Will Smith hosts this look at the evolving, often 