 that she\'s pregnant.'),('s1454','Working at a neighborhood fast-food joint, two teens try to save the restaurant when a giant burger franchise fires up the competition.'),('s1455','Chris Rock hops around the world going from beauty salons to science labs to comb through the mystery of Black hair.'),('s1456','Headspace takes a friendly, animated look at the benefits of meditation while offering techniques and guided meditations to jump-start your practice.'),('s1457','A young man gives up everything – including his trust fund and ties to a seemingly stable family – to lead a solitary life in the wild.'),('s1458','This drama follows Mexican-American singer Jenni Rivera\'s unlikely rise from suicidal pregnant teen and abused wife to banda superstar.'),('s1459','After a heist gone wrong, a career criminal gradually uncovers the hidden motive behind his father\'s murder – and it has nothing to do with money.'),('s1460','The father of a high school pariah offers to pay another student\'s way through college if she makes friends with his outcast daughter.'),('s1461','After 20 years, Ana María returns to Mexico and vies for control of her family\'s tequila empire as it threatens to crumble under corruption and secrets.'),('s1462','In a small fishing town, three teenage girls from blue-collar families navigate life and love while working in a pizza parlor.'),('s1463','Wanting to bring home the ultimate prize, a group of competitors gather for a championship — and discover both friends and enemies as they play!'),('s1464','The Cat in the Hat is back – and this time, he\'s teaching Sally and her brother, Nick, some awfully nifty things to think about!'),('s1465','Neuroscientist David Eagleman taps into the creative process of various innovators while exploring brain-bending, risk-taking ways to spark creativity.'),('s1466','Single mom Michelle Hathaway and her daughters find that they share their New Orleans home with the ghosts of single dad Ray Preston and his two sons.'),