 pasts.'),('s1556','Strong, whip-smart Grizzy rules a Canadian forest, where he has his paws full with a family of frolicsome lemmings.'),('s1557','When Santa crash-lands in the junkyard on Christmas Eve, Hank, Trash Truck and their animal friends all have a hand in rescuing the holiday for everyone.'),('s1558','After a heartbreaking loss, a grandfather struggling to reclaim his passion for painting finds the inspiration to create again.'),('s1559','Six ambitious student actors audition for the prestigious August Wilson Monologue Competition, culminating in a riveting final round on Broadway.'),('s1560','A teacher starts her job at a high school but is haunted by a suspicious death that occurred there weeks before... and begins fearing for her own life.'),('s1561','A group of down-on-their-luck Broadway stars shake up a small Indiana town as they rally behind a teen who just wants to attend prom with her girlfriend.'),('s1562','At an Afghanistan refugee camp, an ex-army doctor seeks to bring children joy through cricket — and soon realizes that the stakes go beyond the sport.'),('s1563','An aimless gamer and his two friends find themselves in a parallel Tokyo, where they\'re forced to compete in a series of sadistic games to survive.'),('s1564','A student must navigate issues of sexuality, identity and family amid Sri Lanka\'s social turmoil of the 1970s and 1980s.'),('s1565','Strange occurrences afflict a group of people after they purchase items on a shopping website from the future.'),('s1566','An overconfident teen bets he can make a homely transfer student fall in love with him in 30 days — but the wager starts to play games with his heart.'),('s1567','When his best friend gets stranded in the rain and becomes the subject of a romantic viral video, a morning show host must confront his true feelings.'),('s1568','Three gay siblings are told by their terminally ill father that they must each produce a grandchild in order to inherit their share of his fortune.'),(