ry of life on Earth, to grieve the loss of wild places and offer a vision for the future.'),('s1888','From unseen footage to the last table read, this documentary takes an inside look at the final season of the acclaimed comedy series \"Schitt\'s Creek.\"\"\"'),('s1889','New high school grad and avid gamer Cenk is recruited to an intense esports team that trains for a tournament with a life-changing prize.'),('s1890','For Como and his friends, each new adventure is a lesson on why it\'s important to be considerate — and to take care of one another!'),('s1891','Shrunk down in size, Como and his friends examine the wonder-filled world around them one item at a time, from foods to household goods.'),('s1892','Forced to wed his childhood friend, a man obsessed with football attempts to get rid of his wife in order to keep the woman he truly loves.'),('s1893','Cory, Chrissy and Freddie are on the hunt for king-sized candy bars this Halloween! But are all the treats worth the trek to the spooky side of town?'),('s1894','Madagascar goes wild with holiday spirit in this set of Valentine\'s Day and Christmas-themed tales featuring everyone\'s favorite animal characters.'),('s1895','After landing her dream job in Paris, Chicago marketing exec Emily Cooper embraces her adventurous new life while juggling work, friends and romance.'),('s1896','The gals in this fantasy series cope with the burden of growing a giant fin and transforming into mermaids whenever they come in contact with water.'),('s1897','In Lagos, a journalist goes undercover as a prostitute to expose human trafficking. What she finds is a world of exploited women and ruthless violence.'),('s1898','When a slum dweller spins a web of lies in pursuit of the upward mobility he has long craved, his ruse could be especially dangerous for his young son.'),('s1899','While visiting her fiancé\'s mother in southern Italy, a woman must fight the mysterious and malevolent curse intent on claiming her daughter.'),('s1900','A 