gles by belting out death metal karaoke after work.'),('s2091','A 17-year-old confronts confusion and heartbreak as he rediscovers his sexuality in this story about coming out and its social consequences.'),('s2092','A group of university students decides to test an urban legend about the ghost of a female student that haunts a campus bridge.'),('s2093','Tormented by a demon and on the run from a Roman centurion, a 7-year-old Jesus and his parents, Mary and Joseph, flee Egypt for Nazareth.'),('s2094','Nearly 30 years after her mom\'s murder, a political strategist launches a calculated plan to ruin the Colombian presidential candidate who killed her.'),('s2095','An undocumented trans woman seeking legal status in the US becomes romantically involved with the grandson of the elderly woman she cares for.'),('s2096','Journey into the extraordinary world of \"The Witcher\"\" — from casting the roles to Jaskier\'s catchy song — in this behind-the-scenes look at the series.\"'),('s2097','The competition is fierce — and the drama undeniable — as a group of young and hungry agents try to seal the deal on luxury listings in the Hamptons.'),('s2098','Elite athletes and insiders reflect on the Paralympic Games and examine how they impact a global understanding of disability, diversity and excellence.'),('s2099','Science-loving host Emily Calandrelli makes STEAM fun with activities, demonstrations and at-home experiments that\'ll make you think — and blow your mind!'),('s2100','A grieving teen finds an unexpected connection with two classmates at her new high school after they all land in the same Shoplifters Anonymous group.'),('s2101','In post-revolution Tehran, a wealthy Jewish businessman is summarily jailed and tortured, but along with his wife, he fights for answers and freedom.'),('s2102','Couples go on a romantic getaway to test their relationships, not knowing their families are calling the shots and cringing over their every move.'),('s2103','After a newly rich family