rs his discussions with stars such as Daniel Brühl and Lena Meyer-Landrut.'),('s2398','Jo Koy brings the laughs and beats to Manila, spotlighting local culture in a one-of-a-kind show featuring Filipino American comedians, DJs and B-boys.'),('s2399','After losing her parents, a young girl learns about grief and healing from a friendly ghost who lives in her grandmother\'s traditional Japanese inn.'),('s2400','Monkey D. Luffy sails with his crew of Straw Hat Pirates through the Grand Line to find the treasure One Piece and become the new king of the pirates.'),('s2401','When a girl vanishes from a suburb near Mexico City, the personal goals of some involved in the case muddy the search. Based on a true story.'),('s2402','Evidence found on the body of a homicide victim sparks hope in a prosecutor that his sister who disappeared 25 years earlier could still be alive.'),('s2403','To celebrate the memory of their pal who passed away, three estranged friends attempt to reconnect on an eventful road trip from Abu Dhabi to Beirut.'),('s2404','A stranger to civilian life, a young Saudi farmer travels to Dubai, where he experiences a series of hilarious misadventures.'),('s2405','After 17 years, a woman returns home with her teenage twins. When she mysteriously vanishes, her children must reckon with a shadowy family legacy.'),('s2406','A mysterious \"time master\"\" from the future unites an unlikely group of superheroes and villains to save the world from a powerful evil.\"'),('s2407','Four doctors at New York\'s storied Lenox Hill Hospital balance their personal lives and their dedication to their patients in this documentary series.'),('s2408','An entrepreneur develops an adult entertainment online billing company – and winds up dealing with mobsters, the FBI, con men and terrorists.'),('s2409','In a world that is less than kind, a young woman and a middle-aged man develop a sense of kinship as they find warmth and comfort in one another.'),('s2410','With Rio de Janeiro u