 preacher, Nigerian artist Falz combines cinema with a concert after his successful 2017 end-of-year show.'),('s3115','A tragic romance unfolds during a teacher\'s lessons on the Benin empire after they begin to mirror her love life when her childhood love reappears.'),('s3116','Dreaming of a better life, an imperiled prostitute crosses paths with a wealthy company heir who’s been transformed into a child by his evil uncle.'),('s3117','At a key turning point for the Catholic Church, Pope Benedict XVI forms a surprising friendship with the future Pope Francis. Inspired by true events.'),('s3118','Geralt of Rivia, a mutated monster-hunter for hire, journeys toward his destiny in a turbulent world where people often prove more wicked than beasts.'),('s3119','A large immigration raid in a small town leaves emotional fallout and hard questions for its churchgoers about what it means to love thy neighbor.'),('s3120','Months after a crushing breakup, a man receives a mysterious package that opens a portal to the past – and gives him a chance to win back his ex.'),('s3121','An online community of amateur sleuths use technology to solve crimes – and make quirky friends – in their quest for justice.'),('s3122','A twisted criminal\'s gruesome videos drive a group of amateur online sleuths to launch a risky manhunt that pulls them into a dark underworld.'),('s3123','Love, loss and transformative luck intersect in this musical drama about two struggling artists experiencing life at full volume in Los Angeles.'),('s3124','Ronny Chieng (\"The Daily Show'),('s3125','Eleven emerging Bangladeshi filmmakers present a collection of gritty shorts centered on the capital city and the people living in its margins.'),('s3126','In 1920s Denmark, married artists embark on a journey of unconditional love when the husband announces his intentions to live life as a woman.'),('s3127','Sent on the same deadly international mission by their rival religious factions, two men\'s madcap antics along 