ling, an unexpected development shakes up their marriage.'),('s3154','An unapologetic lothario sets out to seduce three ex-flames – but gets an unexpected education in love along the way.'),('s3155','Engrossed in her career, a young woman reluctantly yields to her father\'s plan to set her up on 10 dates to find a suitable husband.'),('s3156','An idealistic cop joins an underground police unit and battles ghoulish forces threatening the balance between the human and the supernatural realms.'),('s3157','After his father passes, the heir to a retail empire returns to take over the family business but faces a controversy involving laundering and murder.'),('s3158','Jack Whitehall invites his notoriously stuffy father onstage in London\'s West End for a Christmas comedy extravaganza, complete with celebrity guests.'),('s3159','After succumbing to her terminal illness, a teenager posthumously narrates her parents’ tenacious relationship in this drama based on a true story.'),('s3160','As two jobless brothers search aimlessly for careers worthy of their hard-to-please mother’s praise, they cluelessly tackle countless gigs.'),('s3161','Comedian Michelle Wolf takes on outrage culture, massages, childbirth, feminism and much more (like otters) in a stand-up special from New York City.'),('s3162','M\'Dear and her sisters struggle to keep their singing act together before a church Christmas pageant while Grandpa teaches the kids a valuable lesson.'),('s3163','As danger stalks the world outside his isolated home, an overprotective father faces a tough decision when another family shows up seeking help.'),('s3164','In a fictional megalopolis, a stunning underworld theft triggers a fierce power struggle among the gangsters, with an enigmatic cop on their trail.'),('s3165','As controversy surrounds the evangelical church he helped found, Edir Macedo must juggle betrayals, politics and personal loss in this biopic sequel.'),('s3166','With unique individual perspectives that converge into a unified voice, sketch comedy group Astronomy Club delivers a smart and absurd brand of humor.'),('s3167','Searching for a soul mate, a ghost negotiates with God for three more days on Earth to find love, then meets a woman in need of help herself.'),('s3168','A successful actress with an abusive husband confides in friends who have troubling relationship issues of their own.'),('s3169','The Tanner family’s adventures continue as DJ Tanner-Fuller shares a home with her sister Stephanie and friend Kimmy who help raise her three boys.'),('s3170','Academy Award-nominated filmmaker Noah Baumbach directs this incisive and compassionate look at a marriage coming apart and a family staying together.'),('s3171','In ancient Disboard, a young warrior befriends an ex machina and embarks on a harrowing mission to stop a global war and save humanity from extinction.'),('s3172','Desperate to leave a life of prostitution, a teenage mother attempts to outsmart her ruthless boss who is determined to keep his prized asset.'),('s3173','Lucky and friends must figure out how to get home in time for Christmas when a falling boulder – and a serious snowstorm – derail their travel plans.'),('s3174','Teased constantly by classmate Takagi-san, middle-schooler Nishikata swears payback by trying (and failing) to give her a dose of her own medicine.'),('s3175','Determined to bring a Zika vaccine to the remote Pantanal, three doctors clash with a faith healer and are pulled deeper into the mysteries of his cult.'),('s3176','Henry Lee Lucas rose to infamy when he confessed to hundreds of unsolved murders. This docuseries examines the truth – and horrifying consequences.'),('s3177','Four sisters deal with family drama and secrets throughout three different time periods, all occurring on Christmas Day.'),('s3178','After jostling her way into a gig as a celebrity bodyguard, the boisterous daughter of a powerful triad boss shakes up a TV star\'s life and finds love.'),('s3179','A group of loc