 murder but is sucked into a violent tale of greed and deception.'),('s3192','A socially awkward teen bonds with a group of misfits who plot to abduct the school\'s arrogant rich kid – until their kidnapping scheme turns deadly.'),('s3193','Cal turns to his friends for help through a hilariously dark time when he discovers that his partner Thom\'s been cheating on him.'),('s3194','From romantic pursuits to their friendship, a trio of young men navigate the complexities of relationships while sharing a London apartment.'),('s3195','This documentary examines the influence of Hong Kong\'s martial arts cinema on filmmaking from the Shaw Brothers to modern-day Hollywood blockbusters.'),('s3196','An Indian man in Canada marries a local citizen to legalize his immigration status. The only problem? His girlfriend isn\'t thrilled about his new wife.'),('s3197','Guilt-ridden over his involvement in a fatal car accident, a young ex-pat returns to Punjab, falling for a woman who carries traumas of her own.'),('s3198','A Punjabi man attempts to build a life in London in hopes of impressing his girlfriend’s mother, who insists her daughter marry a man outside of India.'),('s3199','A young villager moves to Chandigarh and falls for his bubbly neighbor, but their love story is affected by several heartbreaking twists of fate.'),('s3200','A broken spaceship strands four very tiny aliens on Earth, where they discover an adventure (and strange dangers!) that they never expected.'),('s3201','This biopic follows pro golfer Ariya Jutanugarn\'s journey to the LPGA tour, from child prodigy to her number-one ranking in the world.'),('s3202','A get-rich-quick scheme goes awry when a group of friends stumbles onto a dangerous conspiracy and wind up getting mistaken for the bad guys.'),('s3203','Navigating creative pressures and personal upsets, French rapper Nekfeu sets out on a global quest for musical inspiration in this documentary.'),('s3204','A young prosecutor is assigned a career-making case involving a colleague but soon starts to question the motivations behind the charges.'),('s3205','Brought together by meaningful meals in the past and present, a doctor and a chef are reacquainted when they begin working at a hospice ward.'),('s3206','From Sierra de las Minas to Esquipulas, explore Guatemala\'s cultural and geological wealth, including ancient Mayan cities and other natural wonders.'),('s3207','A goofy copywriter unwittingly convinces the Indian cricket team that she’s their lucky mascot, to the dismay of their superstition-shunning captain.'),('s3208','Arranged to marry a rich man, young Ada is crushed when her true love goes missing at sea during a migration attempt – until a miracle reunites them.'),('s3209','Lovable pug Chip starts kindergarten, makes new friends and tries new things – with a little help from Potato, her secret mouse pal.'),('s3210','Nollywood star Ramsey Nouah learns that someone is impersonating him and breaks out of a mental institution to expose the imposter.'),('s3211','Romance, mystery and adventure intertwine as a young man falls in love and a severed hand scours Paris for its owner in this mesmerizing animated film.'),('s3212','The life and times of iconic South African liberation fighter Solomon Mahlangu, who battled the forces of apartheid, come into focus.'),('s3213','This compelling show tells the story of the legendary Teresa Mendoza, a courageous woman who is perceived as conquering the world of drug trafficking.'),('s3214','Two mooching friends vie for the attention of wealthy, beautiful women only to discover that their lavish lifestyles are bogus.'),('s3215','After an expensive night out, two flatmates get tangled in an overnight misadventure to recover their rent money to pay their dead landlord\'s daughter.'),('s3216','Nursing a broken heart, an IT specialist moves to London to audition for a reality TV show that unexpectedly turns into a real-life cartel drama.'),('s3217','A quirky fashion student becomes the nanny of a handsome widower’s three kids, experiencing a series of silly antics and schemes.'),('s3218','When a colonel uncovers controversial intel about the government, he makes a shocking discovery and must decide whether to reveal it or risk his life.'),('s3219','A widowed radio DJ and his four spoiled kids need to tighten their belts and pull together when their life of luxury turns lean just before Christmas.'),('s3220','Young Levius rises through the ranks in the brutal world of metal boxing under his uncle\'s guidance. Forces outside the ring have their eye on him.'),('s3221','Four comedians from Brazil riff on sexuality, politics, religion and motherhood – and set out to prove a woman\'s place is anywhere she wants it to be.'),('s3222','A struggling LA musician tries to win over his new girlfriend\'s gruff dad and quirky, tight-knit siblings on a 10-day Christmas visit to Philadelphia.'),('s3223','Burned out and taken for granted, a working mom suspects her partner is cheating, so to win back his attentions, she feigns a medical diagnosis.'),('s3224','In this action-packed drama based on an extraordinary true story, four brothers protect more than 1,000 Jewish refugees during World War II.'),('s3225','When caste differences throw a wrench into their otherwise blossoming relationship, a couple must somehow convince the girl’s father to let them marry.'),('s3226','In a journey back in time to the ancient city of Mirchigadh, Little Singham vies for the title of Ultimate Warrior and fights a zombie king’s army.'),('s3227','After a traumatic event, two Indigenous women in Vancouver are brought together and form a deep bond despite leading different lives.'),('s3228','Hit man Frank Sheeran looks back at the secrets he kept as a loyal member of the Bufalino crime family in this acclaimed film from Martin Scorsese.'),('s3229','Comedian Mike Birbiglia hits Broadway with a hilarious yet profound one-man show that recounts his emotional and physical journey to parenthood.'),('s3230','It\'s Christmas Eve in Pitchfork Pines, and the Super Monsters are joining forces to deck the halls, find Santa\'s missing reindeer and save the holiday!'),('s3231','The peaceful lives of the residents inhabiting a breathtaking seaside town are shaken following a series of macabre crimes.'),('s3232','An ice crystal from a frosty realm is freezing everything in the Rainbow Kingdom, its citizens too! Can True save Winter Wishfest – and her friends?'),('s3233','An assortment of talent takes the stage for a night of honest stand-up featuring four of Mexico\'s funniest LGBTQ comedians.'),('s3234','Aspiring to fulfill his father’s dream and become a civil services officer, a young man loses his way upon becoming entangled with a criminal lynchpin.'),('s3235','Featuring extensive interviews, this documentary takes a critical look at the gender inequality in Spain as the feminist movement aims to shift reality.'),('s3236','Trying to go straight, a once-successful businessman fresh out of prison is forced to orchestrate a brazen crime or risk his family.'),('s3237','As the nine continents face a crisis, a young disciple joins the Spirit Blade sect and comes under the tutelage of a temperamental sage.'),('s3238','Thrust from a violent home into a brutal custody center, a teenager learns to navigate a tough new reality and forge unlikely alliances to survive.'),('s3239','Eight stories celebrating family, faith, love and forgiveness come to life in this series inspired by Dolly Parton\'s iconic country music catalog.'),('s3240','The girls of Oarai High must face off against a formidable university team in a fierce tank battle to once again avoid closure of their school.'),('s3241','Mike Birbiglia performs in this live concert special that features a riotous selection of the unique insights and observations culled from his diary.'),('s3242','It\'s the \"Nailed It!\"\" holiday special you\'ve been waiting for'),('s3243','Ride along as police officers and 