56','When their 4-year-old son is murdered, a young couple fights a twisting and arduous battle trying to identify a frustratingly elusive killer.'),('s3257','Here comes the bride, and she\'s got plenty to say. Newlywed Iliza Shlesinger dissects wedding traditions as she mines her nuptials for laughs.'),('s3258','After ditching her domestic life to become a chef, a clueless maid crosses paths with two charming suitors who help her reach her dreams.'),('s3259','When a wardrobe malfunction goes viral, a bubbly live streamer struggles to navigate her classmates\' cruel judgment and the small town she lives in.'),('s3260','Decades after a nuclear war, survivors on the moon revisit Earth to locate a potential power source – and find shape-shifting reptiles instead.'),('s3261','America\'s most beloved ventriloquist hits the road, bringing along all of his most popular pals, including Achmed, Peanut and Walter.'),('s3262','At the beginning of the 20th century, circumstances drive a young, idealistic suffragette to find radical approaches to fighting male oppression.'),('s3263','Determined to save an Amazon tribe being squeezed by logging, a group of students finds nothing but trouble when their plane crashes in the jungle.'),('s3264','Encountering each other after a long separation, two childhood friends from orphanage must overcome great odds to fulfill an old promise and find love.'),('s3265','In 1980s Tokyo, an enigmatic expat is suspected of killing her friend, who\'s gone missing in the wake of their love triangle with a local photographer.'),('s3266','In the most remote areas of the Amazon jungle, a writer and his anthropologist friend meet communities who have resisted change for centuries.'),('s3267','Mía\'s vacation with her dad is disrupted by the surprise arrival of Lupe, Mercedes, Juanma and Álvaro as their school drama moves lakeside.'),('s3268','A pampered but kind-hearted average joe ditches his romancing and peacekeeping ways when he’s framed for a murder he didn’t commit.'),('s3269','A world-weary man’s self-imposed home confinement becomes a comedy of errors with the simultaneous arrivals of a peculiar package and a curious journalist.'),('s3270','In an unfiltered, intimate docuseries, pop star mentor Charli XCX finds out what it takes to build – and break – a real, badass all-girl punk band.'),('s3271','After a chance encounter in LA, two teens from different social backgrounds reunite at an exclusive high school attended by Korea’s über rich.'),('s3272','When they\'re not gorging themselves on sugary snacks, four aspiring high school musicians crank out catchy tunes as members of the Light Music Club.'),('s3273','The seniors in Sakuragaoka High School\'s music club live out the graduation trip of their dreams when they celebrate by performing in London.'),('s3274','A selfish postman and a reclusive toymaker form an unlikely friendship, delivering joy to a cold, dark town that desperately needs it.'),('s3275','After a chance encounter that ends on bad terms, two clashing strangers soon cross paths again as their fates become inevitably intertwined.'),('s3276','Beloved children\'s book character Llama Llama springs to life in this heartwarming series about family, friendship and learning new things.'),('s3277','An unfortunate accident alters the life of a high school basketball prodigy, who abandons his beloved sport and becomes entangled in a love triangle.'),('s3278','A refined young Joseon scholar\'s life turns upside down after he rescues a drunk princess who later accuses him of taking something precious from her.'),('s3279','A trio of filmmakers treks across India to explore the correlation between vanishing rivers, massive energy projects and renewable energy sources.'),('s3280','A band of misfit rich kids in Mexico strike out on their own selling MDMA and quickly run into trouble with other narcos, the law and their families.'),('s3281','When a lonely teenager skips his morning classes to sit in a lovely garden, he meets a mysterious older woman who shares his feelings of alienation.'),('s3282','Trapped on an island destroyed by a tsunami, the students of an elite school try to hold on to hope. But mysterious forces seem to work against them.'),('s3283','The minds behind history\'s most iconic toy franchises discuss the rise – and sometimes fall – of their billion-dollar creations.'),('s3284','After a fateful domestic clash, a devoted mother finds herself in prison and fighting to survive in hopes of reuniting with her daughter.'),('s3285','Spirited high school misfits with hearts of gold begin their journeys into adulthood as they navigate school, friendship, romance and heartbreak.'),('s3286','Irrepressible French comedian Fadily Camara weaves jokes, vivid characters and physical comedy into a lively stand-up show at La Cigale in Paris.'),('s3287','Love leaps off the page when an astronomer magically meets her comic book hero in the flesh, but learns that his fictional problems are very real.'),('s3288','In this docuseries, soccer great Diego Maradona comes to Culiacán, the heart of the Sinaloa Cartel, to save the local team, the Dorados, and maybe himself, too.'),('s3289','As a chief of staff in the National Assembly, Jang Tae-jun influences power behind the scenes while pursuing his own ambitions to rise to the top.'),('s3290','Comedian Jeff Garlin (unintentionally) celebrates his 37th year of stand-up and shares his learnings on love, loss, success and food addiction.'),('s3291','This stream-of-consciousness drama centers on a day in the life of a gay college professor who\'s reeling from his longtime lover\'s recent death.'),('s3292','On the cusp of graduation, an accounting major searching for her career winds up living with a genius physics student who shakes up her daily routine.'),('s3293','Traumatized by combat, newly returned war veterans find solace in service dogs that guide them back to a fulfilling civilian life.'),('s3294','A cohabiting couple in their 20s navigate the ups and downs of work, modern-day relationships and finding themselves in contemporary Mumbai.'),('s3295','From the attack on Pearl Harbor to D-Day, the most pivotal events of World War II come to life in this vivid docuseries featuring colorized footage.'),('s3296','On a road trip to save an endangered animal, polar opposites Guy and Sam learn to try new things like friendship – and a certain delectable dish.'),('s3297','A snowstorm hits a small town on a cold Christmas Eve, affecting the friendships, love lives and futures of several high school seniors.'),('s3298','Mehdi gets out of prison, planning to settle old scores. But first, he must reconnect with his gang, now living in an idyllic beach resort in Thailand.'),('s3299','After surrendering to Bogotá police, an ex-guerrilla avoids prison by working undercover to investigate a ruthless enforcer of government corruption.'),('s3300','A reporter must hunt for the truth behind a strange murder after she crosses paths with a young cop and becomes the investigation\'s prime suspect.'),('s3301','A small-town Louisiana minister and one of his parishioners cope with grief, alcoholism and a crisis of faith in this dramatic character study.'),('s3302','Hit hard by the Lehman shock, a well-meaning young man joins a phone scam operation and gets increasingly embroiled in the underworld.'),('s3303','As three kingdoms struggle for control of a walled city, a figure with a rare power spins a web of intrigue that entangles a king\'s court.'),('s3304','Luccas and Gi are heading to a world famous gymkhana camp. Only problem: so are their bullies... A fun musical that will get you in a vacation mood.'),('s3305','To earn cash, roommates Sam and Cat start a baby-sitting service – and quickly discover just what an adventure baby-sitting can be.'),('s3306','SNL alumnus and subversive master of late-night TV Seth Meyers comes out from behind the desk to share some lighthearted stories from his own life.'),('s3307','A