, each egg holds a fun-filled lesson waiting to be learned. ChuChu and friends are opening them all!'),('s3398','Magic elephant Mr. Harlo uses playtime to help the children discover various surprises hidden inside colorful eggs.'),('s3399','With his desperate parents in tow, an 11-year-old boy with a debilitating illness checks into an isolated clinic to undergo experimental therapy.'),('s3400','A teacher turns to a dubious man to raise money for her daughter\'s life-saving surgery, a crisis that is unexpectedly catapulted to a national stage.'),('s3401','Aspiring interior designers transform a variety of spaces from dowdy to delightful as they vie for a life-changing contract with a top London hotel.'),('s3402','Twinkle, Mia, Jacus and the rest of the Nursery Rhyme Friends perform catchy tunes for the little ones.'),('s3403','When a group of people meets at the same party, they form four different relationships, each experiencing similar phases of love.'),('s3404','From decorating his home to devouring sweets, join Bheem as he makes merry – and a bit of mischief – while the festival of lights is in full swing.'),('s3405','Jin and his dragon monster Draka set out on a racing adventure and try to save the kingdom from evil forces.'),('s3406','To find his therapy dog, a 17-year-old escapes from juvie and embarks on a journey of reconnection with his brother and grandmother through Cantabria.'),('s3407','Find the fun and adventure of \"Spirit Riding Free\"\" in this mix of music videos and short episodes featuring Lucky and all of her friends!\"'),('s3408','Doubting her future as a nun, a woman attempts to have a child, triggering a mystic tribal prophecy that could force her to make a godly sacrifice.'),('s3409','In this documentary, Alex trusts his twin, Marcus, to tell him about his past after he loses his memory. But Marcus is hiding a dark family secret.'),('s3410','When a widow gets swindled out of insurance money, her search for answers leads to two cunning lawyers in Panama who hide cash for the superrich.'),('s3411','Reclusive, socially awkward jingle composer Toon must navigate the nightmarish world of show biz after a viral video skyrockets him to fame.'),('s3412','A pampered heir must complete a year of service work to inherit his dad\'s assets but unearths new goals when he\'s placed in an unfamiliar region.'),('s3413','Hoping to do good while making millions, three college graduates create a startup. But as business begins to flourish, their own bond starts to fray.'),('s3414','Now a lecturer in Edinburgh, Fahri tries to begin a new chapter as the love of his life, Aisha, volunteers in the Gaza Strip. Have they moved on?'),('s3415','When a mysterious box arrives at his door, a doctor and father is forced to participate in a twisted killing game, or risk losing everything.'),('s3416','When they learn of a secret plot to track and control kids, identical twins Dru and Kal team up with a band of runaway rebels to take back their world.'),('s3417','A sound director who suddenly starts getting visions of someone else’s future gets mired in the lives of two women, who happen to share the same name.'),('s3418','Shocked when their friend embraces extremism, a group of Muslim Americans in Texas recount their time with him and theories about his fate.'),('s3419','Fans, experts and creators of the \"League of Legends\"\" detail the game’s rise from free demo to global esports titan.\"'),('s3420','Korea’s beloved comedian and favorite big sister figure talks sex, relationships and celebrity life. And she’s sassier and dirtier than ever before.'),('s3421','Facing major changes, a mother realizes it\'s time to live for herself and decides to enroll in college, where she finds her dream as well as new love.'),('s3422','A single mother and her twin sons move into a rural house, unaware of its history of being inhabited by an evil spirit that preys upon young children.'),('s3423','Special Forces trainer James Wilks asks elite athletes to compare the merits of meat, protein and plants for building strength. Spoiler: plants win.'),('s3424','After a cop\'s fiancée and a jewelry designer\'s father are found dead together, the two bereaved ones face a perilous aftermath of a theft gone wrong.'),('s3425','Quebecois comedy star Martin Matte serves up embarrassing personal stories, a solution for social media trolls and more in this unpredictable special.'),('s3426','Three brothers – a gangster, a scholar and an impressionable teen – learn hard lessons in the gritty suburbs while searching for the means to survive.'),('s3427','After her father dies and her husband goes missing, Kim Seo-hui teams up with detective Jo Tae-sik and joins the National Assembly.'),('s3428','A mother\'s plan to find her bachelor son a match derails when a new prospect turns up and sinister schemes unfold.'),('s3429','Fugitive Jesse Pinkman attempts to outrun his past. Written and directed by \"Breaking Bad\"\" creator Vince Gilligan'),('s3430','After his wife and injured daughter disappear from an ER, a man conducts a panicked search and becomes convinced the hospital is hiding something.'),('s3431','A bullied teenager turns to beauty pageants as a way to exact her revenge, with the help of a disgraced coach who soon realizes he\'s in over his head.'),('s3432','With a matriarch bent on having a lavish 51st birthday party, her family\'s debt is on the verge of exposure, threatening their business – and legacy.'),('s3433','A con man and a would-be filmmaking crew force themselves into the lives of two grief-scarred young women. But nothing is as it seems.'),('s3434','When Parisian Elsa gets hung up on her ex, her best friends secretly hire a male escort to help her move on. But their plan works a little too well.'),('s3435','Back in her childhood home to help her sister care for their comatose mother, Alicia must face a dark force from her past that now threatens her child.'),('s3436','Yearning to earn the title of world bladi