 on dance-filled adventures with his family, friends and adorable critters in this colorful, animated preschooler series.'),('s3541','Experience nature\'s art as filmmaker Louie Schwartzberg highlights the beauty that lurks in oceans, forests, deserts and flowers.'),('s3542','Guided by the spirit demon within him, orphaned Naruto learns to harness his powers as a ninja in this anime adventure series.'),('s3543','A pregnancy forces an actress out of her latest play and into a difficult confrontation with her own rapidly transforming reflection.'),('s3544','Through intense prison interviews, Piers Morgan revisits the crimes of three convicted serial killers and learns more about their motives.'),('s3545','When a storm terrorizes his patch, a pumpkin cast out for his shape must step up to use his smarts to save the day – and to prove himself.'),('s3546','Two young Yemeni business partners decide to go on vacation in the UAE with a few local friends, but their fun trip soon turns terrifying.'),('s3547','A bright and spirited seven-year-old girl uses her vivid, dreamlike imagination to navigate everyday adventures alongside her real and imaginary BFFs.'),('s3548','Eager to flaunt their success in front of old bullies and teenage crushes, two best friends spend a wild night at their middle school reunion.'),('s3549','When an unattractive man gets engaged to a beautiful woman, their families oppose the union and the priest set to perform the ceremony is kidnapped.'),('s3550','When a young soccer fan and his idol forge an unexpected friendship, the connection teaches them both lessons about life and their love of the game.'),('s3551','Whether styling superstars or elevating A-list homes, couple Jason Bolden and Adair Curtis of JSN Studio connect famous clientele with the chicest looks.'),('s3552','As power-hungry overlords drain life from the planet Thra, a group of brave Gelfling unite on a quest to save their world and fight off the darkness.'),('s3553','A near-death expe