d terrorists.'),('s3579','Dr. Lisa Sanders crowdsources diagnoses for mysterious and rare medical conditions in a documentary series based on her New York Times Magazine column.'),('s3580','When a young Bogotá-based detective gets drawn into the jungle to investigate four femicides, she uncovers magic, an evil plot and her own true origins.'),('s3581','When Zim reappears to begin the next phase of his evil alien plan to conquer Earth, his nemesis Dib Membrane sets out to unmask him once and for all.'),('s3582','In the late 1970s two FBI agents expand criminal science by delving into the psychology of murder and getting uneasily close to all-too-real monsters.'),('s3583','A dying tycoon has his consciousness transplanted into the body of a healthy young man, only to make a troubling discovery about the body\'s origin.'),('s3584','When a dad-to-be learns he\'s actually a sextuplet, he sets off on a wild journey to meet his long-lost family. Marlon Wayans stars as all six siblings.'),('s3585','The Super Monsters welcome Vida to her new home in Pitchfork Pines with a tour of their favorite places, then help her through her first day at school.'),('s3586','When an elite gamer is forced out of his professional team, he becomes a manager of an Internet café and reinvents himself to return to online glory.'),('s3587','The discovery of the tomb of William Tell’s son in a town in the Basque Country spurs the village\'s cantankerous citizens to lobby for Swiss annexation.'),('s3588','No one can be trusted after a terrorist bombing in Bilbao kills seven and destroys the lives of the suspected jihadi and everyone around him.'),('s3589','Immortal renegade Philly the Kid and his transforming pink Cadillac join a relentlessly upbeat friendship droid on her quest to find a missing prince.'),('s3590','A link in their pasts leads an honest cop to a fugitive gang boss, whose cryptic warning spurs the officer on a quest to save Mumbai from cataclysm.'),('s3591','Based on the speculative