h the help of modern technology.'),('s3756','On a field trip to Petra, two jinns – one good, the other evil – enter the human realm, turning high school into a supernatural battleground.'),('s3757','Oprah Winfrey talks with the exonerated men once known as the Central Park Five, plus the cast and producers who tell their story in \"When They See Us.\"\"\"'),('s3758','Working in an orphanage, Alia meets teen Nadia, who says she hears a strange voice in the walls. When they try to find the source, things go very wrong.'),('s3759','Comedian Jo Koy takes center stage in Hawaii and shares his candid take on cultural curiosities, filter-free fatherhood and more.'),('s3760','In an alchemic mix of fact and fantasy, Martin Scorsese looks back at Bob Dylan\'s 1975 Rolling Thunder Revue tour and a country ripe for reinvention.'),('s3761','Two mischievous yet lovable five-year-old twins and their friends enjoy daily life and new discoveries with the residents of their Malaysian village.'),('s3762','An artist muddles through a midlife crisis while trying to balance his dimming career with a yearning to be a better father.'),('s3763','America\'s fate rests in the hands of a low-level official after an attack on Washington decimates the government in this gripping political thriller.'),('s3764','In 1901 Spain, Elisa Sánchez Loriga adopts a male identity in order to marry the woman she loves, Marcela Gracia Ibeas. Based on true events.'),('s3765','Following humanity\'s mass extinction, a teen raised alone by a maternal droid finds her entire world shaken when she encounters another human.'),('s3766','Pretending to marry in order to cohabitate, a small-town couple lands in endless awkward situations to hide the truth from their orthodox families.'),('s3767','When a sacred statue is taken from his Andean village, a spirited boy who dreams of becoming a shaman goes on a brave mission to get it back.'),('s3768','After an adventurous teen with a heart defect bonds with an unruly stallion, she trains to compete as an amateur jockey in a life-threatening race.'),('s3769','Once a year, men in a small town fear abduction by an eccentric female spirit. A young tailor dismisses the idea of the ghost – until he falls for her.'),('s3770','The adorably magical Monster Pets star in a series of short adventures that are big on fun – and full of surprises!'),('s3771','Returning to San Francisco after a long absence, Mary Ann Singleton reunites with the community of characters at 28 Barbary Lane.'),('s3772','This documentary follows the life of Clarence Avant, the ultimate, uncensored mentor and behind-the-scenes rainmaker in music, film, TV and politics.'),('s3773','A woman sexually assaulted by her new boss\'s brother-in-law tries to move on as if nothing happened, but the night weighs heavily on her mind and body.'),('s3774','A former class bully reaches out to the deaf girl he\'d tormented in grade school. He feels unworthy of redemption but tries to make things right.'),('s3775','This sci-fi anthology series explores a twisted, high-tech near-future where humanity\'s greatest innovations and darkest instincts collide.'),('s3776','Despondent on a desolate island, a suicidal sheep is thrown a lifeline by a quirky salesman, who offers him the gift of a lifetime.'),('s3777','Viral video star Miranda Sings and her real-world alter ego Colleen Ballinger share the stage in a special packed with music, comedy and \"magichinry.\"\"\"'),('s3778','\"Silent\"\" is an animated short film created by Academy Award® winning Moonbot Studios. It celebrates how storytellers'),('s3779','Elevating the art of parody, this sharply comic series spoofs high-profile documentaries such as \"Grey Gardens\"\" and \"\"The Thin Blue Line.\"\"\"'),('s3780','On the heels of Junior Rescue training, Team Flounder returns to brave the beach in a series of thrilling saves and lighthearted laughs.'),('s3781','In a mythical land called Arth, the inhabitants of the ancient city of Arthdal and i