eligious cults turns to his Buddhist monk friend for help investigating a new group with mysterious origins.'),('s3795','\"Roastmaster General\"\" Jeff Ross and a slew of guest stars poke fun at major historical figures while also honoring their enduring impact on the world.\"'),('s3796','Displaced by Hurricane Maria, three Puerto Rican women navigate their families\' uncertain futures as their federal housing aid in New York expires.'),('s3797','To live is to eat. For people around the world in precarious and dangerous circumstances, eating itself is dangerous, precarious – and essential.'),('s3798','Close to paying off her debts, a Nigerian sex worker in Austria coaches a reluctant novice, and assesses the risks of taking a faster path to freedom.'),('s3799','Stranded at a summer camp when aliens attack the planet, four teens with nothing in common embark on a perilous mission to save the world.'),('s3800','Nola Darling struggles to stay true to herself and her dreams while juggling three lovers in this Spike Lee series based on his breakout film.'),('s3801','In this twisty horror-thriller, a once-promising music prodigy reconnects with her former mentors, only to find them taken with a talented new pupil.'),('s3802','Desperate to secure funding for her med tech startup, an idealistic scientist and her husband strike an outrageous deal with a mysterious investor.'),('s3803','The Lonely Island spoofs notorious baseball stars Jose Canseco and Mark McGwire in this visual rap album set in the Bash Brothers\' 1980s heyday.'),('s3804','Mexico City restaurant star Gabriela Cámara opens sister eatery Cala in San Francisco, with a similar menu and unusually welcoming kitchen culture.'),('s3805','Leveraging his ability to withstand pain, a young man trains to follow in the footsteps of his martial-arts hero in this high-action, meta comedy.'),('s3806','Wanda Sykes tackles politics, reality TV, racism and the secret she\'d take to the grave in this rollicking, no-holds-barred stand-up special.'),('s3807','A prankster prince who wants to experience life as an ordinary teen leaves his kingdom to live incognito with a single mom and her studious son.'),('s3808','Worlds collide when a vengeance-obsessed young woman from the other side of the tracks captures the attention of two well-off friends.'),('s3809','Archival video and new interviews examine Mexican politics in 1994, a year marked by the rise of the EZLN and the assassination of Luis Donaldo Colosio.'),('s3810','This documentary focuses on the devastating violence of the Israel-Palestine conflict and its effects on the children of Gaza.'),('s3811','This intimate documentary follows a group of Syrian children refugees who narrowly escape a life of torment and integrate into a foreign land.'),('s3812','Seeking answers after a life-changing incident in 2012, filmmaker Hernán Zin interviews other war reporters about the personal toll of their work.'),('s3813','An old-school Brooklyn native devotes his days to caring for his adorable dog, Bruno – and making sure the neighbors show his pooch the proper respect.'),('s3814','An ex-assassin tries to leave her dark past behind until a power-hungry gang targets her and her family, forcing her to summon her killer instincts.'),('s3815','After discovering the family of Solomon Linda, the writer of \"The Lion Sleeps Tonight'),('s3816','Italian comic and satirist Saverio Raimondo regales a Milan crowd with tales of online antics, awkward injuries and white-knuckle flights.'),('s3817','As two teen prodigies try to master the art of time travel, a tragic police shooting sends them on a series of dangerous trips to the past.'),('s3818','In 1980s Essex, cocky salesman Vincent Swan and his unscrupulous team will do anything to get the sale – including throwing honesty out the window.'),('s3819','A curious reporter finds love while pursuing the story of a mysterious figure who\'s leaving bags of cash for strangers around New York City.'),('s3820','In th