. Navy Seal team tackles a top-secret mission at a research center where scientists have mysteriously disappeared and another life form awaits.'),('s3937','Ricky Gervais created and stars in this heartwarming comedy-drama series as a loyal English nursing home caretaker who sees only the good in everyone.'),('s3938','Supported by a team of fellow thieves, a con artist lures her targets into matrimony and then absconds with their fortunes in this darkly comic series.'),('s3939','Experience our planet\'s natural beauty and examine how climate change impacts all living creatures in this ambitious documentary of spectacular scope.'),('s3940','An affable, newly appointed college warden proves to be no ordinary man when an old enemy resurfaces and exposes his complicated, violent past.'),('s3941','After a tragedy at a school sends shock waves through a wealthy Stockholm suburb, a seemingly well-adjusted teen finds herself on trial for murder.'),('s3942','In this animated action series, a rookie driver seeks glory in a world-class auto race, but he’ll need more than just his talent behind the wheel.'),('s3943','This stylish mix of documentary and historical epic chronicles the reign of Commodus, the emperor whose rule marked the beginning of Rome\'s fall.'),('s3944','In a small Western town, spunky ex-city girl Lucky forms a tight bond with wild horse Spirit while having adventures with best pals Pru and Abigail.'),('s3945','When a prominent politician is murdered, the intrepid journalists of Frente Tijuana risk their lives to uncover the truth.'),('s3946','After failing out of art school and taking a humdrum office job, a whimsical painter gets a chance to fulfill her lifelong dream of adopting a unicorn.'),('s3947','A reluctant clairvoyant joins forces with a brusque police detective hiding a soft heart to help him solve criminal cases using her psychic abilities.'),('s3948','From how social media can ruin relationships to the perils of buying a gift for a woman, comic Ricardo Quevedo dissects life\'s trials and tribulations.'),('s3949','After a pregnant woman is murdered, her spirit seeks revenge against her increasingly terrified killers, who are determined to finish her off for good.'),('s3950','Shocking secrets begin to unravel when the aftermath of a car crash leaves four best friends questioning the truth of their relationships.'),('s3951','As her family seeks to marry her off and a hopeful writer pursues her, a small-town woman struggles to reveal the long-hidden truth about who she loves.'),('s3952','In early 1990s Malaysia, a Tamilian boy faces pressure from his immigrant father to focus on school but is drawn to his uncles’ lives of crime.'),('s3953','As a father of three on his second marriage, Kevin Hart proves that being him is indeed a tall order in a fresh special inspired by his own mistakes.'),('s3954','This high-energy animated series follows a gutsy kid and his trusty race-car pal as they save their city from bad guys and their scary vehicles.'),('s3955','A college stud tries to level up his relationship with a computer science major after becoming attracted to her skills in an online role-playing game.'),('s3956','When a guileless young woman becomes the domestic worker in a wealthy Dubai household, her bond with her posh employer changes both of their lives.'),('s3957','Seeing the chance to enrich himself by deceiving a blind heiress, clever con man Oh Soo just does what comes naturally – but his plans soon change.'),('s3958','A man returns home to Atlanta to try and turn around his family\'s struggling restaurant with the help of a new chicken recipe.'),('s3959','Decades ago, a hero from the stars left this world in peace. Now, the son of Ultraman must rise to protect the Earth from a new alien threat.'),('s3960','Fifteen years after a traumatic crime, a woman is released from psychiatric care and tries to drive out an evil spirit that continues to haunt her.'),('s3961','When a man is left to die inside an illegal gold mine, his daughter travels through a magical landscape to save him.'),('s3962','Equipped with crayons and his creativity, a boy with autism draws an imaginary world where his animal pals help him tackle real-life situations.'),('s3963','On India\'s Independence Day, a zany mishap in a Mumbai chawl disrupts a young love story while compelling the residents to unite in aid of a little boy.'),('s3964','Alone in Finland, a retired Mexican boxer lives in desolation under the weight of an agonizing past, until he gets a shot at redemption in the ring.'),('s3965','In near-future Paris, two brilliant siblings unveil a high-tech implant designed to pair up soul mates. But the beta test yields unwelcome surprises.'),('s3966','They\'re ordinary husband and wife realtors until she undergoes a dramatic change that sends them down a road of death and destruction. In a good way.'),('s3967','Two steely former Texas Rangers are tasked with tracking and killing infamous criminals Bonnie and Clyde in this crime drama based on real events.'),('s3968','An urban legend about a duffel bag of cocaine buried in the Caribbean leads a misfit band to hatch a nutball plan to find it in this comic documentary.'),('s3969','Social pressure, a complicated past and a clash of values beset the life of a businessman and his family.'),('s3970','As World War II ends, a young English woman agrees to help an enigmatic American agent root out Russian infiltration of the British government.'),('s3971','King Louis XIV of France commissions a lavish palace that becomes a fierce battleground for love and politics – and a gilded prison for nobility.'),('s3972','Seven men and women board a pink bus in search of true love. On a journey through Asia with strangers, their goal is to return to Japan as a couple.'),('s3973','Adapted from a best-selling novel, this horror film shows Risa befriending ghosts until an evil spirit tries to take her sister to the other side.'),('s3974','Polygamy, piety and personal principles collide for a charming and congenial young university student struggling in a four-way love triangle.'),('s3975','Comic Nate Bargatze touches on air travel, cheap weddings, college football, chocolate milk and the perils of ordering coffee in this stand-up special.'),('s3976','An aspiring yet aimless actor takes over his ailing father\'s job as an ambulance driver, unwittingly getting involved in an organ-trafficking network.'),('s3977','A police officer and a drug lord become embroiled in a cycle of revenge, each man bent on taking the other down.'),('s3978','In this adaptation of the comic strip, Juan López must balance an office job with heroic feats to save the love of his life and native planet Chitón.'),('s3979','While investigating a bank robbery, a squad of overweight police officers undergoes rigorous training to shed pounds.'),('s3980','Charlie creates fun stories using different shapes, and he needs your help! Take off for adventures in outer space, the Wild West – and right at home.'),('s3981','In 1994, Mexican presidential candidate Luis Donaldo Colosio\'s assassination sends his dying widow racing to uncover who did it. Based on true events.'),('s3982','As Delhi reels in the aftermath of a gang rape, DCP Vartika Chaturvedi leads a painstaking search for the culprits. Based on the 2012 Nirbhaya case.'),('s3983','A space-time continuum glitch allows Vera to save a boy\'s life 25 years earlier, but results in the loss of her daughter, whom she fights to get back.'),('s3984','The killing of three members of the Miami Showband sent shock waves across Ireland in 1975. Now one survivor doggedly pursues the truth.'),('s3985','In this social drama of sin and remorse, a man reels at the discovery that his wife has been unfaithful, and gives her an ultimatum.'),('s3986','In this unflinching biopic based on Mötley Crüe\'s best-selling book, four LA misfits navigate the monster highs and savage lows of music superstardom.'),('s3987','Seven years after vanishing from her home, a young woman returns with mysterious new abilities and recruits five strangers for a secret mission.'),('s3988','With heart and determination, Antoine Griezmann overcame his small stature to become one of the world’s top soccer players and a World Cup champion.'),('s3989','Staying at home doesn\'t mean sitting still for energetic Bo and her little dragon friend Dezzy, who embark on amazing adventures through movement.'),('s3990','She\'s the most unlikely candidate to ever stumble into the role of a reporter, and she’s keeping everyone on their toes with her eccentric ways.'),('s3991','Now a celebrity, Benjie is tasked with taking care of a General\'s young son, who has information about a looming terrorist threat.'),('s3992','Following his best friend\'s death, Arci takes charge of her two boisterous children with some help from their gang-affiliated uncle.'),('s3993','When aspiring fashion designer Andi reconnects with her ex-boyfriend Max, she\'s surprised to learn that he\'s in a relationship with a man.'),('s3994','Tired of her husband\'s cheating, Anne begins a passionate new relationship – while still wondering if she should give her marriage another chance.'),('s3995','Love can be complicated, especially when Vince agrees to secretly woo Kath via text on behalf of James – while falling for her, too.'),('s3996','After being shot during a robbery in Colombia and losing sensation in his legs, Uruguayan soccer star Alexis Viera finds a new sense of purpose.'),('s3997','As a psychology professor faces Alzheimer\'s, his daughter and her three close female friends experience romance, marriage, heartbreak and tragedy.'),('s3998','A teen with vitiligo struggles with self-doubt and anxiety until a new schoolteacher sees her through a different lens, and urges her to do the same.'),('s3999','Kumiko and Kenichi meet in college and build a happy marriage together. But over time, an unusual problem threatens to destroy their relationship.'),('s4000','Amy Schumer spills on her new marriage, personal growth, making a baby and her mom\'s misguided advice in a special that\'s both raunchy and sincere.'),('s4001','A couple finds unexpected drama when, after 40 years of living in the same Brooklyn walk-up, they attempt to sell their apartment and buy a new one.'),('s4002','A troubled psychologist returns from the U.S. and sets up a clinic in Taiwan, where mysterious patients and uncanny events shed light on his murky past.'),('s4003','A PR agent trying to find her stolen phone, a politician in trouble, and a fading celebrity find their lives intertwining in unexpected, messy ways.'),('s4004','When his son\'s mom runs afoul of Paris\'s criminal underworld, a thrill-seeking superbike racer begins moonlighting as a drug courier to clear her debt.'),('s4005','Italian comedian Edoardo Ferrario riffs on life at 30 and unpacks the peculiarities of global travel, social media and people who like craft beer.'),('s4006','Fifteen-year-old ballet dancer Lara faces physical and emotional hurdles as she prepares for gender confirmation surgery. Inspired by a true story.'),('s4007','Eduard, a husband and father who loses his family in a tragic accident, travels to parallel universes to seek a better fate for his beloved wife.'),('s4008','Playing straight man to partners half his size, ventriloquist Jeff Dunham – one of America\'s funniest comics – slays audiences across the country.'),('s4009','Politically incorrect and often raunchy humor pepper ventriloquist Dunham\'s live concert performance featuring characters Walter, Achmed and Peanut.'),('s4010','Jeff Dunham returns with a haunted house full of his hysterical entourage, and each character stars in its own horror movie trailer.'),('s4011','Politically incorrect, sometimes raunchy ventriloquist Jeff Dunham is joined by his irreverent cast of characters in this hilarious Christmas special.'),('s4012','Injuries sidelined the bright career of New York Yankees pitcher Chien-Ming Wang. This documentary captures his relentless battle back to the majors.'),('s4013','After their mother\'s death, Amal and her brothers struggle to live with their authoritarian father, whose cruelty and neglect break the family apart.'),('s4014','Naval unit PASKAL is among the most elite special forces in Malaysia. But all bets are off when one of its own stages a hijacking. Based on true events.'),('s4015','A boy and his homemade robot enter the toughest competition in the universe while attempting to free their oppressed home from an evil empire.'),('s4016','The documentary takes a detailed look at the disappearance of 3-year-old Madeleine McCann, who vanished while on holiday with her family.'),('s4017','A down-and-out DJ plots to rebuild his music career while working as a nanny for his famous best friend\'s wild 11-year-old daughter.'),('s4018','Self-made millionaire Ian thinks he\'s found happiness when he marries caring Joanna, but his love is put to the test when he meets stewardess Karyn.'),('s4019','While pursuing a degree in Spain, an architecture student struggling with grief meets a fellow expatriate trying to flee a difficult family life.'),('s4020','A hard-driving real estate tycoon who becomes ill with cancer hires a medical caretaker who helps her begin to mend fences with her estranged son.'),('s4021','After a woman is very publicly left at the altar, the PR expert hired to fix the situation winds up falling in love with her.'),('s4022','A dying father asks his busy and grown children to spend their Sundays with him, forcing his family to confront their issues before it\'s too late.'),('s4023','After her son dies in an accident, a legal consultant is forced to prove her innocence when she\'s accused of his murder.'),('s4024','A hardworking man in a thankless job meets a mysterious doctor who sells him powerful pills that throw his life into disarray.'),('s4025','Loyalties are tested when five former special forces operatives reunite to steal a drug lord\'s fortune, unleashing a chain of unintended consequences.'),('s4026','Nothing is off limits as Jimmy Carr serves up the most outrageous jokes from his stand-up career in a special that\'s not for the faint of heart.'),('s4027','In 1940s Port Said, Kariman finds comfort and solace in the arms of an unhappily married man, who also happens to be her abusive husband\'s brother.'),('s4028','The lives of a wealthy couple hiding their marital problems intersect with a group of hackers and the young women they exploit.'),('s4029','Dreaming of escaping to a distant city, a ferocious warrior and a mysterious boy tangle with territorial warlords and their highly trained killers.'),('s4030','A loving couple become rivals when Belle opens a fusion bistro next to her ex-boyfriend Kram’s traditional restaurant in Bangkok’s chic Ari district.'),('s4031','A university lecturer in Russia returns to Egypt after her husband\'s sudden disappearance, uncovering further mysteries the more she investigates.'),('s4032','In this sequel, a group of expert drivers skilled in drifting and high-speed racing is recruited to perform obscure tasks for a shadowy gang.'),('s4033','Driven by revenge, human-turned-vampire Mia sets out to vanquish Dmitry, a ruthless vampire leader who seeks an artifact that grants immortality.'),('s4034','Burdened by troubles in life and love, a mother of three grown children searches for hope and healing on an impromptu trip to Paper Moon, Montana.'),('s4035','When her romance with a lustful marquis takes an unwelcome turn, a wealthy widow concocts a scheme to get revenge – with help from a younger woman.'),('s4036','A woman struggling with sleep paralysis begins a complicated relationship with the director of a media company, whose colleagues conspire against him.'),('s4037','In the wake of an accident that leaves her paralyzed, a champion rodeo rider vows to get back on her horse and compete again. Based on a true story.'),('s4038','When a perfectionist ad exec experiences a romantic setback, she embarks on a journey of self-discovery that begins with a dramatic hair makeover.'),('s4039','Two half siblings separated by family conflict cross paths as adults at a fashion agency – but one of them has a vendetta, unbeknownst to the other.'),('s4040','An architecture student and a history professor fall in love, pursue a dream, split up and bump into each other years later. Can there be a second chance?'),('s4041','A devastating breakup with her boyfriend may be the start of a new beginning for Mace, thanks to an adventurous and kind stranger named Anthony.'),('s4042','Feeling betrayed by their romantic partners\' infidelity, Adrianne and Vince struggle to forgive while finding comfort with each other.'),('s4043','This anthology series dramatizes historic criminal cases in the U.S., including the O.J. Simpson trial and Andrew Cunanan\'s 1997 murder spree.'),('s4044','A student\'s protest leads to a government scandal that has personal and professional repercussions for one of Australia\'s toughest journalists.'),('s4045','A self-serving mythical creature\'s bid for invincibility backfires when he finds himself at the mercy of a woman who can see otherworldly beings.'),('s4046','After learning his brother died on a mission in Romania, a former soldier teams up with two allies to hunt down a mysterious enemy and exact revenge.'),('s4047','While patiently waiting for her boyfriend to come out of his coma, Audrey finds herself falling for the caring and successful Ethan.'),('s4048','A happily married man gives in to temptation when a wealthy client pursues him, setting off a torrid love triangle.'),('s4049','High schooler Haruna befriends loner Yamada, then is drawn into the tangled relationship between him, a model and the girl who loves him unreasonably.'),('s4050','A ruthless businessman’s mission to expose electoral fraud brings him into a heated and dangerous political conflict with two corrupt ministers.'),('s4051','Speaking to retailers and owners of the Glock pistol, two filmmakers shed light on the politics of violence and its implications from Chicago to Kirkuk.'),('s4052','This intimate documentary follows rock star Artiwara Kongmalai on his historic, 2,215-kilometer charity run across Thailand in 2017.'),('s4053','Members of the Thai idol girl group BNK48 open up about their experiences beyond the spotlight, their training and the nature of fame.'),('s4054','Two best friends put their careers and marriages on the line when they launch a business hosting outrageous, anything-goes bachelor parties in Hungary.'),('s4055','Follow Indian Premier League champions Mumbai Indians through the 2018 season in this series featuring insider insights and intense cricket action.'),('s4056','Stranded on a tropical island, two silly larva buddies find slapstick fun in everything from discovering food to meeting new animal friends.'),('s4057','In a \"winning is everything\"\" society'),('s4058','After the sudden death of his wife, search and rescue commander John West relocates with his three kids to his rural hometown of Turtle Island Bay.'),('s4059','Jealous girlfriends and aliens are just some of the things Jack lied about to become popular. Now the lies are coming to life and ruining everything.'),('s4060','When a young man becomes possessed after playing a Ouija game, a ghost hunter investigates the evil spirit dwelling within him.'),('s4061','Shy student Tara has a secret identity: She is smooth-talking Radio Rebel, a DJ who lends her voice to all kids, popular and unpopular alike.'),('s4062','An aspiring musician battles age-old caste divides to be able to learn the art of a classical instrument from a traditionalist, veteran percussionist.'),('s4063','Inspired by a science book, 13-year-old William Kamkwamba builds a wind turbine to save his Malawian village from famine. Based on a true story.'),('s4064','High school sophomore Kusuo Saiki swore as a child that he would keep his psychic talents hidden, but his abilities still make his life difficult.'),('s4065','An ex-colonel forms a special paramilitary group focused on combatting drug trafficking on the Paraguayan border.'),('s4066','When city-raised twins move to a tumbledown country mansion, it\'s quite an adjustment – especially after they uncover a magical fantasy world.'),('s4067','After his son is brutally beaten outside a nightclub, a surgeon takes the law into his own hands and seeks vengeance against the perpetrators.'),('s4068','When a near-drowning leaves a famous singer from the \'90s with amnesia, she hires a karaoke singer who can imitate her to prep her for a comeback tour.'),('s4069','Following their storybook wedding, Popoy and Basha find married life – and starting a business together – more challenging than they ever imagined.'),('s4070','Finding himself in a desperate situation, undercover agent Emman asks his former best friend, Erika, to join him on a dangerous mission.'),('s4071','Rocco needs to hire a bride so he can access his trust fund. Rocky desperately needs a job. Their marriage starts out fake, but ends up as much more.'),('s4072','Gab is eager to tie the knot with her handsome boyfriend, but there\'s a problem, and it\'s a doozy: She\'s already married to a total stranger.'),('s4073','When her son comes out to her as gay, a religious mother struggles to reconcile his truth with her own beliefs and their orthodox family values.'),('s4074','Four sisters unite to stop their young brother\'s pending nuptials upon meeting his fiancée’s demanding family, revealing long-simmering family issues.'),('s4075','Laida and Miggy used to be in love, but now they\'re forced to work together in a professional capacity – and neither is completely over their past.'),('s4076','Popular blogger Cali is hired for a marketing campaign alongside another viral sensation: her ex-boyfriend Gio, who\'s intent on winning her back.'),('s4077','To make another woman jealous, a campus heartthrob asks a fellow student to be his pretend girlfriend, but fate has other plans for the fake couple.'),('s4078','A rock musician and a law student whose true passion is music fall in love and pursue a romance that complicates both of their blossoming careers.'),('s4079','The mistress of a wealthy businessman is torn between her loyalty to him and her love for a young architect connected to her in unexpected ways.'),('s4080','Ride along for a dramatized version of the real-life investigations into the murders of rap icons Tupac Shakur and Biggie Smalls.'),('s4081','The unorthodox, piano-playing stand-up star Zach Galifianakis makes a splash on the scene and serves up a healthy dose of his signature wit.'),('s4082','When authorities jail his son for rejecting religious bias, a poor father’s struggle to bail him out highlights rural India’s enduring casteism.'),('s4083','A Catalán prisoner at a Nazi concentration camp uses his office job to steal photo negatives of the atrocities committed there. Based on true events.'),('s4084','From his run-in with a grizzly bear to partying with the Russian mafia, the shirtless comic returns with laugh-out-loud tales in this stand-up special.'),('s4085','In this Emmy-nominated docuseries, find out what\'s inside the kitchens and minds of the international culinary stars who are redefining gourmet food.'),('s4086','While she successfully advocates for her female clients in difficult divorce cases, a lawyer’s trauma from sexual assault impacts her own marriage.'),('s4087','After he\'s diagnosed with terminal cancer, middle-aged Michael asks his neighbor friend Andy to help him end his life before the disease does.'),('s4088','Amid a turbulent romance and rising tensions in Paris, a young woman finds herself caught in a dizzying spiral of dreams, memories and what-ifs.'),('s4089','An older woman\'s unique friendship with a young boy inspires her to examine the strained relationship she shares with her married son.'),('s4090','In this unscripted series, families passionate about food serve up their most delicious dishes for the chance to be crowned Britain\'s best home cooks.'),('s4091','Fading music biz veteran Zé realizes he has just one more chance at redemption: He must assemble a hit boy band from a ragtag group of pop newbies.'),('s4092','A petty smuggler from Busan dives headfirst into illicit drug trafficking in the 1970s and rises to become king of narcotics exports to Japan.'),('s4093','The film and television star riffs on life\'s many royal pains in this hourlong special taped at New York City\'s Hudson Theatre in 2001.'),('s4094','Powerlifter Matt Kroczaleski faced his greatest challenge when he came out as transgender. This documentary captures his transition into a woman.'),('s4095','Extreme pressure from his father to excel at school during childhood has dangerous psychological effects on a brilliant but suicidal man’s adult life.'),('s4096','A hard-driving submarine captain is hired to steal gold from a sunken Nazi sub, but there\'s no honor among thieves during this underwater heist.'),('s4097','This documentary follows the rapid rise and fall of the Manhattan discotheque and the glittery debauchery that attracted the city\'s eccentric and elite.'),('s4098','Disparate characters, including an aspiring time traveler, a phony chef, a drug-addicted waitress and several others, share a surprising connection.'),('s4099','With his carefree bachelor days behind him, a young entrepreneur’s ambitions for adulthood come with some painful personal and professional decisions.'),('s4100','Meet the growing, worldwide community of theorists who defend the belief that the Earth is flat while living in a society who vehemently rejects it.'),('s4101','Inspired by the movie \"Thelma & Louise'),('s4102','On the incandescent shores of Goa, a young man tumbles down a mind-bending – and soon dangerous – series of trips after taking hallucinatory drugs.'),('s4103','While taking shelter from a Mumbai monsoon, an investment banker forms an unlikely connection with a naïve prostitute over the course of the night.'),('s4104','Killed too soon due to a clerical error in heaven, a man is sent back to earth with a new lease on life, this time in the body of his portly friend.'),('s4105','This miniseries spinoff of \"Rita\"\" follows teacher Hjørdis as she plans a school play on bullying featuring a cast of socially awkward students.\"'),('s4106','Legendary comedy writer and director Larry Charles travels the world in search of humor in the most unusual, unexpected and dangerous places.'),('s4107','When a blind chef’s girlfriend goes missing, his unnerving search for her leads him to find there\'s more to her disappearance than what meets the eye.'),('s4108','A commitment-phobe agrees to marry his girlfriend, setting in motion a series of hilarious mishaps that has him questioning what he got himself into.'),('s4109','A renowned music teacher mentors a promising young singer, but when her fame begins to overshadow his own, he lets jealousy and competition take over.'),('s4110','This docuseries disputes the Mexican government\'s account of how and why 43 students from Ayotzinapa Rural Teachers\' College vanished in Iguala in 2014.'),('s4111','For the right price, BFFs Jen and Mel will ruthlessly end any romance. But when one of them grows a conscience, their friendship begins to unravel.'),('s4112','In the midnight hour, a lone DJ broadcasts the strangest – and scariest – tales from the outer edges of Kirlian, a lost city somewhere in Argentina.'),('s4113','Everyday guy Kabir is thrown for a loop when he meets Kuhu, a freewheeling party girl. Now, he\'s a changed man, dancing, running half-naked through the streets and donning ladies\' shoes at her whim.'),('s4114','Competing con artists attempt to creatively and ruthlessly swindle a fatherly lottery winner while on a lively cruise from Spain to Mexico.'),('s4115','Get to know Barbie and her BFFs – including next-door neighbor Ken – in this animated vlog of adventures filmed inside her family\'s new dreamhouse.'),('s4116','In his first-ever stand-up special, Ken Jeong pays tribute to his wife and shares stories about Hollywood and how \"The Hangover\"\" saved his life.\"'),('s4117','In the late \'60s, fashion designer Ana enlists friends Clara, Pedro and Raúl to open a store and design school in Barcelona in this \"Velvet\"\" spinoff.\"'),('s4118','In rural India, where the stigma of menstruation persists, women make low-cost sanitary pads on a new machine and stride toward financial independence.'),('s4119','Three 30-something women in high-level jobs at a beauty e-commerce firm seem to have it all – except when it comes to love and romantic chemistry.'),('s4120','A police detective mourning a painful loss moves back to his peaceful hometown, only to be drawn into a murder case that dredges up dark secrets.'),('s4121','When an NBA lockout sidelines his big rookie client, an agent hatches a bold plan to save their careers – and disrupt the league\'s power structure.'),('s4122','Kevin Hart highlights the fascinating contributions of black history’s unsung heroes in this entertaining – and educational – comedy special.'),('s4123','In a reimagining of the TV classic, a newly single Latina mother raises her teen daughter and tween son with the \"help\"\" of her old-school mom.\"'),('s4124','While Sam Cooke rose to stardom as a soul singer, his outspoken views on civil rights drew attention that may have contributed to his death at age 33.'),('s4125','As a young couple write the story of their families\' shared history, both reveal their relatives\' dark secrets and one must make a painful confession.'),('s4126','The year is 2041 and a dispute between a man and his wife has set the human race back. In this battle of the sexes, the primitive life isn\'t so simple.'),('s4127','While investigating an actress’s supposed suicide and her connection to the mafia, a veteran journalist discovers that corruption runs deep.'),('s4128','The police officers at South Korea\'s busiest patrol division toil day and night as keepers of law and peace – but the reality is far from orderly.'),('s4129','Ray Romano cut his stand-up teeth at the Comedy Cellar in New York. Now, in his first comedy special in 23 years, he returns to where it all began.'),('s4130','After his teenage daughter goes missing, a widowed surgeon in an affluent neighborhood begins unearthing dark secrets about the people closest to him.'),('s4131','An Egyptian doctor becomes a police informant and uses his rare gift of tracking ancient artifacts in the smuggling business.'),('s4132','The war is over, and Violet Evergarden needs a job. Scarred and emotionless, she takes a job as a letter writer to understand herself and her past.'),('s4133','A gifted writer who\'s the youngest editor-in-chief ever at his publishing company gets enmeshed in the life of a former copywriter desperate for a job.'),('s4134','A family’s tense reunion turns terrifying when they get trapped in their home by an unknown force, and sinister commands begin appearing on their TV.'),('s4135','When caste discrimination prevents a villager from giving his deceased father a rightful burial, he takes his fight for equality to court.'),('s4136','A Google executive boldly attempts a death-defying mission to travel to space and free-fall back to Earth without a rocket.'),('s4137','A teen navigates a bitter feud between his willful mom and a free-spirited man, who\'s the lover and insurance beneficiary of his recently deceased dad.'),('s4138','Love is in the air as Zoe and friends go on a quest to find a fabled Maid\'s Stone. But when rivalry blinds them to danger, it\'s Raven to the rescue!'),('s4139','When Superman and the other Justice League superheroes start disappearing, it\'s up to Batman to unravel the caper and save the day.'),('s4140','When Thanos joins forces with villains Killmonger and Klaue to destroy Earth, Black Panther rushes to stop them from stealing Wakanda\'s vibranium.'),('s4141','The Guardians are on a mission to deliver the Build Stone to the Avengers before the Ravagers, Thanos and his underlings steal it from them.'),('s4142','In Paw-Tucket, pets of all types form friendships, pursue their passions and have a great time being themselves.'),('s4143','Nadia keeps dying and reliving her 36th birthday party. She\'s trapped in a surreal time loop – and staring down the barrel of her own mortality.'),('s4144','While investigating the mysterious death of a teacher, a grizzled detective gets caught up in the world of a high-stakes virtual reality game.'),('s4145','College student Karen takes up Gun Gale Online and gets a reputation as the Pink Demon. Then her gaming buddy Pitohui asks her to join the Squad Jam.'),('s4146','True and Bartleby try to cheer up the Rainbow Kingdom’s loneliest citizen, but his gloomy mood is contagious! Can a trio of wishes turn things around?'),('s4147','A feared critic, an icy gallery owner and an ambitious assistant snap up a recently deceased artist\'s stash of paintings – with dire consequences.'),('s4148','When Kak Limah turns up dead shortly after her marriage to a much younger man, her pesky ghost haunts the villagers, who can\'t seem to get rid of her.'),('s4149','Cherie and Jimmy\'s relationship is in a rut – until Cherie\'s estranged father shows up and a woman from Jimmy\'s past shows up with a hidden agenda.'),('s4150','Stan and Olivia – the amazingly different Paprika twins – use their boundless enthusiasm to turn everyday life into an extraordinary adventure.'),('s4151','The tale of legendary warrior king Ranjit Singh, and his rise to establishing Punjab’s Sikh empire, comes to life in this animated feature.'),('s4152','A man is disheartened when he visits his well-to-do son and grandkids in Australia and sees they have detached from their traditional Indian morals.'),('s4153','In this heart-wrenching coming-of-age story, a young boy embarks on an arduous trek with his debt-ridden father to sell their beloved family donkey.'),('s4154','Gabriel \"Fluffy\"\" Iglesias discusses his teenage son and encounters with Snoop Dogg'),('s4155','A deputy curator of a chaebol-funded art gallery and her husband, a politically ambitious economics professor, will do anything to join the über-elite.'),('s4156','A grieving filmmaker struggling to keep custody of his young son after his wife\'s death uses magical, imaginary stories to maintain their bond.'),('s4157','This documentary follows a white power leader and an Antifa activist leading up to the Charlottesville riots in the first year of Trump\'s presidency.'),('s4158','This companion to 2016\'s \"Rudy Habibie\"\" traces the relationship between Indonesia’s third president and his wife behind the scenes of their public lives.\"'),('s4159','Reeling from the loss of her husband, a widow struggles to fulfill her physical and emotional desires despite social taboos around female sexuality.'),('s4160','A biopic that explores the hardships and triumphs of the early life of B. J. Habibie, a transformative president of Indonesia.'),('s4161','After saving an unwed expectant mother who\'s injured in a car accident, a happily married man takes her as his second wife – without telling his first.'),('s4162','In this sequel to the award-winning 2015 film, Pras, Arini and Meirose face new challenges that could change the dynamic of their unique love triangle.'),('s4163','A Taipei doctor and a San Francisco engineer swap homes in a daring pact, embarking on journeys filled with trials, secrets and unexpected encounters.'),('s4164','A team embarks on a perilous cross-country mission to transport the one man who survived a deadly zombie virus, hoping he holds the key to a vaccine.'),('s4165','Brash ladies\' man Gregorio \"Goyo\"\" del Pilar rises to become one of the Philippines\' youngest generals in this historical epic sequel to \"\"Heneral Luna.\"\"\"'),('s4166','A teen\'s eerie visions become increasingly frequent and terrifying after her longtime friend gets a girlfriend and his abusive dad is strangely killed.'),('s4167','Adopted by a human rights attorney after the Rwandan genocide, legal investigator Kate Ashby confronts her past when she takes on war crimes cases.'),('s4168','A brother and sister battle high expectations and each other after inheriting a soccer team. A series from the creators of “Nosotros los Nobles.”'),('s4169','Allegations of child sexual abuse in Spain\'s Catholic institutions are examined in interviews with survivors, clergy, journalists and other experts.'),('s4170','A sly art dealer tries to revive the career of his longtime pal, a surly painter, with a risky plan that tests their morals and friendship.'),('s4171','An assassin on the verge of retirement must put the good life on hold when his greedy boss sends a squad of young, ruthless killers to take him out.'),('s4172','A night market vendor clashes with a lofty celebrity chef in a culinary challenge, fueling the first sparks of a romance.'),('s4173','Present-day interviews, archival footage and audio recordings made on death row form a searing portrait of notorious serial killer Ted Bundy.'),('s4174','Inspired by his love affair with a conservative lawyer, the lead singer of a struggling garage band pens a hit song that propels him to fame.'),('s4175','In a peaceful, rustic town, a retired officer and his family are mired in a murder mystery riddled with shocking, buried secrets.'),('s4176','When attackers target the heiress she\'s protecting, battle-hardened bodyguard Sam scrambles to save her client – and teach her how to fight back.'),('s4177','The Fyre Festival was billed as a luxury music experience on a posh private island, but it failed spectacularly in the hands of a cocky entrepreneur.'),('s4178','As a young scientist searches for a way to save a dying Earth, she finds a connection with a man who\'s racing to catch the last shuttle off the planet.'),('s4179','A former Marine out to punish the criminals responsible for his family\'s murder finds himself ensnared in a military conspiracy.'),('s4180','Losing her memory – and her boyfriend – after a car accident, Jia-en crosses paths with a heart transplant recipient who helps her recall her past.'),('s4181','This documentary captures the environmental and societal impact of Brazil\'s Cerrado savanna suffering from severe deforestation.'),('s4182','Paco Ignacio Taibo II brings his book trilogy to life, highlighting Mexico\'s history in 1854-1867, a period he considers foundational to the country.'),('s4183','While fighting crimes against women in Delhi, a short-fused policewoman and her level-headed female boss grapple with gender issues in their own lives.'),('s4184','Award-winning architect Piers Taylor and actress/property enthusiast Caroline Quentin travel the world to tour unconventional homes in extreme places.'),('s4185','In this funny and provocative series, rapper and activist Killer Mike puts his revolutionary ideas about achieving social change into action.'),('s4186','In this true crime documentary, a family falls prey to the manipulative charms of a neighbor, who abducts their adolescent daughter. Twice.'),('s4187','Inspired by real events, this drama follows a trucker jailed after driving five ill-fated travelers across Quetta, and the officer taking on his case.'),('s4188','A fast-footed piglet named Bunty becomes an object of desire for rival criminals that want the swift swine for their profitable animal-racing schemes.'),('s4189','After kidnapping a millionaire’s daughter, two men get swept up in a power struggle as her father enlists a brilliant cop to hunt them down.'),('s4190','Before one of them moves to the U.S., two childhood friends promise to reunite as adults. But illness and the vagaries of the heart stand in the way.'),('s4191','Looking for a way out of his impoverished life, a lowly hotel waiter joins an underground fight club. Then he needs a way out of that.'),('s4192','When their daughter exhibits strange behavior after moving into their new home, a couple must come to terms with who she really is.'),('s4193','Hell-bent on avenging the murder of his family, a former detective infiltrates a remote island that serves as a prison for vicious death row criminals.'),('s4194','Sebastian Maniscalco brings an acerbically unique approach to peacocks on planes, life hacks, rich in-laws and life\'s annoyances in this comedy special.'),('s4195','Eerie things begin to happen after a man gives his wife a doll, unaware it once belonged to a girl who was murdered. The first of the \"Doll\"\" films.\"'),('s4196','A mother uses her deceased daughter’s doll as a medium to communicate with her, but the consequences are chilling. The second of the “Doll” films.'),('s4197','Reminiscing about his youth in Taiwan\'s turbulent 1920s, Guo Xuehu reflects on his passion for art, a friendship with a painter – and a doomed romance.'),('s4198','A wide-eyed graduate learns the ugly side of ambition when he joins in the dubious business practices of his idol, a ruthless Mumbai stock tycoon.'),('s4199','Two strangers meet on a dating app and experience instant chemistry, but their relationship unravels as jarring differences catch up to them.'),('s4200','New beginnings or old baggage? Four singles have one chance to reignite romance with an ex – or leave the past behind for good.'),('s4201','Twenty years after graduation, a tight-knit group of college friends reconnects and discovers that love hasn\'t gotten easier with age.'),('s4202','A circle of young men entertain vague ambitions involving quick cash, women and showbiz in this mockumentary on small-town Irish life in County Mayo.'),('s4203','To his family\'s frustration, Henry is skilled at making trouble, from babysitting pets in his bedroom to starting a shark panic at the swimming pool.'),('s4204','The shocking murder of singer Victor Jara in 1973 turned him into a powerful symbol of Chile\'s struggle. Decades later, a quest for justice unfolds.'),('s4205','In a remote area of the Canary Islands, a surfer falls off a cliff. Fighting to survive, he reflects on his life and past romance. Based on true events.'),('s4206','After moving to a retirement home, restless talent manager Al reconnects with long-ago client Buddy and coaxes him back out on the comedy circuit.'),('s4207','Discovery is the name of the game for friendly toddler Pocoyo in this lifelike and richly colored animated adventure series for preschoolers.'),('s4208','Years after a bitter falling out, four Israeli military veterans reunite and travel to Colombia in search of a loved one they\'d presumed to be dead.'),('s4209','With the earth alliance weakened, Haruo weighs siding with the Exif, whose death cult is summoning a monster that can destroy the world.'),('s4210','Clashing views on intimacy lead a couple to go their separate ways to reflect on commitment and companionship, before suddenly crossing paths again.'),('s4211','As the lives of rich and poor passengers aboard a steamship unfold, buried secrets, lustful affairs and selfish desires are exposed.'),('s4212','In this adaptation of a Thai folk tale, a man returns from war to his family, unaware of a sad secret about what happened to them while he was away.'),('s4213','An Icelandic single mom struggling with poverty and a Guinea-Bissauan asylum seeker facing deportation find their lives intertwined in unexpected ways.'),('s4214','Argentine cuarteto singer Rodrigo \"El Potro\"\" Bueno rises to fame amid personal struggles in this dramatization of the charismatic superstar\'s life.\"'),('s4215','When her father falls ill, Adaeze steps up to run the family business – alongside her uncle – and prove herself in a male-dominated world.'),('s4216','A series of mysterious text messages from the future sends ripples through the lives of a delivery woman and an accomplished cyclist.'),('s4217','After losing everything, a prima ballerina accepts a stranger\'s offer to dial back time and reclaim what was taken from her – but at a great price.'),('s4218','The Monty Python comedy clan skewers King Arthur and his Knights of the Round Table as they quest far and wide for the Holy Grail.'),('s4219','The extraordinary Baudelaire orphans face trials, tribulations and the evil Count Olaf in their fateful quest to unlock long-held family secrets.'),('s4220','When a teenager is transported back to his parents’ high school days, he has the chance to alter the events that led to their unhappy marriage.'),('s4221','This global stand-up comedy series features a diverse set of comics from 13 regions bringing their perspectives on what\'s funny around the world.'),('s4222','In southern India, a laborer\'s dreams of owning a piece of land to farm is complicated by political corruption.'),('s4223','Comic Moshe Kasher returns to his home turf of Oakland for this stand-up special that has him sharing uproarious stories about the people he\'s met.'),('s4224','When Ash tries to pick his first Pokémon on his birthday, he ends up with a stubborn Pikachu and they embark on a journey to find the legendary Ho-Oh.'),('s4225','An aspiring music director begins to receive voyeuristic footage of his girlfriend from her apparent stalker as tragedy strikes those around him.'),('s4226','A traditional man and an independent woman share a connection, but they must learn to navigate their vastly different experiences and expectations.'),('s4227','A construction magnate takes over a struggling newspaper and attempts to wield editorial influence for power and personal gain.'),('s4228','In a series of inspiring home makeovers, world-renowned tidying expert Marie Kondo helps clients clear out the clutter – and choose joy.'),('s4229','Comedy Central roast veteran Whitney Cummings gets the stage to herself in this debut special, which finds her riffing on a wide range of topics.'),('s4230','Bill Hicks remembers a wild night in 1989 and offers his views on puffing cigarettes, smoking weed, drinking, sex, commercials and music.'),('s4231','This documentary about comedian Bill Hicks offers insight into his irreverent takes on, well, everything. Brother Steve Hicks is the star witness.'),('s4232','In one of his most iconic performances, late comedian Bill Hicks demonstrates what made him such a singular talent and a force to be reckoned with.'),('s4233','In his final recorded special, the iconoclastic comedian channels Goat Boy and tackles provocative topics like British porn, pot and the priesthood.'),('s4234','Filmed in 1989 at a turning point in comedian Bill Hicks\'s career, this rare onstage performance captures him spouting off on a variety of topics.'),('s4235','British comic Gina Yashere takes the stage in San Francisco, where she shares her thoughts on everything from toilet ninjas to her troublesome name.'),('s4236','Standup comedian and \"Daily Show\"\" correspondent Gina Yashere delivers a sharp set of wry observations on the environment'),('s4237','When street vices keep them coming back, three prisoners make sense of their lives in a penitentiary – and beyond it – through rap.'),('s4238','The one-time preacher shakes and shudders as he tears into subjects including sex, marriage, religion, drugs and famine in this HBO special.'),('s4239','Comic Sam Kinison lets it rip with this performance at L.A.\'s Wiltern theatre, skewering every segment of modern society from religion to television.'),('s4240','Standup legend Sam Kinison is at his screaming best as he storms the stage in Sin City to get a few things off his chest.'),('s4241','Sam\'s brother and former manager Bill Kinison speaks about the late comedian\'s journey from preacher to standup legend.'),('s4242','When three teen outcasts arrive at a hot springs hotel to help run things, creepy incidents prompt comical efforts to find what lurks in their midst.'),('s4243','Taylor Swift takes the stage in Dallas for the reputation Stadium Tour and celebrates a monumental night of music, memories and visual magic.'),('s4244','The Seven Deadly Sins aid the Sky People against a powerful group of demons hellbent on resurrecting a demonic beast sealed over 3,000 years ago.'),('s4245','Standup comedian Tim Allen delivers a set dedicated to \"men stuff\"\" like lawn care'),('s4246','Standup star Tim Allen storms the stage for a set chock-full of observations about powerful cars, beautiful lawns and more of the things he loves.'),('s4247','Flanked by a full orchestra, Tim Minchin takes the Royal Albert Hall by storm with a wonderfully witty evening of satirical musical comedy.'),('s4248','Comedic pianist Tim Minchin performs a host of his catchy songs that touch on everything from the Middle East to the healing power of canvas bags.'),('s4249','Standup comedian Todd Glass gets right down to it, with sly observations on accepting directions, denying compliments and being afraid of the dark.'),('s4250','Comedian Tom Papa riffs on the trials of married life, fatherhood in the 21st century, domestic pets and more in his stand-up show.'),('s4251','This collection restores films from women who tackled hot-button issues, transcended norms, and left a mark on the history of cinema and the industry.'),('s4252','When the head of the lucrative family business passes away, his will leaves the clan at extreme odds.'),('s4253','Future Uruguayan president José Mujica and his fellow Tupamaro political prisoners fight to survive 12 years of solitary confinement and torture.'),('s4254','In 1984, a young programmer begins to question reality as he adapts a dark fantasy novel into a video game. A mind-bending tale with multiple endings.'),('s4255','An honest – though overzealous – police officer strives to do good work while dealing with his bickering parents and incompetent coworkers.'),('s4256','A vengeful son, a cop on a mission, a wannabe actress and a jilted lover find their lives intermingling in unexpected ways over 24 hours in Mumbai.'),('s4257','In Humboldt County, California, the big business of legal marijuana brings in visitors from around the world. Some are never seen again.'),('s4258','Two teen cricket prodigies struggle against their overbearing father and a system stacked against them to realize their own ambitions and identities.'),('s4259','This intimate look at a São Paulo birth center features interviews with mothers, activists, doctors and midwives. Third in a series of films.'),('s4260','After a businessman falls asleep at the wheel and hits a woman with his car, his interactions with her scared friend unleash a string of dark events.'),('s4261','Brian Regan blends his trademark observational stand-up with short sketches and a bit of audience interaction in this hybrid comedy series.'),('s4262','After years in the U.S., a Taiwanese immigrant returns to her hometown with a young daughter in tow to assist her father with his bed-and-breakfast.'),('s4263','A warren of rabbits battles many threats on their daring journey to find a new home in this adaptation of the classic novel by Richard Adams.'),('s4264','To catch three criminal masterminds, a group of cops teams up with a forensic pathologist who can see a murder victim\'s final moments before death.'),('s4265','Spinning old-school beats is just another day at the office for the naive DJs of a pirate radio station who juggle family life with their passion.'),('s4266','Four best friends and spirited career women navigate the treacherous world of romance – even as it stands in the way of work and friendship.'),('s4267','Witness the excitement and drama behind the scenes in the seven days leading up to major live events in the worlds of sports, fashion, space and food.'),('s4268','Troubled by his past, a scam artist who runs a petty racket with his adoptive mom finds redemption while mentoring a group of difficult students.'),('s4269','Five years after an ominous unseen presence drives most of society to suicide, a survivor and her two children make a desperate bid to reach safety.'),('s4270','Diagnosed with a condition that could make her infertile, a career woman must choose one of four bachelors to make a baby with before time runs out.'),('s4271','After causing the near extinction of mankind seven years ago, genius scientist Leon Lau must now fight the ecological disaster he unwittingly created.'),('s4272','After crossing paths at a crime scene, a renowned math teacher and an antiques appraiser embark on an unexpected journey of love and self-discovery.'),('s4273','Radically changed by a misunderstanding 13 years ago, a biotech expert runs into an old flame and suffers an illness that takes her back to the past.'),('s4274','When a singer is found murdered, with her scent glands excised from her body, detectives probe a group of friends who attended boarding school with her.'),('s4275','In imperial Tokyo, a group calling themselves \"Jaegers\"\" secretly hunt the vampires seeking the Ark of Sirius. Among them is young werewolf'),('s4276','Artists in LA discover the work of forgotten Polish sculptor Stanislav Szukalski, a mad genius whose true story unfolds chapter by astounding chapter.'),('s4277','Tasked with risky missions across Turkey, members of a special-operations police unit confront danger and tragedy both on the field and at home.'),('s4278','When an army recruit is found dead, his fellow soldiers are forced to confront a terrifying secret that\'s haunting their jungle island training camp.'),('s4279','While Retsuko desperately makes plans for Christmas Eve, her new obsession with seeking validation through social media spirals out of control.'),('s4280','High school students Rin and Shiro pair up as allies when they\'re chosen to compete in a secret tournament for possession of the Holy Grail.'),('s4281','After a brawl lands him in a Boys’ Home, a teen seems to be on a promising path until loyalty to his gangster buddy leads to even bigger trouble.'),('s4282','After seducing a philandering con man, a rebellious young woman enlists his help in carrying out a heinous crime against her sister.'),('s4283','The life of a radio talk-show host is turned upside down after a murderous caller dials into her program and asks her to choose his next victim.'),('s4284','Entangling the lives of a movie star, a chauffeur, a prostitute and a pimp, this bold drama reveals ugly truths beneath Mumbai’s glitzy veneer.'),('s4285','In her first special since 2003, Ellen revisits her road to stardom and details the heartfelt – and hilarious – lessons she\'s learned along the way.'),('s4286','A woman who\'s about to give birth finds her maternal instincts kicking in when she\'s abducted, imprisoned and brutalized by a vicious gang.'),('s4287','Teddy\'s never missed the Festival of Lights, but the bowling alley’s been snowed in! Not to worry – Emil insists the Christmas moose will save the day.'),('s4288','A visually impaired pianist’s world careens into a series of shocking twists after he unintentionally lands at the murder scene of a former film star.'),('s4289','Hidden away by her mother, the Floral Goddess, the naïve Jinmi is drawn to Xufeng, the Heavenly Emperor\'s son. Yet forces conspire against them.'),('s4290','The \"How to Train Your Dragon\"\" adventure continues when a hunt for lost sheep turns into a fierce'),('s4291','Join your DreamWorks friends for these four holiday specials, featuring Shrek and Donkey, Hiccup and Toothless, and the wacky animals from Madagascar.'),('s4292','In the 1980s, a crusading journalist uncovers secret CIA funding for Nicaraguan rebels, but the powers that be silence his investigation.'),('s4293','A showbiz family revolving around its teen celebrity son desperately tries to hang on to fame and success in this savage satire of Hollywood.'),('s4294','Bruce Springsteen shares personal stories from his life and acoustic versions of some of his best-known songs in an intimate one-man show.'),('s4295','As his esteem grows in the world of physics, Stephen Hawking\'s body is ravaged by ALS, forcing his increasing dependence on his devoted wife, Jane.'),('s4296','Venturing into the woods, high schooler James discovers an intelligent robot that he must save from the hands of a businessman with an evil scheme.'),('s4297','Between a troubled marriage, a senile granny and twin siblings constantly in rivalry, a crumbling household struggles to barely keep it together.'),('s4298','When a tour guide in Japan goes blind after seeing her fiancé’s infidelity, she befriends a fellow Filipino keen to coax her out of the darkness.'),('s4299','English singer-songwriter George Ezra performs his standout songs and speaks about his transformation from aspiring bassist to pop star.'),('s4300','Between shots of live performances, Tom Meighan and Sergio Pizzorno of the English rock band talk about the 20-plus years of making music together.'),('s4301','Exclusive interviews, live performances and studio recording sessions offer an intimate look at how OneRepublic became the successful band it is today.'),('s4302','In addition to concert scenes and studio recording sessions, this documentary presents exclusive interviews of the five men from the Irish rock band.'),('s4303','An eclectic group of fans of 1966\'s \"The Good'),('s4304','Shyam wakes to discover he\'s suspected in a murder that one journalist believes may have ties to a mysterious gangster.'),('s4305','During the Japanese colonial period, married playwright Kim U-jin falls in love with soprano Yun Sim-deok, one of Korea’s notable New Women.'),('s4306','Exposing a rarely seen perspective on the drug wars, ex-Special Forces commando Jason Fox interviews dangerous traffickers and cartel members.'),('s4307','Director Alfonso Cuarón delivers a vivid, emotional portrait of domestic life and social hierarchy set against Mexico\'s political turmoil of the 1970s.'),('s4308','Comedians Jimmy Carr, D.L. Hughley and Katherine Ryan tackle the world\'s woes with help from a rotating crew of funny guests and an actual expert.'),('s4309','This documentary adaptation of John Grisham\'s only nonfiction book raises troubling questions about two murder cases in Ada, Oklahoma, in the 1980s.'),('s4310','Ex-con Cal McTeer\'s return to her hometown of Orphelin Bay blows the lid off a generations-long conspiracy of silence around murder, drugs and Sirens.'),('s4311','A federal agent tracks four people who suddenly seem to possess entirely new personalities, leading to a startling discovery about humanity\'s future.'),('s4312','In an all-new series, five unlikely heroes and their flying robot lions unite to form the megapowerful Voltron and defend the universe from evil.'),('s4313','To pay for an epic blunder, three yakuza brothers are forced to alter their bodies, form a girl group and break into the underground J-Pop idol scene.'),('s4314','In this documentary short, a diverse group of men and women discuss their personal journeys as they prepare for the U.S. citizenship test.'),('s4315','The world\'s got a lot of problems, but Vir Das has a lot of answers as he discusses travel, religion, his childhood and more in this stand-up special.'),('s4316','When the Italian prime minister meets his lover and political rival while on an official trip to Budapest during Christmas week, things go topsy-turvy.'),('s4317','Two cops investigate the murder of a famous Turkish-German soccer player, but one of them has underworld connections that mire the case in controversy.'),('s4318','To prove a point about measuring up and fitting in, Texas teen Willowdean Dickson enters a local pageant run by her ex-beauty queen mom.'),('s4319','As Bright Fields preps for its Mistletoe Ball, a broken ornament leads Zoe to a family secret, while Gaby finds herself at the mercy of new boss Mia.'),('s4320','An orphaned boy raised by animals in the jungle seizes his destiny while confronting a dangerous enemy – and his own human origins.'),('s4321','Joined by his faithful mecha-butler, Kaz Kaan pursues love, fashion and supernatural forces amid Neo Yokio\'s sinister high society.'),('s4322','At top-secret U.S.-Australian joint defense facility Pine Gap, fissures appear in the critical alliance as spies work with, and against, each other.'),('s4323','Run-DMC DJ Jam Master Jay made a huge impact in music and his community. But friends and family still seek closure years after his unsolved murder.'),('s4324','Christmas wishes come true for Lobo, whose favorite cousin arrives for a surprise visit, and for Glorb, who wishes he could be everywhere at once!'),('s4325','Social media stars Paris Hilton, Josh Ostrovsky, Brittany Furlan and Kirill Bichutsky hustle to build online empires – and face the pitfalls of fame.'),('s4326','Russell Brand gets loquacious in London as he ruminates on the state of the world and marvels over how his life changed the moment he became a father.'),('s4327','Webtoonist Cho Seok is back with more anecdotes of mix-ups, unintended antics, and bathroom blunders in this reboot starring an all-new cast.'),('s4328','While looking for the cryptic creator of an innovative augmented-reality game, an investment firm executive meets a woman who runs a hostel in Spain.'),('s4329','A gangster hires goon Teefa to abduct his friend’s daughter for an arranged marriage, but things get tricky when Teefa develops feelings for the girl.'),('s4330','After meeting under awkward circumstances, a glamorous businesswoman and a tradition-bound policeman begin a relationship that changes their lives.'),('s4331','A contract killer skilled at staging lethal accidents fears he may be a victim of his own strategy when an accomplice dies in a mysterious mishap.'),('s4332','Delving into the disappearance of 43 college students in Mexico, this documentary seeks to give justice and a voice to the victims and their families.'),('s4333','After Amalie\'s dad goes bankrupt, the young dancer\'s affluent life collapses. But she finds a new beat to follow after meeting hip-hop dancer Mikael.'),('s4334','When a cop loses his vision, his detecting skills stay sharp. Luckily, a rookie officer recognizes his extraordinary powers of deduction.'),('s4335','After their 99th breakup, a career woman and her carefree partner open a cafe where customers can put up souvenirs of past relationships.'),('s4336','Three petty criminals find themselves in a pickle when police wrongly charge them with the murder of an important politician.'),('s4337','In Kuala Lumpur, an abused domestic worker tries to escape to Indonesia, while an idealistic cop insists on fighting corruption  – at a heavy price.'),('s4338','A financial analyst succumbs to a love triangle with a hard-drinking architect and a promiscuous investment bro, who soon becomes her boss.'),('s4339','Zixin is about to marry Qihong, but her gallivanting ex returns to wreak havoc as mistaken identities and love triangles stir up the lovers\' paradise.'),('s4340','When a man is arrested on arrival in America because authorities mistake him for a wanted gangster, a new friend tries to help him prove his innocence.'),('s4341','With help from a 102-year-old goblin dwelling beneath their haunted apartment building, two siblings deal with ghosts and take on spooky mysteries.'),('s4342','When master criminal Helios steals a mobile WMD, rival agents from Hong Kong, South Korea and China must join forces to recover the device.'),('s4343','A Hong Kong intelligence officer tasked with finding undercover agents whose identities have been erased finds herself in the paths of rival triads.'),('s4344','While keeping his identity secret, a real estate billionaire tries to woo an outspoken croupier who talks gamblers out of losing their money.'),('s4345','In this \"Oddbods\"\" special'),('s4346','Two former triads are tapped to run in an election for leader of the underworld, but both want normal lives. Each must outwit the other to lose.'),('s4347','Retired, restless and constantly butting heads with his son, a former stuntman escapes on a road trip that becomes a journey to find his first love.'),('s4348','Backed by a crew of unlikely allies, newly sober paraplegic Gabriel Cordell teams up with his nephew for a grueling wheelchair trek across America.'),('s4349','Four man-children in an elite tactical unit gallivant around Macau for a weekend of debauchery that gets them in trouble with the law.'),('s4350','When a restaurant owner in Cyprus returns to Beijing to sign divorce papers, a drunk woman he encounters triggers a string of mishaps.'),('s4351','In this dark alt-history thriller, a naïve law student and a world-weary detective uncover a conspiracy that has tyrannized Poland for decades.'),('s4352','A year after helping Richard secure the crown, Amber returns to Aldovia to plan their wedding. But her simple tastes clash with royal protocol.'),('s4353','A trip to church with her family on Christmas Eve gives young Angela an extraordinary idea. A heartwarming tale based on a story by Frank McCourt.'),('s4354','Magician Drummond Money-Coutts travels the globe, sharing his infectious love of his craft and attempting feats that proved fatal to other magicians.'),('s4355','An insomniac, an aspiring photographer and a pregnant veterinarian form a unique friendship during late-night meetings at a 24-hour mini-mart.'),('s4356','Purehearted teen Lazzaro is content living as a sharecropper in rural Italy, but an unlikely friendship with the marquise\'s son will change his world.'),('s4357','Frustrated by life with her boyfriend, thirty-something Wako can’t stop herself from being interested in high schooler Yumeaki, despite their age gap.'),('s4358','The controversial and troubled Indo-Pakistani writer Saadat Hasan Manto finds his artistic choices challenged by censors.'),('s4359','Hoping to revive his relationship with his resentful millennial son, an internet-rookie widower assumes the online persona of a young woman.'),('s4360','In this animated spinoff series, Juni and Carmen Cortez must battle the evil organization S.W.A.M.P. – without the help of their super-spy parents.'),('s4361','To escape his life of crime, a Paris drug dealer takes on one last job involving Spain, unhinged gangsters, his longtime crush and his scheming mother.'),('s4362','Husband and father Pedro becomes increasingly suspicious that a series of mishaps at a resort during a family vacation are part of a sinister plan.'),('s4363','When Jeff Ross and Dave Attell take the stage, no one is safe. With the help of special guests, they\'re packing a lot of laughs into one epic weekend.'),('s4364','Take control of an adventure set in the Minecraft universe. The future of the world is at stake, and your decisions shape the story – so choose wisely!'),('s4365','The ponies get in the spirit of the holidays by drawing names for a gift exchange, then race around Equestria in search of the perfect presents.'),('s4366','In 18th-century North America, ruthless trappers and entrepreneurs fight to wrest control of the fur trade from the mighty Hudson\'s Bay Company.'),('s4367','A domestic abuse survivor orchestrates an elaborate deception to protect her family from her powerfully wealthy husband and his vindictive enemies.'),('s4368','After slacker Daniel Glass is misdiagnosed with cancer, his lies lead him into an absurd web of fraud, blackmail, suspicion and misadventure.'),('s4369','The cult hit returns! Captured by mad scientists, new host Jonah survives a blitz of cheesy B movies by riffing on them with his funny robot pals.'),('s4370','After accidentally crashing Santa\'s sleigh, a brother and sister pull an all-nighter to save Christmas with a savvy, straight-talking St. Nick.'),('s4371','An executive-turned-viral sensation loses his reputation and his memory, but finds a new life with his biological mother and her empowered dance group.'),('s4372','Now the Blue Sky King, Darel must lead a rescue mission to save a Dream Walker – leaving the village under the protection of the Kulipari youth.'),('s4373','A trio of sky-dwelling ghosts must travel to Earth to teach sinning humans a lesson, but they somehow manage to botch each well-intentioned mission.'),('s4374','A new pack of Pup Star pooches stumbles upon a rival team’s plan to ruin Christmas, then ends up at the North Pole to try and save the holiday spirit.'),('s4375','A toy manufacturer and his wife are terrorized by a demon after their orphaned niece tries to summon her late mother\'s spirit using a spooky ritual.'),('s4376','Trapped in an empty building, nine people are forced to play a lethal game. All their movements will be recorded, and only one player can survive.'),('s4377','Teams of elite chefs vie to impress the world\'s toughest palates as they whip up iconic dishes from nine nations in this star-packed competition.'),('s4378','\"Daily Show\"\" host Trevor Noah touches on tacos'),('s4379','Go behind the scenes at Pixar Animation Studios with this Emmy-nominated documentary tracing the creation and history of the groundbreaking company.'),('s4380','After the deities Bai Qian and Ye Hua meet and fall in love, their romance stands the test of three lifetimes — each an epic in its own right.'),('s4381','Worlds collide and lives shatter when Altagracia, a powerful and elegant businesswoman, plots a ruthless revenge while falling in love.'),('s4382','When her fugitive husband leaves her homeless and penniless, a once-wealthy woman has no other choice but to join the working class.'),('s4383','After a look-alike takes over her account, a cam girl with a growing fan base sets out to identify the mysterious culprit and reclaim her own identity.'),('s4384','To spice up a dinner party, old friends agree to share every private message that pops up on their phones – with disastrous results.'),('s4385','A young horse enthusiast teams up with her best friends to rescue and rehabilitate animals on her family\'s beloved ranch.'),('s4386','Ranging from absurd to profound, these Western vignettes from the Coen brothers follow the adventures of outlaws and settlers on the American frontier.'),('s4387','When a down-to-earth Chicago baker and a soon-to-be princess discover they look like twins, they hatch a Christmastime plan to trade places.'),('s4388','Go behind the scenes with Brazilian pop icon Anitta, along with her friends and family, as she aims to create a new song and music video each month.'),('s4389','When an aging father seeks the help of a doctor and a journalist to look for the son who left him 16 years ago, he learns some surprising truths.'),('s4390','Scouted by a famous Spanish club, Valt Aoi heads to Spain. With their sights on the World League, he and his teammates face the European League first.'),('s4391','A wedding planner’s world is turned upside down when a handsome private investigator is hired to disrupt one of her biggest jobs.'),('s4392','Up against a corrupt government official and crushing poverty, a young boy in the Delhi slums attempts to raise funds to build himself his own toilet.'),('s4393','Hoping to find answers to her estranged father\'s mysterious illness, a young woman visits his old villa and uncovers a horrifying truth from the past.'),('s4394','Through interviews with locals, this documentary investigates the triggers and outcomes of the 2013 communal riots in the heart of Uttar Pradesh.'),('s4395','While trying to buy his wife a set-top box, a struggling writer and his pal get entangled in the domino effect of a spectacularly botched drug deal.'),('s4396','When his wife begins to exhibit alarming behavior, a husband tries to find whether she suffers from a personality disorder or something more sinister.'),('s4397','In 1843, crippled Martin returns from war to his Basque hometown and finds his brother has grown into a giant, which they turn into a circus act.'),('s4398','In a mazelike Manila slum, at war with incensed civilians and a brutal cartel, special agent Nina Manigan must fight her way through one fierce night.'),('s4399','Grammy-winning singer Loudon Wainwright III reflects upon his unique relationship with his father in an evening of original songs and heartfelt stories.'),('s4400','A war veteran plagued by guilt over his final mission teams up with his best friend\'s widow to infiltrate a dangerous Copenhagen biker gang.'),('s4401','The history of military tanks unfolds in a documentary series that traces their role in history and geopolitics from World War I to the 21st century.'),('s4402','Bound by a family rule that forbids him from marrying until his stubborn sister gets hitched, a bachelor enlists the help of a love guru to woo her.'),('s4403','After finding love in drug-free Dubai, Stefan returns to Germany to grab documents for his wedding. But old buddy Kai\'s bad habits complicate things.'),('s4404','Honoring service members whose courage merited the awarding of a Medal of Honor, this docudrama series re-creates their inspiring true stories.'),('s4405','In 14th-century Scotland, Robert the Bruce claims the crown and leads a fierce uprising to win back the country\'s independence from English rule.'),('s4406','In this adult animated series, three gay co-workers lead double lives as drag queen superheroes, saving the LGBTQ community from evil nemeses.'),('s4407','Seventeen years after being wrongly imprisoned, a talented songwriter seeks justice against the men who caused her downfall and killed her family.'),('s4408','When their animal friends need help, brother-and-sister team Toby and Teri use the clues and follow the facts to solve mysteries in their own backyard.'),('s4409','Nine struggling musicians share the spotlight in this deeply personal reality series about the challenges and thrills of staging a Hollywood showcase.'),('s4410','After a boating accident, woodworker and family man Florian wakes up in the body of an officer who leads a task force against illegal body transfers.'),('s4411','During the Great Depression, a stranger with a violent past poses as a preacher and rallies farmers to mount a strike in a rural Iowa community.'),('s4412','After getting a heart transplant, a 40-year-old homemaker in Pune makes the life-changing decision to complete the bucket list of her 20-year-old donor.'),('s4413','In this one-man Broadway show, John Leguizamo finds humor and heartbreak as he traces 3,000 years of Latin history in an effort to help his bullied son.'),('s4414','A young woman returns to Malaysia to take over her father’s old coffee shop. Along with inheriting the Kopitiam, she gains a kooky group of friends.'),('s4415','After meeting by chance, two young musicians with differing views on love and life record an album that drastically alters their lives.'),('s4416','From germs and emotions to social media and more, it\'s the science of your world explained in a way that\'s refreshingly relatable.'),('s4417','This documentary chronicles Johnny Cash\'s 1970 visit to the White House, where Cash\'s emerging ideals clashed with Richard Nixon\'s policies.'),('s4418','A talented photographer stuck in a dead-end job inherits an antique Advent calendar that may be predicting the future – and pointing her toward love.'),('s4419','On the last day of his life, a legendary director struggles to complete a new project and contemplates his legacy in this layered film by Orson Welles.'),('s4420','Actors, crew members and others who were there discuss the tumultuous creation of Orson Welles\'s final, unfinished film, “The Other Side of the Wind.”'),('s4421','A cop full of self-doubt loses his gun five days before he\'s due to leave the force, and becomes an unexpected hero as he tries to retrieve it.'),('s4422','In this high-tension thriller, an anonymous caller on a cell phone threatens to harm a man\'s family if he doesn\'t carry out every order.'),('s4423','After being accused of cheating on a reality TV show, a dance troupe seeks to redeem itself by winning the World Hip-Hop Dance Championship.'),('s4424','Thrown out of the elite dance studio he founded, Vishnu\'s spirits rebound when he sees young street dancers prepping for an annual contest.'),('s4425','This animated retelling of the classic Indian tale of Prince Arjun – part of the Sanskrit epic Mahabharata – begins during the prince\'s youth.'),('s4426','When a dispute breaks out between five siblings over their mother’s property, one devoted son will go to any lengths to protect her land.'),('s4427','Years after rejecting Barfii, a hearing and speech impaired young man, for a more \"appropriate\"\" suitor'),('s4428','Having risen from humble beginnings, an ambitious young man sets his sights on winning a major dance competition that could catapult him to fame.'),('s4429','Still reeling from a business failure, the restaurant manager of a ski resort finds her world jolted by a new chef, who has his own hidden past.'),('s4430','Mistaking a broke, small-time hustler for a millionaire, two bumbling fishermen hatch a scheme to use him to help pay off their debts.'),('s4431','Two brilliant scientists discover the hidden virtual city of Creápolis, where citizens have the power to solve problems by believing and creating.'),('s4432','In a last-ditch effort, the jaded coach of the Southall United Football Club assembles a ragtag team and helps lead the team to a comeback season.'),('s4433','An accountant and a producer hatch a scheme to finance a movie, while making every effort to ensure that it flops so they may pocket the difference.'),('s4434','A struggling math teacher holds down a second job to keep his family afloat. But when he receives a wedding invitation, he\'s determined to attend.'),('s4435','During a wilderness getaway, a gang of sociopathic criminals kidnap a woman and assault her husband, who must summon all his strength to save her.'),('s4436','Brazilian comedian Edmilson Filho walks his audience through the stages of a modern relationship, playing up the differences between men and women.'),('s4437','Follow the reporters at BuzzFeed as they probe topics ranging from quirky internet crazes to safe injection spaces for opioid users.'),('s4438','An Indian man who has become a major business mogul in Canada must return to his homeland where he\'s reviled due to being wrongly branded a traitor.'),('s4439','Former con artist Sanju surrounds himself with the finer things, a blissful life troubled by only one thing: his wife, who wants even more.'),('s4440','Anticipating the next move in a serial killer\'s grisly game, a police chief realizes that his daughter and estranged wife are the next likely victims.'),('s4441','Stories of personal victories coincide with Team India\'s battle for the Cricket World Cup in this engaging ensemble drama.'),('s4442','One woman experiences the dramatic highs and lows of fame in this voyeuristic glimpse past the glitz and glamour of a Bollywood superstar\'s life.'),('s4443','A young man returns to his native village on a mission of vengeance after his father commits suicide in the wake of false accusations.'),('s4444','Three professional friends, all husbands living with domineering wives, take a well-deserved vacation in the resort city of Goa.'),('s4445','Without fully realizing the consequences, a boy who wants to relocate from India to Canada sells his heart to a gangster in need of a transplant.'),('s4446','This Bollywood drama tells the story of three best friends who dream of starting a cricket training academy in Ahmedabad for very different reasons.'),('s4447','Cheenu dreams of resurrecting the restaurant he has inherited to its former glory, but his brother, a compulsive gambler, loses the place to a cop.'),('s4448','In this 2006 show, comic Katt Williams uses his edgy style and personal experiences to paint a sassy, hilarious portrait of life in black America.'),('s4449','After falling in love during college, architect Maddy and free spirit Payal have five wonderful years together, until a mystery suddenly divides them.'),('s4450','A group of Mumbai up-and-comers search for love and struggle for success in this ensemble drama that centers on an eager young call-center executive.'),('s4451','Alternative comic Marc Maron is back on stage in New York to talk Chinese food, drug abuse, sex in hotel rooms and life with his girlfriend.'),('s4452','A moving portrayal of the 2006 train bombings in Mumbai, this Indian drama follows the interconnected stories of several strangers.'),('s4453','When they both fall for the same girl, best pals and shameless womanizers Prince and Jassi go head-to-head to compete for her love.'),('s4454','This thriller tells the true story of model Jessica Lall – who was shot dead in a restaurant – and the campaign to bring her killer to justice.'),('s4455','Starting as a petty thief, a man rises to become one of the city\'s biggest operators and carves out the kind of lifestyle he\'d once only dreamed of.'),('s4456','Paan Singh Tomar goes from celebrated runner to star brigand and rebel when life after sports fails to unfold as planned.'),('s4457','A small-time con man assembles a team to help him avenge the death of his partner-in-crime at the hands of a powerful gangster.'),('s4458','In this Bollywood drama, a corporate go-getter sees his priorities shift when personal tragedy brings him face-to-face with political corruption.'),('s4459','Asked to deliver a package for a friend, Madhu gets her fiancé, Jayaganthan, to take care of it, and he then passes the task to one of his roommates.'),('s4460','A policeman\'s son overcomes his reluctance to join the force following a brutal attack on his father and ends up in the middle of a robbery case.'),('s4461','Self-proclaimed \"Queen of Comedy\"\" Sommore storms the stage to deliver a riotous stand-up performance in Charlotte'),('s4462','A dozen amateur bakers amiably compete for the coveted title of Britain\'s best as they whip up tasty treats for judges Mary Berry and Paul Hollywood.'),('s4463','This documentary traces the life of \"Tales of the City\"\" author Armistead Maupin'),('s4464','Three youths from rural South Africa set out for Johannesburg, where they\'re thrust into the seedy underbelly of the city and must fight to survive.'),('s4465','An educated man assists the illiterate residents of his village with written correspondence, sometimes manipulating the letters to suit his interests.'),('s4466','A poor family’s goat suddenly acquires divine status, sparking a widespread frenzy as everyone clamors to benefit from its unexpected celebrity.'),('s4467','When his cruel uncle abandons him, a young orphan learns to access the untapped superpowers that have been waiting within him all along.'),('s4468','In 1921 Barcelona, amid unrest between anarchists and the police, a cop plays both sides to learn who stole army weapons that could ignite a civil war.'),('s4469','Flashbacks reveal Gen. Antonio Luna\'s tireless fight for Filipino independence from the U.S. and his leadership in the Philippine-American War in 1899.'),('s4470','Hakuno Kishinami finds himself in the midst of a Holy Grail war with no memories of how he got there. Through his confusion, he must fight to survive.'),('s4471','Dragon and his fellow students at Dragon Tiger Gate martial arts school team up to battle the ferocious villain Shibumi.'),('s4472','A single mother in London\'s Camden Town hears music when she meets a handsome stranger with a past. But she\'s not sure she\'s ready to open her heart.'),('s4473','Over six days in 1971, brilliant writer Sergei Dovlatov encounters maddening barriers to publishing his work under the repressive Soviet regime.'),('s4474','A rude, self-centered businessman seems to be on the brink of losing everything until a night janitor at his office helps him find redemption.'),('s4475','A man whose wife is repeatedly cheating on him turns to his friends for support in this wacky comedy.'),('s4476','In 1992, Sandi Tan and her friends shot a 