eet extraordinary medical practitioners seeking to change our approach to life and death.'),('s4879','Threatened by creditors, a newly unemployed man agrees to work for a debt collector, but soon discovers his deal with the devil has unexpected costs.'),('s4880','In 2050, an evil scientist is about to unleash an army of robotic dinosaurs. Now it\'s up to Kong and friends to fight back and save the day.'),('s4881','When a 17-year-old learns the TV news host she pines for is engaged, she and her best friend launch an elaborate plan to prevent his marriage.'),('s4882','A Chinese pharmaceutical lawyer framed for a vile crime teams up with a sharp-witted Japanese detective to stop a dangerous corporate plot.'),('s4883','Along with her two friends, a determined woman travels to Vietnam to bring home the baby her recently deceased daughter had planned to adopt.'),('s4884','When four unhappy couples attend a spiritual retreat at a resort to try and solve their relationship troubles, shenanigans ensue.'),('s4885','Four cops escorting a mobster to a high-security prison fight for survival when a gang boss orchestrates a riot from outside to silence their charge.'),('s4886','When her small granddaughter is sexually assaulted by a powerful man and no justice is served, a poor, frail old woman plots her violent revenge.'),('s4887','A young man in Kerala has two weeks to stop the woman he loves from a fixed marriage in the U.S., but he doesn\'t have the papers to get there.'),('s4888','In Naples, Buenos Aires and New York, people reflect on the Neapolitan tradition of \"suspended coffee\"\" and how it changed their lives.\"'),('s4889','To bring down a global human trafficking ring, an Interpol agent recruits the help of a brutal criminal with inside knowledge of the yakuza.'),('s4890','A Spaniard working in Argentina sees his life upended after accidentally giving bad directions to a passerby, who demands compensation for the error.'),('s4891','John Mulaney relays stories from hi