 a Yazidi slave, an undercover reporter, a recruited mom and child snipers.'),('s4905','A Bihari migrant runs a successful service to help couples elope, until the daughter of his former boss stirs the pot.'),('s4906','Struggling to balance family ties and a career, a rising comedian of Parisian banlieue roots learns the true price of fame.'),('s4907','Historic footage and leading voices of the era examine the \"Bobby Phenomenon\"\" of the 1960s and the legacy of the man who helped redefine the country.\"'),('s4908','Dueling high school debate champs who are at odds on just about everything forge ahead with ambitious plans to get into the colleges of their dreams.'),('s4909','Young radio announcers from varying backgrounds encounter the supernatural in mysterious dreams, accidents and everyday life.'),('s4910','A young priest coaches a team of uncoordinated monks in order to win a soccer tournament and save their monastery from being turned into a hotel.'),('s4911','Family problems, relationship issues and professional challenges dog law graduate Melissa Chan following her return from London to Malaysia.'),('s4912','Rachel Dolezal, her family and her critics reckon with the aftermath of a national debate sparked by questions about her racial identity.'),('s4913','Two fathers with clashing views about their children\'s upcoming wedding struggle to keep it together during the chaotic week before the big day.'),('s4914','After graduation, three women from distinct backgrounds find themselves in the real world, facing the challenges of work, romance and unexpected fame.'),('s4915','Two brothers start a new life in Singapore, where they run into a childhood friend who falls in love with the elder while attracting the younger.'),('s4916','Live from Hamburg, Iranian-German comedian Enissa Amani shares her take on German engineering, tax deductions and online fan-mail etiquette.'),('s4917','The dynamic, bow-tied host behind the young adult science show faces climate-change 