.'),('s4943','Yugo, a 12-year-old Eliatrope with special powers, sets out on a mission to find his true family and uncover the mysteries of Wakfu.'),('s4944','A former medical student battles for survival against an evil human-zombie hybrid determined to destroy her, in this reimagining of the 1985 classic.'),('s4945','Armed with sly wit, a fresh outlook and plenty of style, French comedy star Fary veers from dating to stereotypes and beyond in this exclusive special.'),('s4946','A homemaker and a writer are prime suspects – and the only witnesses – in a double murder, and it’s up to one detective to uncover the elusive truth.'),('s4947','Decades after the adventures of the original Enterprise crew, Capt. Jean-Luc Picard leads a new Enterprise on missions to explore unknown worlds.'),('s4948','An Argentine doctor faces legal and ethical challenges when she travels to the countryside to pick up the infant she has been waiting to adopt.'),('s4949','An Indian village is abuzz with news that a major movie star is coming to town – even more so because the town barber went to school with him. But as the day of the actor\'s visit approaches, the humble barber begins to worry he won\'t be recognized.'),('s4950','A Swedish detective and her timid British colleague\'s attempt to solve a gruesome murder case nets mixed results and miscommunication.'),('s4951','Stand-up comedian John Mulaney tackles such red-hot topics as quicksand, Motown singers and an elderly man he once met in a bathroom.'),('s4952','Four friends become overnight millionaires after selling their video game start-up. But their newfound status tests their friendship and resolve.'),('s4953','Major Ram Prasad Sharma yearns to see project Mission Milaap come to fruition and usher in an era of peace between two warring countries. But the evil Raghavan will do anything to stop the peace process.'),('s4954','Disgusted by the gold-chain snatchers in his home city of Chennai, a man vows to combat the criminal menace 