s, athletes, coders and others a way to do more – faster and better. But at what cost?'),('s4981','When a controversial cult leader builds a utopian city in the Oregon desert, conflict with the locals escalates into a national scandal.'),('s4982','\"Saturday Night Live Korea\"\" writer-turned-comedian Yoo Byung-jae lays bare his childhood memories and philosophy on sex in his first stand-up venture.\"'),('s4983','Suzu marries into a family living outside of Hiroshima and quickly settles into her new life, until World War II challenges her ability to survive.'),('s4984','Tired of her passionless marriage, Marianne wants a separation from her husband, Gustav, who, in response, decides to make a big change of his own.'),('s4985','When his sister disappears while working at the Grand Hotel, a man joins the staff to get answers. Inside its posh walls, he finds love and intrigue.'),('s4986','When a young woman with amnesia becomes a key figure in a missing persons case, she must reconstruct her memories to clear her name.'),('s4987','During Communist rule, a Polish gynecologist and sexologist defies taboo and fights to publish her groundbreaking book on love and sex.'),('s4988','Amid a coup, a North Korean agent escapes south with the country\'s injured leader in an attempt to keep him alive and prevent a Korean war.'),('s4989','As a magic wielder, young archivist Chakuro knows his time is short, but everything changes when a girl from the outside appears on his island.'),('s4990','In his first special in seven years, Ricky Gervais slings his trademark snark at celebrity, mortality and a society that takes everything personally.'),('s4991','Villains are rampaging through Charter City and the Flex Fighters – Jake, Ricardo and Nathan – need your help to halt the chaos.'),('s4992','Everything Aiko knew was a lie. Now she\'s joining a team of Divers to reach the place where the Burst began to stop it for good and save her family.'),('s4993','Investigating the murder of a pizza delivery man, a London detective uncovers a tangled conspiracy involving drug dealers, smugglers and spies.'),('s4994','An American soldier imprisoned in postwar Japan enters the dark world of the yakuza, adopting their way of life in repayment for his freedom.'),('s4995','Ordered to take down a villainous business leader who controls the city, a prosecutor gathers a team of men who may not be so clean themselves.'),('s4996','Born amid poverty and limited women\'s rights in the village of Ratu, India, Deepika Kumari rose to become the No.1 female archer in the world at 18.'),('s4997','After a daring heist, three fugitives lock themselves in a warehouse hoping to evade the police, but find a worse threat as they fight to stay alive.'),('s4998','To protect his family, a police detective covers up a murder case. But when his partner suspects foul play, he is trapped in a dangerous game on duty.'),('s4999','In his first English-language special, comedian Gad Elmaleh gleefully digs into America\'s food obsessions, dating culture, slang and more.'),('s5000','Cinematographers visit the remote forests and mountains of China in hopes of capturing footage of pandas, monkeys, red-crowned cranes and more.'),('s5001','Over a two-year period, filmmakers embedded with cops in Flint, Michigan, reveal a department grappling with volatile issues in untenable conditions.'),('s5002','An Argentine comedian espouses the values of feminism, speaking on topics like sex, language, abortion and why it\'s OK to let a man buy you dinner.'),('s5003','A Chilean comedian fuses activism with irreverence for a stand-up set filled with jokes about misogyny, reproductive rights and respecting women.'),('s5004','As a zombie plague ravages their rural Quebec town, a scrappy band of survivors join forces to flee the infected hordes in this quiet thriller.'),('s5005','Players and coaches for a Montreal soccer team chase dreams of stardom while their personal lives erupt with love, fear, passion and violence.'),('s5006','From Casino du Liban, Lebanese actor and comedian Adel Karam delivers earthy punchlines on kissing norms, colonoscopies and a porn star named Rocco.'),('s5007','A team of mercenaries working with the CIA accepts an off-the-books mission in Chernobyl, where deadly human-controlled droids prepare an ambush.'),('s5008','A radio broadcaster\'s intense attraction to a mysterious woman opens the door to a tidal wave of powerful emotions and desires.'),('s5009','Ambitious Gurukant Desai ignores his father\'s advice and leaves his village to find success in Turkey.'),('s5010','Separated at birth, twins Raja and Prem couldn\'t be more different. But when fate puts them both in London, they start being mistaken for each other.'),('s5011','After enrolling in a college poetry course, a struggling rapper finds inspiration for her new voice through slam poetry.'),('s5012','The last of his family line, Olaf Schubert doesn\'t have time for a girlfriend but dutifully searches for one when his father demands offspring.'),('s5013','As her own wedding looms on the horizon, a marriage counselor strives to save her future in-laws\' crumbling relationship.'),('s5014','A director and a comedian want to shoot the \"comedy of the future\"\" and make cinema history'),('s5015','An Americanized NASA scientist returns to his native India on a business trip and searches for the nanny who helped raise him.'),('s5016','\"Trailer Park Boys\"\" John Paul Tremblay'),('s5017','Bubbles\'s plan to spread the true meaning of Christmas is dashed by Julian\'s wish to cash in on the holiday and Ricky\'s quest to meet the real Santa.'),('s5018','The boys head to Ireland after winning a contest to see Rush but are arrested by immigration and must perform a community service puppet show.'),('s5019','A year after the Season 7 finale, the boys are poised to live the good life. But an old enemy throws a wrench in things once again.'),('s5020','See what Sunnyvale Trailer Park was like back in the day, featuring Randy as a prostitute, J-Roc before he rapped and Barb and Lahey still together.'),('s5021','When their Sunday soccer game on the beach is canceled, five friends set out to find another place to play in the noisy, crowded city of Mumbai.'),('s5022','An accident on a bridge ties together three young men from different social classes, sparking a course of events that will forever alter their lives.'),('s5023','After people in his town start turning up dead, a grumpy landlord is visited by a man who recounts an unsolved serial murder case from 30 years ago.'),('s5024','Mentalist Derren Brown engineers an audacious social experiment demonstrating how manipulation can lead an ordinary person to commit an appalling act.'),('s5025','Rollicking, outrageous and audacious, Marlon Wayans gets raw on racism, age-appropriate rap rhymes, gay rights, raising kids and even the Kardashians.'),('s5026','In 1991 Madrid, after holding a séance at school, a teen girl minding her younger siblings at home suspects an evil force has entered their apartment.'),('s5027','Two young stars with different backgrounds and agendas enter into a fake marriage to advance their careers, until the fake starts turning real.'),('s5028','The longtime mayor of Marseille is preparing to hand over the reins to his protégé when a sudden and ruthless battle erupts for control of the city.'),('s5029','When his girlfriend vanishes, a mute man ventures into a near-future Berlin\'s seamy underworld, where his actions speak louder than words.'),('s5030','The death of a 15-year-old African American boy in Jersey City sets off a police cover-up and a search for the truth.'),('s5031','Surviving power struggles, betrayals and plots, Hitler\'s inner circle of Nazi leaders seizes control of Germany and designs its disastrous future.'),('s5032','When his abducted brother returns seemingly a different man with no memory of the past 19 days, Jin-seok chases after the truth behind the kidnapping.'),('s5033','A detective tracks what seems to be a killer with a taste for dismemberment in 1827 London, but the case leads in a far more terrifying direction.'),('s5034','While alchemist Edward Elric searches for a way to restore his brother Al\'s body, the military government and mysterious monsters are watching closely.'),('s5035','Argentine comedian Agustín \"Radagast\"\" Aristarán adds doses of magic'),('s5036','From the creators of \"How to Train Your Dragon\"\" comes an all-new Netflix original series that takes Hiccup and Toothless to the edge of adventure!\"'),('s5037','It\'s 1996 in a town called Boring, where high school misfits in the AV and drama clubs brave the ups and downs of teenage life in the VHS era.'),('s5038','A stunning cancer diagnosis spurs Abbie to seek a future girlfriend for fiancé and childhood sweetheart Sam, who\'s clueless when it comes to dating.'),('s5039','Eleven high school classmates awaken, restrained to a large dining room. While fearing for their lives, they question a motive to this bizarre act.'),('s5040','Chris Rock takes the stage in Brooklyn for a comedy special filled with searing observations on fatherhood, infidelity and American politics.'),('s5041','Individually, bank employees Sanjay and Karina don\'t earn enough to be able to buy a home, so they decide to enter into a marriage of convenience.'),('s5042','Explore the public and private sides of feminist firebrand attorney Gloria Allred, who\'s battled some of the biggest names in politics and business.'),('s5043','Four friends with a long-standing – but strained – connection take a hiking trip into the Swedish wilderness, from which they may never return.'),('s5044','A traveling trader provides a window into rural life in the Republic of Georgia, where potatoes are currency and ambition is crushed by poverty.'),('s5045','Using a magical photo booth that sends him back in time, Noah relives the night he met Avery over and over, trying to persuade her to fall for him.'),('s5046','