laysian stand-up comedy icon Harith Iskander takes the stage in Kuala Lumpur to talk about Singapore, a past girlfriend, Rick Astley and more.'),('s5073','With her Harvard Law dreams on the line, a black sorority leader agrees to help a rhythmically challenged sisterhood win a step dance championship.'),('s5074','Following a tragedy, a mother and her teen son move to a relative\'s vacant vacation home, where eerie and unexplained forces conspire against them.'),('s5075','A mild-mannered, middle-aged Irish farmer devoted to his mother embarks on a violent quest for revenge when she\'s murdered in a home invasion.'),('s5076','In 1921, nurse trainees from Madrid\'s upper class open a hospital in Melilla for Rif War soldiers, finding friendship and romance while saving lives.'),('s5077','Colombian stand-up comedians Antonio Sanint and Julián Arango impersonate an Argentine visitor and a cabbie, and a pair of dirty old men at the opera.'),('s5078','A desperate group of refugees attempts to recolonize Earth 20,000 years after Godzilla took over. But one young man wants revenge above all else.'),('s5079','The King of underground comedy delivers unflinching riffs on the American political climate, racial tensions, sex and his disdain for roast beef.'),('s5080','A simple village man is thrown into a web of political intrigue after he takes on a powerful and ruthless gang of bandits.'),('s5081','Twins separated by a court order meet at camp and decide to reunite their parents, unaware of the dark secret that drove them apart years before.'),('s5082','Following an embarrassing viral video, a New York model decides to escape from her suffocating existence by visiting her faraway aunt in Australia.'),('s5083','Pot activist Ruth Whitefeather Feldman runs a medical marijuana dispensary while encouraging her loyal patients to chill out and enjoy the high life.'),('s5084','Politician and human rights campaigner Milada Horáková battles against all odds to defend her beliefs in a Czechoslovakia under Communist rule.'),('s5085','Determined to make it big in America, Polish-born bandleader Jan Lewan draws his fans into a Ponzi scheme in this comedy based on a true story.'),('s5086','An investigative reporter seeks to expose the whereabouts of a slush fund belonging to the former president of South Korea, Lee Myung-bak.'),('s5087','Tom Segura gives voice to the sordid thoughts you\'d never say out loud, with blunt musings on porn, parking lot power struggles, parenthood and more.'),('s5088','Colombian comedian Alejandro Riaño discusses the perks of dating a she-wolf, styles of dancing, the quirks of Bogotá men and soccer game announcers.'),('s5089','In this Hindi version of \"Aval'),('s5090','Under pressure from his parents to settle down, a pleasure-seeking playboy falls for a woman who\'s like nobody he\'s ever met.'),('s5091','Hoping to create an American version of their hit British sitcom, two screenwriters run into cultural obstacles, starting with the lead character.'),('s5092','Still mourning the death of their son, Mark and Jessie welcome foster child Cody into their lives. Soon they discover he has a strange ability.'),('s5093','With demons reawakened and humanity in turmoil, a sensitive demon-boy is led into a brutal, degenerate war against evil by his mysterious friend, Ryo.'),('s5094','After being dumped on New Year\'s Eve, Bill pursues his ex-girlfriend to an off-season Gulf Coast beach town, but things get complicated along the way.'),('s5095','Interviews with global policymakers and girls in Gambia and Kenya detail the horrors of female genital mutilation and the growing efforts to end it.'),('s5096','Brothers Edward and Alphonse use alchemy to resurrect their mother, but they unleash a chemical reaction that tears apart their bodies.'),('s5097','After both suffer physical damage – brothers Edward and Alphonse battle nefarious forces to try to reclaim their bodies in this supernatural anime.'),('s5098','In his quest for true love, Dylan found chlamydia. Joined by friends Evie and Luke, he relives past encounters as he notifies all his former partners.'),('s5099','Explore the world of Pokémon with 10-year-old Ash Ketchum and his partner, Pikachu, as they aim for Ash\'s ultimate goal: becoming a Pokémon master.'),('s5100','A grisly find atop a mountain in the French Pyrenees leads investigator Martin Servaz into a twisted dance with a serial killer in this icy thriller.'),('s5101','Comedy titan Dave Chappelle caps a wild year with two stand-up specials packed with scorching new material, self-reflection and tough love.'),('s5102','Four preschool moms with little in common need a night out to take a break from their kids. But one thing leads to another, and things get rowdy.'),('s5103','Injury and family push hockey player Doug Glatt into retirement, but his plans change when his beloved former team appoints his nemesis as captain.'),('s5104','Decades after her capture, a serial killer offers to help solve a string of copycat murders – but only if her son, now a cop, will work by her side.'),('s5105','A young Senegalese-French man from humble roots sets out to climb Mount Everest to impress the woman he loves – and slowly becomes a media sensation.'),('s5106','After the death of his father, a passive and good-natured teenager named Wadi struggles with family, work and love.'),('s5107','Teen witch Bibi and her pal Tina return to the screen to reconcile a runaway girl with her narrow-minded family and save Falkenstein Castle from chaos.'),('s5108','A struggling comedian returns to Austin, Texas, to see her ailing cat and face her messy past – while staying with her ex and his new girlfriend.'),('s5109','With bone-dry wit, stand-up comic Todd Barry dissects texting emergencies, Hitler\'s taste in wine, pricey soap, cheap pizza and much more.'),('s5110','After taking a break from the business, a music producer returns with a new project in mind: launching a co-ed pop idol group.'),('s5111','A video a