l story soon becomes a scandal of its own.'),('s5150','A childish idiot trapped in an adult\'s body, schoolteacher Dan hates his job, hates his girlfriend-less life and has good reason to fear his dad.'),('s5151','After a young boy is murdered in the small seaside town of Broadchurch, local detectives Ellie Miller and Alec Hardy are assigned the mysterious case.'),('s5152','Three men are stunned to find their faces on a poster promoting vasectomies, and must prove to their upset loved ones that they\'re innocent victims.'),('s5153','Emmy-winning filmmaker Jon Alpert chronicles the fortunes of three Cuban families over the course of four tumultuous decades in the nation\'s history.'),('s5154','When an aspiring musician falls for a carefree college student, he follows her to the Nevada desert to declare his love to her and find himself.'),('s5155','A jaded rom-com screenwriter in her 30s mines four love-sick women for their stories under the guise of providing them with romantic advice.'),('s5156','The boys are back on the loose as Bubbles, Julian and Ricky head south of the Canadian border for some outrageous American adventures.'),('s5157','Explore the hit songs from the Will Smith film \"Bright\"\" in these music videos from Machine Gun Kelly'),('s5158','In a world filled with provocative (and often misleading) news, a passionate team of investigative TV reporters strives to bring truths to light.'),('s5159','Iconic songstress Barbra Streisand culminates her 13-city tour in Miami with dazzling ballads, Broadway standards and stories from behind the scenes.'),('s5160','A ruthless outlaw terrorizes the West in search of a former member of his gang, who’s found a new life in a quiet town populated only by women.'),('s5161','After winning a local talent show, the Beat Bugs journey to compete on \"The Bug Factor'),('s5162','Brian Regan takes relatable family humor to new heights as he talks board games, underwear elastic and looking for hot dogs in all the wrong places.