g Mercenare and his minions.'),('s5176','Comedian Maria Bamford stars in a series inspired by her own life. It\'s the sometimes surreal story of a woman who loses – and then finds – her s**t.'),('s5177','Raw and outspoken, comedian Alexis de Anda bares her soul about weddings, exercise, sex, gynecologists, drugs and much more in this stand-up special.'),('s5178','In lawless badlands, reclusive Cabeleira sets out to discover the fate of his gunman father and grows to be a feared assassin himself.'),('s5179','The theft of the Greater Grail from Fuyuki City leads to a splintered timeline in which the Great Holy Grail War is waged on an unprecedented scale.'),('s5180','Christian Charles\'s documentary follows established comedian Jerry Seinfeld and up-and-comer Orny Adams as they navigate the stand-up circuit.'),('s5181','Teenage spy McKeyla teams up with three other super-smart girls to become secret agents who use their science and tech skills to save the day.'),('s5182','Spirited 22-year-old activist and photojournalist Dan Eldon rushes to the frontline of a dangerous relief effort for Somalian refugees in this biopic.'),('s5183','This documentary chronicles simmering tension and broken trust between L.A.\'s black community and police in the decade before the Rodney King riots.'),('s5184','Chaos ensues after two orphaned twin brothers raised apart team up with their eccentric, unmarried uncle to find a solution to their romantic woes.'),('s5185','A little girl must enter an orphanage after her parents are arrested, but her life takes a dramatic turn when she escapes and meets a model.'),('s5186','In 19th-century Canada, a psychiatrist weighs whether a murderess should be pardoned due to insanity. Based on Margaret Atwood\'s award-winning novel.'),('s5187','Heirless Maharaj Brajbhan leaves his throne to his cousin Vikram, but when Brajbhan\'s wife, Badi Rani, finally conceives, Vikram plots to destroy her.'),('s5188','Professional burglar and blowtorch expert Víctor i