ngs 2\"\" universe are revealed as cast and guests discuss the latest episodes with host Jim Rash. Caution: spoilers ahead!\"'),('s5202','Literary icon Joan Didion reflects on her remarkable career and personal struggles in this intimate documentary directed by her nephew, Griffin Dunne.'),('s5203','A grieving mother takes a road trip with her friend to confront the man who, she believes, stole her late son\'s business idea to get rich.'),('s5204','Years after the Civil War, a bounty hunter and his captive are waylaid by a Wyoming blizzard and hole up in a way station with six dicey strangers.'),('s5205','Comedian Jack Whitehall takes the stage to tell stories about drinking, drugs, a Google Maps van and his ongoing rivalry with Robert Pattinson.'),('s5206','Trapped by a mysterious fog, residents of a Maine village discover that it hides nightmarish creatures. A new series based on Stephen King\'s novella.'),('s5207','The new Head of Values at the BBC deals with redefining the company\'s purpose, events like the arrival of Prince Charles and issues with new programs.'),('s5208','A farmer pens a confession admitting to his wife\'s murder, but her death is just the beginning of a macabre tale. Based on Stephen King\'s novella.'),('s5209','Determined to make it big, the confident but clueless Miranda Sings embarks on an unlikely quest for fame in this offbeat comedy.'),('s5210','In the wake of trauma and abuse, three Hasidic Jews face ostracism, anxiety and danger as they attempt to leave their ultra-Orthodox community.'),('s5211','Mexican superstar actress Kate del Castillo reveals the untold story of her encounter with El Chapo Guzmán, the world’s most-wanted drug lord.'),('s5212','The getaway driver in a botched robbery puts his skills and smarts to the test when he receives shocking orders from an unknown caller.'),('s5213','Mathias\'s girlfriend finds a business card for a wedding planner in his pocket. Suddenly, he\'s engaged and hiring his lover to plan the big day!'),('s5214','By turns scathing and candid, Patton Oswalt reflects on the glut of comic material in the Trump era and the dark days following a personal tragedy.'),('s5215','In 1975, during the government-declared Emergency, thief Bhawani and his crew plan a daring robbery to reclaim his royal lover\'s seized treasures.'),('s5216','Once domineered by her own mother, a well-meaning matriarch has trouble being lax with her children, especially when her daughter-in-law moves in.'),('s5217','Four couples – a speed-dating pair, a husband and wife, a man living with an older woman and co-workers with opposite views – weather ups and downs.'),('s5218','After being arrested for a crime he didn\'t commit, an aspiring musician teams up with some of his inmates at Lucknow Central to form a band.'),('s5219','This documentary tries to reconstruct, through a series of interviews, a family\'s misguided attempt to heal a woman\'s pain through exorcism.'),('s5220','A little girl discovers she’s the modern-day descendant of Snow White when seven dwarfs arrive at her suburban home to serve as her guardian angels.'),('s5221','When his employee disappears in Singapore, Shyam travels from India to investigate the absence and becomes entangled in a deadly plot.'),('s5222','West Coast Customs, a mecca for well-heeled car lovers, stars as their team creates some of the most luxurious, outrageous vehicles on the planet.'),('s5223','After being wrongfully convicted of fraud, an honest man finds that life in prison comes with a measure of freedom that is unavailable outside.'),('s5224','While examining a young woman who has just murdered her husband and mother-in-law, a psychiatrist begins to reflect on her own marriage.'),('s5225','From a Mexico City theme park, energetic stand-up Alex Fernández riffs on music, cheap toys, insecurity and other fun things about growing up.'),('s5226','A father\'s suicide sends a family of eight on a journey through childhood memories and treacherous emotion