 daughters\' undesirable boyfriends: anarchist Álex, bad-boy Dani and playboy Ernesto.'),('s5240','A documentary filmmaker chronicles the life and times of his mother, Franca Sozzani, the editor of Italian Vogue and a fashion-world provocateur.'),('s5241','New-generation bodybuilding stars – including Rich Piana, Kai Greene and Calum von Moger – share their experiences competing in the demanding sport.'),('s5242','Two kids and their pet dog (aka the Ghost Patrol) get a call about an old manor and soon find they are investigating their first real haunted house.'),('s5243','Repeatedly on opposite sides of civil cases, two lawyers fall in love outside the courtroom, but circumstances hinder their romance from blossoming.'),('s5244','Toyland’s boy detective, Noddy, solves mysteries and finds missing objects with help from his friends: a panda, a superhero, a dinosaur and a robot.'),('s5245','Capt. Archer and his crew explore space and discover human innovation-expanding technologies as they meet new alien races in this \"Star Trek\"\" prequel.\"'),('s5246','On Voyager\'s 75-year journey back to Earth, the crew members encounter unknown species as they draw closer to a mysterious quadrant of space.'),('s5247','A car accident sends four lawyers spiraling in different directions as they scramble to rebuild their shattered lives.'),('s5248','Four engineers from different walks of life cross paths in pursuit of the same selfless dream: making the world a better place – and finding love.'),('s5249','A girl born with a condition that causes abnormal hair growth across her body tries to cope with the challenges of being different.'),('s5250','A reclusive psychologist agrees to treat a patient – whose therapist is missing – at her remote cabin, where the women test each other\'s boundaries.'),('s5251','Based on the life of TV chef Fu Pei-mei, this drama follows two women – one rich, the other poor – who fortuitously cross paths in 1950s Taiwan.'),('s5252','Drawing on newly available info, this show traces how the British royal family has survived the last 100 years of power struggles, politics and more.'),('s5253','When her husband\'s sex game goes wrong, Jessie – handcuffed to a bed in a remote lake house – faces warped visions, dark secrets and a dire choice.'),('s5254','When Juan Catalan is arrested for a murder he didn\'t commit, he builds his case for innocence around raw footage from a popular TV show. A documentary.'),('s5255','A woman with an entrepreneurial spirit takes life into her own hands by starting a beauty cream business that inspires other women to take chances.'),('s5256','After widowed neighbors Addie and Louis begin sleeping in bed together platonically to alleviate their loneliness, a real romance begins to blossom.'),('s5257','Picking up 40 years after six were convicted for two strange murders in Iceland, this chilling documentary proves confessions can’t always be trusted.'),('s5258','Gear up for a fast-paced journey as celebrity chef and avid auto enthusiast Paul Hollywood takes in the cars and culture of France, Italy and Germany.'),('s5259','Go inside the world of comedian and actor Rob Schneider in this comedy series that follows the ups and downs of his career and family life.'),('s5260','A man haunted by his wife\'s affair moves to Sarajevo and starts to love again, until fate forces him to choose between his new life and old loyalty.'),('s5261','Four friends who make their living as prostitutes in Morocco deal with both the dangers and stigma that come with their profession.'),('s5262','In this special live event, giants of stand-up come together to commemorate the 25th anniversary of Russell Simmons\'s groundbreaking \"Def Comedy Jam.\"\"\"'),('s5263','The beautiful island of Oahu is host to a new batch of six strangers who share a single roof, multiple conflicts and no script in this reality series.'),('s5264','After waking up aboard a derelict spaceship with no memories, the crew of the Raza investigates 