 1881, this film describes how the personal battle between the royal Romanovs and Lenin\'s Ulyanov family led to the Russian Revolution.'),('s5433','Two delusional geriatrics reveal curious pasts, share a love of tuna and welcome a surprise guest in this filming of the popular Broadway comedy show.'),('s5434','When her fiancé acts strangely upon receiving a mysterious invitation, a florist sets out to find out the truth behind the tiny scrap of paper.'),('s5435','When an ordinary guy crosses paths 15 years later with his childhood sweetheart, now an actress, a magic cellphone allows him to be her protector.'),('s5436','Disguised as a bodyguard, a special agent must complete his national secret tasks while pandering to the whims of his ill-tempered world star.'),('s5437','A top detective in the violent crimes unit becomes the sole guardian of his 6-month-old niece when his sister and her husband pass away unexpectedly.'),('s5438','In a luxurious condominium complex with draconian rules forbidding all romance, two residents fall in love and dare to start a secret relationship.'),('s5439','A college art club welcomes a new member who has the secret ability to smell death and who warns one of them to leave her boyfriend ... or else.'),('s5440','When things don\'t go her way during a shooting for her new show, a top actress runs away in an old van that guides her on a time-traveling journey.'),('s5441','Unfolding in reverse time, this darkly comic crime thriller follows a local sheriff hunting three bank robbery suspects, one of whom is his brother.'),('s5442','Five children living on the edge of a forest band together to save a magical wishing tree from destruction and find their own paths to happiness.'),('s5443','When a young man wakes from a coma, memories of brutal violence begin to surface, putting his life – and that of his doctor – in jeopardy.'),('s5444','While Spain relinquishes its last colonies, a battle-fatigued outpost engages in a long, brutal and sometimes bizarre clash with Filipino insurgents.'),('s5445','In exchange for low rent, a hodgepodge group of 20-something tenants set up residence as property guards in a disused hospital, where hilarity ensues.'),('s5446','In his funky California beach enclave, Chip\'s the go-to guy for personal insights. But he isn\'t quite as enlightened when it comes to his own baggage.'),('s5447','After searching for his abducted son for three years, a devastated father attempts to track down his missing child through lucid dreams.'),('s5448','Raised by a kindly thief, orphaned Jimmy goes on the run from goons and falls in love with Jyoti, whose father indirectly caused his parents\' deaths.'),('s5449','Eight decades after her disappearance, Amelia Earhart\'s incredible accomplishments are still celebrated, thanks in large part to her sister Muriel.'),('s5450','Two college frenemies whose lives aren\'t what they hoped meet up decades later and escalate their resentments from verbal jabs to bloody brawls.'),('s5451','Explore how Caesar, Napoleon, Mussolini, Hitler and modern-day dictators consolidated their considerable power through bold and brazen coups.'),('s5452','Rachael Stirling narrates this multifaceted portrait of former First Lady Jacqueline Kennedy Onassis and her younger sister, Lee Radziwill.'),('s5453','Addicted to webcams and voyeurism, a married man gets more than he bargained for when an online stranger tries to force him to watch a suicide.'),('s5454','After moving from New York City to a small town in Washington state, an interracial couple and their preteen son struggle to adjust to their new life.'),('s5455','When a fashion blogger falls for a video game vlogger, their romance goes viral. But separating their virtual life from reality gets complicated.'),('s5456','A beautiful, wealthy woman’s insatiable appetite for romance leads to tragedy and a police investigation.'),('s5457','Benjie Nycum travels to Wyoming to visit his ex-lover, Michael Glatze, a former gay activist who now lives with his wife and works as a church pastor.'),('s5458','With the help of a cop, a psychologist and a woman who can foretell the future, a brilliant paralegal works to solve an array of perplexing mysteries.'),('s5459','Four animal superheroes called the Miniforce transform into robots to protect small and defenseless creatures from the hands of scheming villains.'),('s5460','Photographer, writer and director Sam Jones sets his famous guests at ease with his freewheeling, insightful celebrity interviews without agendas.'),('s5461','A penniless actor new to Mumbai and a beautiful woman he meets one fateful night try to stop a gangster from replacing India\'s president with a twin.'),('s5462','To better himself, a spoiled prince temporarily assumes a commoner’s identity. But he soon learns his palace has been gifted to his father’s new wife.'),('s5463','When an abusive landowner is murdered, his twin brother sets out to find the killer but quickly discovers that everyone, it seems, wanted him dead.'),('s5464','Betrayed by the Spanish government he once served, a former secret agent plots to steal millions of dollars embezzled by a corrupt public official.'),('s5465','In 1967, two brothers from Copenhagen, Denmark, wind up in an orphanage, where the headmaster\'s cruel tyranny slowly provokes the kids to push back.'),('s5466','A mysterious, wealthy man offers three people a lucrative, unusual job that may be too good to be true: Live the high life as his children and heirs.'),('s5467','Jessica and Diana were sisters who were separated by just a few years in age. But their political ideologies couldn\'t have been any farther apart.'),('s5468','A filmmaker trains the camera on her own family as she examines the impact her grandfather, troubled artist Arshile Gorky, had on three generations.'),('s5469','In her first comedy special post-health scare, Sarah Silverman shares a mix of fun facts, sad truths and yeah-she-just-went-there moments.'),('s5470','