irl who is in love with someone else and tries to create a rift between her and the man she loves.'),('s5484','Best friends Sarah and Mindy share an unexpected moment while on a road trip. Years later, the two struggle to reconnect before a wedding.'),('s5485','A Viennese child who was kidnapped and held captive in a basement before escaping after eight years reveals her headline-making story of survival.'),('s5486','Two boyhood pals – one righteous, the other a criminal – take very different paths to adulthood. Their love for the same woman may prove disastrous.'),('s5487','Before the dawn of World War II, an ambitious actress pursues her dreams in Berlin. But her plans derail when she becomes Joseph Goebbels’ mistress.'),('s5488','When insurance accidentally pays her millions, retired teacher Eva and her pal Maddie head to the Canary Islands for the adventure of their lives.'),('s5489','Julien\'s been dethroned, but loyal friends and some very unlikely allies will propel the lovable lemur on a colorful journey to take back his kingdom.'),('s5490','Examine the rise, fall and rebirth of political operative Roger Stone, who\'s been an influential member of Team Trump for decades.'),('s5491','When a twisted killer tells the police he\'ll only speak to a fictional 1980s TV detective, the washed-up actor who played him takes the gig.'),('s5492','When his new love is captured by an evil snake charmer, a young cobra and his scorpion best friend set out across the desert on a wild rescue mission.'),('s5493','In this new stand-up special, Norm Macdonald delivers sly, deadpan observations from an older – and perhaps even wiser – point of view.'),('s5494','Homicide detective Gene Handsome sets out to solve a woman\'s murder while searching for clues about what\'s missing from his personal life.'),('s5495','Music meets imagination in this inventive animated series about thinking outside the box and having fun.'),('s5496','Eclectic stand-up comic Manu NNa relays everyday tales 