r as they vie to play roles in a dramatization of the case.'),('s5510','Sang-ah would do anything to shield pop star Ah-shin from rabid fans. But after an act of protection gone wrong, it looks like she\'s the crazy one.'),('s5511','An ambitious, talented politician embarks on an intense journey toward winning the presidency while juggling his complicated family affairs.'),('s5512','Roger Guenveur Smith gives voice to the man at the center of the brutal police beating that helped fuel the 1992 LA riots. Spike Lee directs.'),('s5513','After serving a six-year prison sentence, an ex-cop tries to rebuild his life in his hometown, but gets caught up in the fallout from his past.'),('s5514','A happy secret romance between a 40-year-old woman and a 25-year-old man is complicated after a greeting card grants her wish to be young again.'),('s5515','In a town in southern Spain where racial tensions run high among the workers in its many greenhouses, a cop investigates the murder of a young woman.'),('s5516','A young cinematographer with a bright professional future and a lack of empathy learns the importance of balancing ambition with humanity.'),('s5517','When a young prison guard commits murder in South Africa, an ardent lawyer aims to prove he was psychologically unbalanced by his role in executions.'),('s5518','In need of money, an eccentric ex-spy and his younger octogenarian partner embark on an international quest for a valuable Soviet soda formula.'),('s5519','Comedian Vir Das tackles nationalism, globalism, good food and bad politics in two cleverly crosscut performances in New York and New Delhi.'),('s5520','Magically transported from far-off Skullbania, a young barbarian teams up with an odd third-grader to protect his homeland from an evil sorcerer.'),('s5521','Rebellious and broke, Sophia stumbles into creating an online business and learns how to be the boss. A comedy inspired by the best-selling memoir.'),('s5522','Personal stories reveal how the intersection 