0','After a chance meeting at a ballpark, the kind son of a former gangster tries to help an outgoing radio DJ get over her recent heartbreak.'),('s5731','A wealthy heir\'s search for a nameless childhood sweetheart leads him to an inn run by a family with three sisters. But which one is his true love?'),('s5732','When a marriage-phobic woman hires a seductress to test how faithful her eager-to-wed boyfriend is, her plan takes an unexpected turn.'),('s5733','When her loved ones cook up a morbid plan to make her take time off from work, Yang Yiru goes on a vacation, truly believing she has terminal cancer.'),('s5734','This documentary turns the spotlight on the man behind the iconic \"All in the Family'),('s5735','Pac aims to keep Berry Day the happiest day ever by unraveling a curious mystery about his parents and thwarting Betrayus\'s plan to capture Santa Pac.'),('s5736','Spanish provincialism is put into the spotlight as a man from the Basque Country embarks on a mission to keep his daughter from marrying a Catalan.'),('s5737','After a singing pup with big dreams of stardom gets dognapped and escapes with a friend\'s help, her journey home is a fun, music-filled adventure.'),('s5738','A nervous nurse who scares easily finds herself caring for an ailing horror novelist while living in a house with hidden secrets.'),('s5739','With stunning views of eruptions and lava flows, Werner Herzog captures the raw power of volcanoes and their ties to indigenous spiritual practices.'),('s5740','Happily escaping a dictatorship, a Congolese doctor transplants his family to a small French village, where culture shock sets in for everyone.'),('s5741','In counseling sessions with his therapist, preoccupied Yvan shares stories of anti-Semitism and what it\'s like to live as a Jew in modern France.'),('s5742','The Trailer Park Boys are thrilled to get a free trip to Europe, until they arrive and learn about their corporate sponsor\'s unusual requirements.'),('s5743','Four small-town French teens who style themselves after American rappers set out to avenge a classroom insult and end up on a mind-blowing adventure.'),('s5744','Loyalties are tested and cruelties revealed when four business partners spend a tense evening debating who will pay for the crime they committed.'),('s5745','When a ferocious contagion sweeps through Atlanta, authorities impose a precarious quarantine on the city while scrambling to find a cure.'),('s5746','Unleashing his inquisitive, intense comedic style, Rogan explores everything from raising kids and Santa Claus to pot gummies and talking to dolphins.'),('s5747','When a fit of anger leads to a serious injury, a sidelined soccer star returns to his hometown and reluctantly agrees to train the local youth.'),('s5748','Loner Guts is recruited by Griffith and his band of mercenaries, but their ensuing success as a full-fledged army could lead to a horrible fate.'),('s5749','When his mind is fogged by a scimitar-weilding stranger, Mayuri destroys his laboratory, unleashing a cloud of reishi that lays waste to the Seiretei.'),('s5750','When a group of vicious Sinners plots to escape from this eternal prison in Hell, they discover that Substitute Soul Reaper Ichigo is the key to their freedom. The Sinners launch an attack and in the process kidnap Ichigo\'s younger sister.'),('s5751','A passionate pianist and a soulful puzzle maker who treasures silence aren\'t the best neighbors, but things get interesting when they start to date.'),('s5752','When a Japanese high schooler comes into possession of a mystical notebook, he finds he has the power to kill anybody whose name he enters in it.'),('s5753','The law-abiding owner of a crime scene cleaning service is forced into business with a powerful mob boss thanks to his irresponsible older brother.'),('s5754','At Cross Academy, two student disciplinary committee members are tasked with keeping the peace between a human class and a night class of vampires.'),('s5755','Known for his spectacular pyrotechnic displays, Chinese artist Cai Guo-Qiang creates his most ambitious project yet in this breathtaking documentary.'),('s5756','Eager contestants don big heads and furry suits to vie for the title of World\'s Best Mascot in this offbeat, comic romp from Christopher Guest.'),('s5757','On the final nights of a world tour, director Jonathan Demme captures what makes the show soar: gifted musicians, deft dancers and a magnetic star.'),('s5758','In this thought-provoking documentary, scholars, activists and politicians analyze the criminalization of African Americans and the U.S. prison boom.'),('s5759','The comic comes home to Toronto to sound off on cultural quirks, kids\' furniture and bathroom visits, reveling in all things ridiculously human.'),('s5760','Characters from the popular StoryBots apps for early childhood education give musical lessons on math, science, history, behaviors, emotions and more.'),('s5761','Besieged by overwhelming enemy forces, Irish soldiers on a U.N. peacekeeping mission in Africa valiantly defend their outpost in this true story.'),('s5762','The scientists of Jurassic World create a captivating and terrifying new creature that loves hot dogs. But what happens when the hot dogs run out?'),('s5763','They were the boy band to beat until fame tore them apart. Ten years later, five friends and an ex-love reunite and find themselves closer than ever.'),('s5764','After reconnecting with their girlhood crushes, two sisters find their lives turned upside down by surprising revelations and romantic intrigue.'),('s5765','In 1985, when a vessel protesting nuclear testing is sunk in New Zealand, local police fight to prove it was a terrorist plot by their French allies.'),('s5766','The romanticized life of media mogul Assis Chateaubriand depicts him as the star of a televised trial, where his passions and achievements are judged.'),('s5767','The head of a struggling ad agency finds herself torn between a hotshot executive and a kind stranger – not realizing they\'re the same person.'),('s5768','A young Kashmiri man sets out to escape to Pakistan and make sense of his brother\'s death, but he drifts aimlessly until finding his brother\'s camera.'),('s5769','Three years after making a wild promise to a woman in distress, a rigid businessman runs into her again and must decide whether to honor his word.'),('s5770','Masha explains why there\'s no need to be scared of things like monsters, the dark, going to a new school, thunder and other common childhood fears.'),('s5771','Carefree college student Vicente ends up in a desperate fight for freedom when a well-connected friend falsely accuses him of a hit-and-run accident.'),('s5772','An online matchmaker who\'s convinced she\'s living under a curse finds her theories on life and love tested when she meets a shrewd divorce expert.'),('s5773','An unemployed man gets a job as an extra at the shooting of a New Year\'s Eve TV special that\'s beset by crises and seems to go on forever.'),('s5774','The Equestria Girls, human teen counterparts to My Little Pony characters, head to Camp Everfree, where they need a little magic to help save summer.'),('s5775','Backstabbing, blackmail and revenge consume the dysfunctional family of a wealthy patriarch as they compete to find him a new liver at all costs.'),('s5776','When sinister Dr. Pacenstein schemes to swap bodies with Pac during a Halloween party, Spiral, Cyli and Count Pacula scramble to save their pal.'),('s5777','This biopic profiles Andries Riphagen, a Dutch criminal who blackmailed Jews in hiding during World War II and was responsible for hundreds of deaths.'),('s5778','After losing his sight and his fiancee in an accident, a man hires a caregiver who mysteriously sounds – and looks – just like his late girlfriend.'),('s5779','An ambitious man leaves his small Indian village for America. But when his letters to home stop coming, his brother sets out on his own adventure.'),('s5780','This adrenaline-rush documentary traces the rise of freestyle motocross, arguably the world\'s most extreme sport, and spotlights its pioneers.'),('s5781','When frustrated politicians name a historical figure as the next president, an honest, humble man by the same name suddenly becomes Italy\'s leader.'),('s5782','On a visit to his hometown, a rich bachelor seeks revenge on the woman who broke his heart 10 years ago. But his plan doesn\'t go as expected.'),('s5783','She was twice convicted and acquitted of murder. Amanda Knox and the people closest to her case speak out in this illuminating documentary.'),('s5784','In this wrenching documentary, two teens are sexually assaulted by boys they considered friends, humiliated online and harassed by their communities.'),('s5785','The stand-up sensation tackles TV\'s \"Shark Tank'),('s5786','Bob the Tomato, Larry the Cucumber and their Veggie pals venture beyond the kitchen counter in these playful adventures with Christian themes.'),('s5787','Charismatic comedy pals Karol Modzelewski and Lukasz \"Lotek\"\" Lodkowski bring their mischievous brand of humor to Warsaw\'s Klub Hybrydy.\"'),('s5788','Polish comedians Rafal Paczes and Katarzyna Piasecka hit the stage at Warsaw\'s Klub Hybrydy for a night of funny anecdotes and sly jokes.'),('s5789','Comedians Mariusz Kalamaga, Karol Kopiec and Wiolka Walaszczyk deliver an eclectic and energetic stand-up show at Klub Hybrydy in Warsaw.'),('s5790','Young Polish comedians Rafal Banas and Michal Leja present a high-energy stand-up show at Warsaw\'s Klub Hybrydy.'),('s5791','\"Recipe for Life\"\" star Rafal Rutkowski and Comedy Lab\'s Olka Szczesniak serve up humorous impressions and wry wit at Warsaw\'s Klub Hybrydy.\"'),('s5792','Writer, actor and satirist Tomasz Jachimek teams up with comedian Jacek Stramik for a night of subversive stand-up at Klub Hybrydy in Warsaw.'),('s5793','Trapped in a lab and stuck in a time loop, a disoriented couple fends off masked raiders while harboring a new energy source that could save humanity.'),('s5794','Donning his signature suit and fedora, the dapper comic offers a unique spin on getting old, the presidential election and \"Honky Tonk Badonkadonk.\"\"\"'),('s5795','Emmy-winning comedy writer Louis C.K. brings his caustic wit to Milwaukee, offering up his unique and uncensored take on sex, parenting and more.'),('s5796','As daily airstrikes pound civilian targets in Syria, a group of indomitable first responders risk their lives to rescue victims from the rubble.'),('s5797','This doc traces the impact of the Incredible Bongo Band\'s \"Apache'),('s5798','Witness the wrenching emotions that accompany end-of-life decisions as doctors, patients and families in a hospital ICU face harrowing choices.'),('s5799','Jandino Asporaat riffs on the challenges of raising kids and serenades the audience with a rousing rendition of \"Sex on Fire\"\" in his comedy show.\"'),('s5800','Sample the bold new flavors of France with chefs who are pushing the boundaries of fine dining and reinventing a rich culinary tradition.'),('s5801','In a tale of bravery and heroism, fearless frogs go to war against the sinister scorpions and spiders that have teamed up to conquer the amphibians.'),('s5802','Skeptics and others discuss widely held conspiracy theories involving aliens, government cover-ups, secret assassinations and other intrigues.'),('s5803','While the housemates in the Big Brother house remain oblivious, fast-moving hordes of the undead decimate the studio compound.'),('s5804','Detectives and crime lab technicians use the latest and most fascinating procedures to solve crimes in this documentary-style show.'),('s5805','Undercover cameras expose public floggings, executions and other brutality in Saudi Arabia, and introduce those risking their own lives for change.'),('s5806','Beautiful housewife Xie An Zhen seems to be living the perfect life but finds her world crumbling after learning that her husband is cheating on her.'),('s5807','Historian Suzannah Lipscomb investigates the witch hunts that plagued Britain in the 17th century, examining common myths about their origin.'),('s5808','Five preteen girls learn they\'re a legendary superhero squad known as the Glitter Force. Their mission? To defend Earth from evil fairy-tale villains.'),('s5809','Grammy-nominated comedians Jeff Foxworthy and Larry the Cable Guy bring their distinctive brand of humor to a packed crowd in Minneapolis.'),('s5810','The lives of a budding DJ, his loyal pal, a hopeless romantic, a jaded has-been and a troubled couple intersect at an electronic dance music festival.'),('s5811','Superstar DJ Steve Aoki reflects on the driving force behind his career: his ambitious father, Benihana founder and perennial daredevil Rocky Aoki.'),('s5812','After dire setbacks in 1940, Winston Churchill commissions a new kind of fighting force: commandos trained to use stealth and audacious tactics.'),('s5813','Nick Wallis presents crimes caught on CCTV, cell phones and other devices and reveals how investigators use the recordings to solve tough cases.'),('s5814','The comic puts his trademark hilarious/thought-provoking spin on finding a bat in his kitchen, seeing rats having sex, Boston accents and dead pets.'),('s5815','In 2000, U.K. detectives spent months tracking a criminal known only as Sally, who was targeting a supermarket chain with extortion and letter bombs.'),('s5816','Comedian Jim Gaffigan cuts loose on a variety of topics, including Hot Pockets, holidays, Catholicism and his favorite activity: doing nothing.'),('s5817','Jim Gaffigan offers up his take on bacon, bowling and other weighty topics in this stand-up performance filmed live in Austin on his 2008 comedy tour.'),('s5818','Funnyman Jim Gaffigan offers up his unique take on everything from Disney World to overweight whales in this live show from Washington, D.C.'),('s5819','Comic Jim Gaffigan delivers his sardonic take on topics like eating, exercise, weddings and his five kids in this live stand-up special.'),('s5820','Cross skewers Donald Trump, religious taboos and American swagger in a provocative night of comedy at the Paramount Theatre in Austin, Texas.'),('s5821','\"Last Comic Standing\"\" runner-up Lavell Crawford lords over a hometown crowd at St. Louis\'s Orpheum Theatre'),('s5822','A former member examines the lingering effects of being raised in the Family, a cult whose disturbing practices include the sexual abuse of children.'),('s5823','Three films chronicle the cocaine trade\'s sweeping impact on the citizens of Peru, Brazil and Colombia, from poor farmers to powerful drug lords.'),('s5824','Leading astronomers reveal the latest discoveries about death-trap planets, asteroids, comets and other wonders of the cosmos.'),('s5825','In this jailhouse interview, Arthur Shawcross, the Genesee River Killer, shares candid details of his crimes and his surprising family bonds.'),('s5826','In Colombia in 1821, a white orphan is taken in by black slaves. Years after being torn from them, she returns to find her family and childhood love.'),('s5827','In an attempted heist worthy of a Hollywood film, a cadre of criminals sets out to steal the world\'s largest perfect diamond from a London landmark.'),('s5828','Six legendary heroes find themselves on an epic quest as they harness the power of nature\'s elements to defeat the forces of evil.'),('s5829','While searching for her ex-boyfriend, a young drifter impulsively kidnaps a baby from a neglectful mother and pretends the child is her own.'),('s5830','The adorable Best Popple Pals love helping their friends and neighbors, but every time they do it seems to backfire in hilarious ways.'),('s5831','Long-lost buddy Zack gets suburban dad Kyle on a bus to a Rebirth seminar, sending him down a rabbit hole of psychodrama, seduction and violence.'),('s5832','Tony Robbins\' clients swear by his unorthodox life coaching methods. A revealing film goes behind the curtain at his annual mega-event.'),('s5833','An embittered cop is tasked with baby-sitting a spoiled actor, but the two must learn to fight together when they run afoul of a group of mercenaries.'),('s5834','This homage to 1980s teen sex comedies follows a college quiz bowl champion who knows almost everything – except how to talk to women.'),('s5835','When mecha attack a research center, its students, pilots, and researchers must fight back with the help of mysterious artifacts and a young samurai.'),('s5836','Returning for a second Netflix comedy special, Jim Jefferies unleashes his famously ferocious black humor to a packed house in Nashville, Tennessee.'),('s5837','Set in a world of greed, betrayal, sexual intrigue and rivalry, “Marco Polo” is based on the famed explorer’s adventures in Kublai Khan’s court.'),('s5838','When a middle-aged filmmaker meets an alluring stranger at a party, he\'s haunted by troubling memories of his past relationships.'),('s5839','A young boy\'s imagination takes him throughout the world and history, where he learns life lessons and has tons of fun with two make-believe friends.'),('s5840','Self-deprecating comic Sofía Niño de Rivera puts her sarcasm on full display in this stand-up special filmed live at Guadalajara\'s Degollado Theater.'),('s5841','In this inspirational buddy comedy, a young shut-in and his caregiver take a road trip in search of landmarks, but end up finding hope and friendship.'),('s5842','Martial arts master Ip springs into action when his son\'s school is threatened by a shady American, then defends his status as wing chun champion.'),('s5843','Combining his trademark wit and self-deprecating humor with original music, Bo Burnham offers up his unique twist on life in this stand-up special.'),('s5844','A dramatic series about friendship and conflict between two comedians who search for meaning in life and comedy. Based on the prize-winning book.'),('s5845','This series examines the nature of cuteness and how adorability helps some animal species to survive and thrive in a variety of environments.'),('s5846','Get up close and personal with avalanches, fiery volcanoes and other natural cataclysms, and learn why some choose to live in their destructive paths.'),('s5847','The life of a bank manager is turned upside down when a friend from his past manipulates him into faking his own death and taking off on an adventure.'),('s5848','Ali Wong\'s stand up special delves into her sexual adventures, hoarding, the rocky road to pregnancy, and why feminism is terrible.'),('s5849','When they lose their passports, a bickering radio team invents phony reports from a combat zone in a ruse that becomes increasingly complicated.'),('s5850','With never-before seen home video, this film recounts the paranoid downward spiral of John E. du Pont and the murder of Olympic wrestler Dave Schultz.'),('s5851','On stage in San Francisco, the comedian covers topics like old people getting drugs, his worst stand-up set, gay proms and a horrible birthday clown.'),('s5852','Two brothers become partners in a modest nightclub and turn it into the hottest spot in town, but their exhilarating run of success comes at a price.'),('s5853','A deaf writer who retreated into the woods to live a solitary life must fight for her life in silence when a masked killer appears in her window.'),('s5854','When a Black Ghost scientist releases newly modified cyborgs and mysterious demons appear in Tokyo, the worlds of \"Devilman\"\" and \"\"Cyborg 009\"\" meet.\"'),('s5855','Frank was a rising pop star when he married Cindy, but decades of dashed dreams and alcoholism have left the pair struggling to find happiness.'),('s5856','In Justin\'s dreams, he and his imaginary friends Olive and Squidgy travel around the world learning about nature and other cultures.'),('s5857','A new set of six men and women start their lives together under one roof. All they get is a fabulous home and a car. As always, there is no script.'),('s5858','When a twist of fate brings five unlikely animals together, they find that combining their unique kung fu styles as a team makes the perfect weapon!'),('s5859','A reclusive immortal who needs human flesh but tries to stay clean finds himself cast back into society by a gang of thugs and his estranged daughter.'),('s5860','British comedian Jimmy Carr unleashes his deadpan delivery and wickedly funny one-liners to a sold-out audience at the UK\'s Hammersmith Apollo.'),('s5861','After suffering a stroke at age 34, a woman documents her struggles, setbacks and eventual breakthrough as she relearns to speak, read and write.'),('s5862','A chance encounter with a mysterious stranger (Joe Manganiello) points Pee-wee toward his destiny – and his first-ever holiday!'),('s5863','We asked eight up-and-coming comedians for their wildest sketch and improv routines – and got a new comedy series unlike anything else.'),('s5864','After his mother\'s death, a piano prodigy\'s will to play disappears. But meeting a free-spirited girl who plays the violin turns his life around.'),('s5865','Renowned warrior Yu Shu-Lien comes out of retirement to keep the legendary Green Destiny sword away from villainous warlord Hades Dai.'),('s5866','In this Christmas-themed special, Captain America and the Avengers battle Loki and Ymir, who plot to steal Santa Claus\' powers and conquer the world.'),('s5867','As he tries his hand at baking, brewing and braising, acclaimed food writer Michael Pollan explores how cooking transforms food and shapes our world.'),('s5868','The whole huggable gang is back, bringing tales of caring and sharing to a new generation. And now the Care Bear Cousins are here to join the fun!'),('s5869','In a special packed with stealthy humor, Hannibal Buress tackles zipper etiquette, the legacy of steroids and the fallout from his Bill Cosby routine.'),('s5870','Join Turbo and his posse, the Fast Action Stunt Team. Filled with comedy, action and fun, this series amps it up to the extreme.'),('s5871','Fairy tales get a funny twist when Masha retells them, because she tends to get the details just a little jumbled up in this animated kids\' series.'),('s5872','In a provocative documentary series, comedian Chelsea Handler confronts personal and cultural hang-ups around four topics that fascinate her.'),('s5873','Ricardo O\'Farrill brings his sharp, observational humor to the stage with a relentless sarcasm and specific Mexican sensibility. Prepare for mockery.'),('s5874','An occupying Japanese general challenges Chinese men to duels to prove the superiority of the Japanese, but Ip Man refuses to fight – at first.'),('s5875','New in Hong Kong, martial arts instructor Ip Man perseveres and retaliates against his rivals\' opposition to the Wing Chun fighting style he teaches.'),('s5876','The bearded, bawdy and comically bitter Tom Segura gets real about body piercings, the \"Area 51\"\" of men\'s bodies'),('s5877','A defiant warrior-monk arrives at Kublai Khan\'s court in chains and soon earns his tragic nickname in this 30-minute origin story.'),('s5878','In an underwater village bordering a tropical island, two young turtles and their pals keep their home safe and enjoy adventures in the big, wild sea.'),('s5879','Mike Epps tears up the stage at L.A.\'s historic Orpheum Theatre in a special packed with blistering impressions and unapologetically raunchy swagger.'),('s5880','When his outlaw dad is kidnapped, Tommy “White Knife” Stockburn sets off across the West on a rescue mission with five brothers he never knew he had.'),('s5881','Ricky, Julian and Bubbles bring their trailer park humor out onto the stage for a night of bravado, schemes and an intoxicated acting demo.'),('s5882','Bill Murray rounds up an all-star cast for an evening of music, mischief and barroom camaraderie in this irreverent twist on holiday variety shows.'),('s5883','A young \"fabric geek\"\" lands a job at an upscale Japanese lingerie company – and quickly discovers she\'ll need help to survive.\"'),('s5884','Naomi and her gay best friend, Ely, have been inseparable since childhood, but their bond faces its biggest test yet when they fall for the same guy.'),('s5885','Armed with boyish charm and a sharp wit, the former \"SNL\"\" writer offers sly takes on marriage'),('s5886','After being dishonorably discharged from the Navy Seals, Bob and David are back serving our country the way they do best – making sketch comedy.'),('s5887','The pleasant family life of an L.A. attorney is disrupted by the sudden arrival of his brother, who is obsessed with the Charles Manson murders.'),('s5888','This collection of 12 short films from Disney includes \"Frozen Fever'),('s5889','Secrets are just a part of daily life in the small Pennsylvania town of Hemlock Grove, where the darkest evils hide in plain sight.'),('s5890','After an ugly divorce, a wealthy but unhappy man trains at a local gym and develops a strange relationship with the owner and a captivating trainer.'),('s5891','There\'s no subject too dark as the comedian skewers taboos and riffs on national tragedies before pulling back the curtain on his provocative style.'),('s5892','When civil war tears his family apart, a young West African boy is forced to join a unit of mercenary fighters and transform into a child soldier.'),('s5893','When a group of strangers is seized and awaits execution, they face the impossible task of choosing the one person among them worthy of being spared.'),('s5894','Over 93 days in Ukraine, what started as peaceful student demonstrations became a violent revolution and full-fledged civil rights movement.'),('s5895','The actress, comedian and YouTube sensation riffs on everything from nail salons and Gypsies to Mexican moms and super-sleuthing Liam Neeson.'),('s5896','Six years after Yugo and his team defeat Qilby, Ogrest\'s crying floods Amalia\'s kingdom. To stop him, they must find the six missing Eliatrope Dofus.'),('s5897','In a documentary with unparalleled access, discover the people and sounds that inspired rock \'n\' roll legend Keith Richards from childhood to today.'),('s5898','Learn how factory farming is decimating the planet\'s natural resources – and why this crisis has been largely ignored by major environmental groups.'),('s5899','As a volatile young couple who have been together for six years approach college graduation, unexpected career opportunities threaten their future.'),('s5900','Demetri Martin brings his off-kilter take on acoustic guitar, hairless cats, color schemes, and the word \"nope\"\" to Washington in his original special.\"'),('s5901','It\'s the first day of camp in this outrageous prequel to the hilarious 2001 cult classic movie. And at Camp Firewood, anything can happen.'),('s5902','Comedian Tig Notaro announced her cancer diagnosis at what became a legendary stand-up set in 2012. Follow her search for humor amid devastating news.'),('s5903','Three high school friends who turn into mermaids whenever they touch water have undersea adventures while keeping their new life a secret.'),('s5904','When a cash-strapped videographer takes a job in a remote mountain town, he finds that the client has some unsettling ideas in mind.'),('s5905','Filmed in his hometown of Atlanta, Chris Tucker showcases his stand-up comedic chops as he shares his experiences from childhood to the big time.'),('s5906','Comedian Ralphie May takes to the Las Vegas stage with his raw, rollicking take on men\'s fashion, racism, sex and even waffles. Filmed live in 2013.'),('s5907','Using never-before-heard recordings, rare archival footage and her best-known songs, this is the story of legendary singer and activist Nina Simone.'),('s5908','In order to keep her job at a biomedical engineering firm that prizes youth, a middle-aged woman must submit to a drastic experimental procedure.'),('s5909','Follow the adventures of superspy Danger Mouse and his bumbling sidekick, Penfold, as they jet around the world foiling their enemies\' evil plots.'),('s5910','After accepting a colossal bribe, a powerful TV conglomerate gins up fake news stories to enhance the image of a notoriously corrupt politician.'),('s5911','This 2015 Sundance Film Festival breakout documentary from producer Rashida Jones spotlights the \"amateur\"\" porn industry and the women it exploits.\"'),('s5912','Jen Kirkman delivers some sharp, hilarious truths about divorce, kids, sex and turning 40 in this Netflix original comedy special.'),('s5913','This chronicle of Bob Weir highlights his brotherhood with Jerry Garcia and his success as a member of one of the world\'s most influential bands.'),('s5914','Stand-up comedian Chris D\'Elia covers everything from how to improve the NFL to why dating is evil and that babies should grow up before they\'re born.'),('s5915','Plucky lizard Oscar spends his time trying to avoid the hazards of the desert, including marauding chickens and bumbling adversaries.'),('s5916','Stand-up comedian and TV star Aziz Ansari (\"Parks and Recreation\"\") delivers his sharp-witted take on immigrants'),('s5917','When a man discovers he will be the father to a boy, his fear and insecurities send him on an emotional, humorous quest for his own manhood.'),('s5918','Filmed in front of a raucous crowd, comedian Ralphie May unleashes his hilariously raunchy perspective in his first Netflix original stand-up special.'),('s5919','The team behind the searing documentary reveals what inspired them to tell the story of Virunga and the lethal fight to save the gorillas\' sanctuary.'),('s5920','Smart and brazen comedian Iliza Shlesinger applies her fresh, laugh-out-loud perspective to the universal struggles between men and women.'),('s5921','It\'s Christmas, and BoJack wants nothing to do with it. Then Todd shows up with a giant candy cane and an old \"Horsin\' Around\"\" Christmas episode.\"'),('s5922','Bill Burr escapes the zombie apocalypse, explores how rom-coms ruin great sex and explains how too many childhood hugs may be the 