esidential campaign.'),('s5936','This Emmy-winning, street-level view of the 2011 Egyptian Revolution captures the astonishing uprising that led to the collapse of two governments.'),('s5937','The greatest fairy tale never told comes to life in this colorful, song-filled, Tony Award-winning Broadway production based on the hit movie.'),('s5938','They are fiercely competitive athletes, determined to become champions on one of the world\'s toughest golf courses. And they\'re still in grade school.'),('s5939','\"Parks and Recreation\"\" star Aziz Ansari takes the stage to share his unfiltered views on adulthood'),('s5940','4400 people who vanished over the course of five decades suddenly reappear. None have aged, and slowly it\'s revealed that they have mysterious powers.'),('s5941','A high school chemistry teacher dying of cancer teams with a former student to secure his family\'s future by manufacturing and selling crystal meth.'),('s5942','Whoopi Goldberg narrates Elmo creator Kevin Clash\'s remarkable journey from a working-class Baltimore neighborhood to Jim Henson\'s \"Sesame Street.\"\"\"'),('s5943','After reckless teens kill an Amish child, a prosecutor attempts to bring the youths to justice despite the condemnation he faces from the community.'),('s5944','After their child was abducted and murdered, John and Reve Walsh fought to raise national awareness of the problem of missing children.'),('s5945','This drama based on real-life events tells the story of George McKenna, the tough, determined new principal of a notorious Los Angeles high school.'),('s5946','A lawyer\'s husband is having an affair. When his mistress is found dead, he becomes the prime suspect – and his wife must take charge of his defense.'),('s5947','When high school football coach Charlie Wedemeyer is diagnosed with Lou Gehrig\'s disease, he perseveres in leading his team despite becoming disabled.'),('s5948','When their college-age daughter suddenly begins acting erratically and is diagnosed with schizophrenia, a desperate couple seeks treatment for her.'),('s5949','After contracting HIV from a tainted blood treatment, teenaged hemophiliac Ryan White is forced to fight for his right to attend public school.'),('s5950','Twelve-year-old Calvin manages to join the navy and serves in the battle of Guadalcanal. But when his age is revealed, the boy is sent to the brig.'),('s5951','This drama tells the tale of Ricky Bell, a pro running back with the Tampa Bay Buccaneers who died of a muscle disease in the prime of his career.'),('s5952','Laurie and Joseph are doctors who interview sexually abused children. With a lot of energy they track down a pedophile who has abused many toddlers.'),('s5953','A beauty pageant winner is stalked by a serial killer who kidnaps her sister and torments her family in this thriller based on a shocking true story.'),('s5954','With his gift of dream interpretation and his brilliantly colored coat, Joseph inspires jealousy in his brothers in this animated Bible story.'),('s5955','While making a film about the incursion of Christopher Columbus in the New World, a director finds the Bolivian locals protesting modern exploitation.'),('s5956','After committing suicide, a washed-up rocker returns from the grave to torment the five people who betrayed him in life.'),('s5957','When he causes a car accident that leaves a young woman with amnesia, a man finds himself telling incredible lies to make her and her family happy.'),('s5958','While covering a story in New York City, a Seattle-based reporter uncovers a link between two missing women that changes her article entirely.'),('s5959','In a postapocalyptic world, rag-doll robots hide in fear from dangerous machines out to exterminate them, until a brave newcomer joins the group.'),('s5960','A brilliant group of students become card-counting experts with the intent of swindling millions out of Las Vegas casinos by playing blackjack.'),('s5961','After one of his high school students attacks him, dedicated teacher Trevor Garfield grows weary of the gang warfare in the New York City school system and moves to California to teach there, thinking it must be a less hostile environment.'),('s5962','When a doctor goes missing, his psychiatrist wife treats the bizarre medical condition of a psychic patient, who knows much more than he\'s leading on.'),('s5963','An architect and his wife move into a castle that is slated to become a luxury hotel. But something inside is determined to stop the renovation.'),('s5964','Against the backdrop of Nigeria\'s looming independence from Britain, detective Danladi Waziri races to capture a killer terrorizing local women.'),('s5965','As a psychology professor faces Alzheimer\'s, his daughter and her three close female friends experience romance, marriage, heartbreak and tragedy.'),('s5966','After devastating terror attacks in Norway, a young survivor, grieving families and the country rally for justice and healing. Based on a true story.'),('s5967','On India\'s Independence Day, a zany mishap in a Mumbai chawl disrupts a young love story while compelling the residents to unite in aid of a little boy.'),('s5968','Mixing old footage with interviews, this is the story of Arsenal\'s improbable win versus Liverpool in the final moments of the 1989 championship game.'),('s5969','A taxi driver, a gangster and an athlete struggle to better their lives despite obstacles like crooked politicians, evil dons and caste barriers.'),('s5970','A successful writer returns to the town that launched his career, encountering people who spark nostalgic, often painfully illuminating flashbacks.'),('s5971','When a middle-aged divorcee returns to Kolkata to visit his ailing father, long-buried memories resurface, bringing new discoveries with them.'),('s5972','This real-life look at FBI counterterrorism operations features access to both sides of a sting: the government informant and the radicalized target.'),('s5973','This pawesome documentary 