e summer of 1988.'),('s6011','A Muslim women\'s activist group in India protests against oral divorces, starting a movement to reclaim their religious and constitutional rights.'),('s6012','With the help of his friends, a man breaks out of prison in hopes of restoring a lively nightclub.'),('s6013','Two crooks planning a bank heist wind up abducting a pizza delivery driver and force him to commit the robbery — with a strict time limit.'),('s6014','Hoping to help their dissident parents, two brothers sneak out of Poland and land as refugees in Denmark, where they are prevented from returning home.'),('s6015','After launching a successful underground restaurant out of their apartment, an ambitious chef and his wife open an all-consuming upscale eatery.'),('s6016','A young mechanic comes out to his extremely straight best friends. Once they get used to the idea, they\'re determined to help him find the right guy.'),('s6017','Yanto asks his friends to help save a girlfriend who was kidnapped by a mobster. Silly slapstick and campy crimefighting ensues.'),('s6018','A young novelist\'s life is turned upside down when a chance encounter outside a New York hotel leads to an intense affair with a diplomat\'s wife.'),('s6019','After falling for a pretty art teacher who has no short-term memory, a marine veterinarian has to win her over again every single day.'),('s6020','An otherwise healthy twentysomething has a comically early midlife crisis when he gets slapped with a cancer diagnosis and a 50-50 chance of survival.'),('s6021','Five friends embark on a mission to climb the highest peak in Java, overcoming obstacles on the way and discovering the true meaning of friendship.'),('s6022','When armed gunmen seize the Iranian Embassy in 1980, a tense six-day standoff ensues while elite British soldiers prepare for a dangerous raid.'),('s6023','Six friends decide to undertake a grueling mountain trek, only to find that the difficulties in store for them are not merely physical.')