 revealing documentary explores how the high-stakes world of Amateur Athletic Union basketball has professionalized youth sports in America.'),('s6193','After mysterious lights imbue her with extraordinary powers, a teenager goes on the run from authorities with the friend who harbors a crush on her.'),('s6194','When a broken ATM dishes out a fortune, a couple who works at the bank vies to see who can recover the most cash – and the loser must find a new job.'),('s6195','Captain Atomic – once a superhero, now a sock puppet – can only activate his powers with the help of Joey, his new partner and biggest fan.'),('s6196','Intrepid newspaper editor Harold Evans wages an ongoing battle to expose the truth about a dangerous drug and obtain compensation for its victims.'),('s6197','Four high school seniors steal an important college entrance exam and go on vacation to \"study'),('s6198','Newly released KGB files expose evidence proving how architects and engineers conspired with the Nazis to build a camp designed for genocide.'),('s6199','Three teams of gold hunters battle all manner of challenges while pursuing their dreams in the Australian Outback.'),('s6200','In a dystopian future, an insurance adjuster for a tech company investigates a robot killed for violating protocol and discovers a global conspiracy.'),('s6201','Superheroes amass to stop intergalactic sociopath Thanos from acquiring a full set of Infinity Stones and wiping out half of all life in the universe.'),('s6202','Follow the meteoric rise of Tim Bergling, aka Avicii, from Swedish teenager to the creative force behind \"Wake Me Up'),('s6203','This biopic traces the tumultuous life and career of top cricket player Mohammad Azharuddin, who led India\'s national team in the 1990s.'),('s6204','Orphaned and at loose ends, young Mukesh falls into the seductive orbit of married Sarika, who leads him ever deeper into a world of sex and betrayal.'),('s6205','Following Turkey\'s bloody coup of 1980, a widowed reporter returns to his Aegean hometown, bringing his son and a last wish for his estranged father.'),('s6206','When an American couple vacationing in Morocco falls victim to a random act of violence, a series of events unfolds across four countries.'),('s6207','Through intimate interviews, this documentary explores the stigma facing independent women who seek housing in modern Mumbai.'),('s6208','When their car breaks down en route to São Paulo, a father and son accept a ride from four beautiful telemarketers who are headed there on holiday.'),('s6209','A weekend hike for urbanites Alex and Jenn takes a dangerous turn when they become lost deep in the remote territory of a menacing bear.'),('s6210','When two would-be robbers accidentally kill a made man, they find themselves on the run from the South Philly Italian mob.'),('s6211','Haunted by visions of the dead, psychologist Peter returns home to confront a long-ago trauma. But will the trip exorcise or embolden the ghosts?'),('s6212','In this fast-paced actioner, two Miami narcotics cops are hot on the trail of a master crook who has snatched $100 million worth of heroin.'),('s6213','In this hyperkinetic sequel, a pair of Miami narcotics cops investigate a Cuban drug kingpin\'s connection to Florida\'s influx of Ecstasy.'),('s6214','A history teacher at the posh Abbey Grove, Alfie Wickers is something truly special: He\'s his school\'s, if not England\'s, single worst educator.'),('s6215','A player who uses the internet to facilitate his womanizing ways is tormented when he spurns a persistent woman who won\'t take no for an answer.'),('s6216','Four young Asian-American rappers strive to achieve success on their own terms in a musical genre that often treats them as outsiders.'),('s6217','When a man is killed, his wife and his lover – both of whom are pregnant with his children – come under the thumb of his brutal, dictatorial father.'),('s6218','A young woman who is suspected of practicing black magic and witchcraft 