 debt to a big Jakarta bookie in this action-packed comedy.'),('s6270','Trouble and high jinks ensue when a man and woman stumble on a bag full of money while out on the town.'),('s6271','A passionate romance with roguish barrister Tom Lefroy serves as the inspiration for the works of budding novelist Jane Austen.'),('s6272','Skeeter\'s life is turned upside down when the fantastical stories he makes up to entertain his niece and nephew inexplicably turn into reality.'),('s6273','Leonardo DiCaprio crisscrosses the globe to investigate the consequences of man-made globe warming and the measures being taken to reverse it.'),('s6274','After a documentary about the Japanese whaling industry garnered international attention, an amateur filmmaker decides to tell the rest of the story.'),('s6275','Follow singer and YouTube sensation Todrick Hall as he launches an original musical based on growing up gay in Texas and finding showbiz success.'),('s6276','Confident and cool under pressure, top news presenter Punchalee meets her match in the conniving Dao, who\'ll stop at nothing to fulfill her ambitions.'),('s6277','An Ankara homicide detective with a dark personal life and a disdain for rules and political correctness solves murders and fights police corruption.'),('s6278','After having her heart broken by a man who seduced her at a party, a young, ambitious woman concocts a scheme to get revenge.'),('s6279','With retirement staring him in the face, an all-time-great jump jockey pursues his 20th consecutive title in his unrelenting quest for glory.'),('s6280','Ambitious single TV journalist Mary Jane attempts to balance her career with her overbearing family and an increasingly messy love life.'),('s6281','An engaged fashion editor begins a torrid affair with a female roofer that threatens to turn both of their lives upside down.'),('s6282','Ben can transform into ten types of aliens. He\'ll try \'em all while adventuring across the country with his cousin Gwen and Grandpa Max.'),('s6283','An escaped psychopathic child killer faces off against one of his former victims, who has since become a hard-nosed detective.'),('s6284','Benji is back in this charming story that\'s told from the pooch\'s point of view, tracking his early days as a pup to his current life in showbiz.'),('s6285','While on a press tour, Benji goes behind the scenes of Santa\'s workshop. But Santa has a devastating secret, so it\'s up to Benji to save Christmas.'),('s6286','After a losing streak puts him in debt of 50,000 euros to his sponsors, an unlikely Turkish-German boxer in Berlin finds himself in need of a miracle.'),('s6287','Set in the Grey City, this \"Cities of Love\"\" installment is a star-studded'),('s6288','A just-married couple moves into their new home, finding themselves at war with the kids next door, who seem determined to make their lives miserable.'),('s6289','This documentary dives into the complex world of Herbalife, the international nutritional products company accused of being a pyramid scheme.'),('s6290','A young woman faces pressure to marry her brother-in-law, after her sister dies while giving birth. But she\'s secretly in love with someone else.'),('s6291','A man suffering from amnesia can\'t seem to choose between the women playing tricks on him.'),('s6292','In this anime adventure series for kids, the forces of good and evil \"blade it out'),('s6293','As the 2011 Cricket World Cup begins, three Indians demonstrate their passion and the sacrifices they\'ve made for the country\'s most popular sport.'),('s6294','A youthful drug dealer in Mumbai must change his ways when the sister who raised him is assaulted by her boss and imprisoned for defending herself.'),('s6295','A kind-hearted insurance agent has the mysterious power to temporarily shoulder the problems and pain of others, with comic results in his own life.'),('s6296','An impulsive, free-spirited woman who\'s defied convention for much of her life suddenly finds herself flirting with a classic romance.'),('s6297','A theater group lands in trouble when its new actress takes her own life, two of its members are framed for murder and no one is who they appear to be.'),('s6298','It\'s Diwali! To celebrate, Chhota Bheem and his friends put on a stage show of the Ramayana, re-enacting the epic story behind the festival of lights.'),('s6299','Siddharth dismisses warnings that his palace might be haunted, until ghostly occurrences force him to reconsider his beliefs.'),('s6300','After a couple moves into an apartment, the wife’s increasingly disturbing behavior unravels chilling secrets about their new home’s past.'),('s6301','A 23-year-old girl who\'s married to a man more than twice her age is forced to contend with the predatory nature of a male-dominated society.'),('s6302','When three teens free a spirit that offers to grant each a wish, they choose to become their favorite superheroes, launching a series of adventures.'),('s6303','The alcohol-fueled high jinks of a bachelor party go haywire when the buddies of an ill-fated groom abduct his fiancée\'s new lover.'),('s6304','Dumped by his girlfriend because he refuses to accept responsibility, overgrown adolescent Sonny Koufax adopts a 5-year-old to prove he\'s a grownup.'),('s6305','Writer and presenter Monty Don helps England\'s budding horticulturists plant and grow the gardens of their dreams.'),('s6306','Junior high students Jason and Kaylee take action when a greedy Hollywood producer turns Jason\'s essay into a hit film without giving him credit.'),('s6307','A tenderfoot and two gamblers seeking their fortunes in a boom town instead find themselves defending it from a gunslinging preacher and his gang.'),('s6308','In this documentary, architect Bjarke Ingels offers his vision for 2 World Trade Center as he aims to restore Manhattan\'s skyline to its former glory.'),('s6309','When his video game concept is stolen by a dishonest executive, a teenage chronic liar sets out to prove that he\