angerous gangsters trying to recover a fortune in stolen diamonds.'),('s6361','This reality TV series follows the men and women of New Zealand\'s border patrol in their quest to keep their country safe and secure.'),('s6362','A team of inept border agents tackles immigration issues at the fictional Northend Airport in this improvised mockumentary series.'),('s6363','Four 400-pound giants fight for the crown at the Arnold Strongman Classic and offer a glimpse into their lives leading up to the competition.'),('s6364','Casting a light on the mistreatment of sea mammals, this documentary follows the plight of 18 Beluga whales kept in captivity for years.'),('s6365','From lifting saggy skin to repairing shoddy breast enhancements, plastic surgeons tackle extreme fixer-uppers.'),('s6366','En route to a fresh start in Los Angeles, young couple Alex and Scarlett stop over in a sleepy Southwestern town that loosens their grip on reality.'),('s6367','Young Cuca leaves his idyllic village on a grand adventure to find his father, who has traveled to the city seeking work.'),('s6368','Single entrepreneur Veronica finally starts to believe in love after meeting sexy Lance, but she soon discovers he\'s hiding something from her.'),('s6369','This interactive series uses games, illusions and experiments to illustrate how our brains manufacture our reality and often play tricks on us.'),('s6370','After 12 years in the minors, a struggling baseball player retires, returns home and faces the last person he struck out with – his ex-girlfriend.'),('s6371','When high school hierarchy divides four best friends into different cliques, the girls defy expectations and try to bring their groups together.'),('s6372','Weeks before being named Miss World, Linor Abargil was raped. She tells the world her inspiring true story in this Emmy-nominated documentary.'),('s6373','Small-town residents mistake an Orson Welles radio broadcast for news about an alien invasion and are emboldened to act as they await an apocalypse.'),('s6374','Songstress sisters Toni, Traci, Towanda, Trina and Tamar Braxton open up about their lives and their relationships — and reveal a few surprises.'),('s6375','One filmmaker’s quest to expose the human rights violations faced by India’s LGBTQ community was a project of passion seven years in the making.'),('s6376','In mid-1970s Australia, two small-town teenage boys befriend an enigmatic middle-aged surfer, who urges them to see the thrill in facing their fears.'),('s6377','Teenage loner Brendan Fry navigates his high school\'s intense social network to discover a killer\'s identity after his secret crush is murdered.'),('s6378','When cheerleading champs the Rebels are challenged by an edgy new squad, they take on teams from all over the world in a virtual cheer battle.'),('s6379','In this reality series, everyday individuals adopt healthier lifestyles and transform their bodies to reclaim their confidence – with dramatic results.'),('s6380','Three cops find themselves hurtling toward the same crime scene on one fatal night in this tense, edge-of your-seat thriller.'),('s6381','While tracking down a seditious painter, an imperial guard is accused of a royal assassination attempt and framed in a complicated conspiracy.'),('s6382','An Indian American man living with his artistic wife and contentious father-in-law struggles to handle his household and a foundering IT company.'),('s6383','To keep pal Boots from being sent to a rival school with better athletics, prankster Bruno leads an epic campaign to build a pool at Macdonald Hall.'),('s6384','Fed up with weird dress codes and wacky punishments, the students of neighboring schools face off against two recently hired oddball authoritarians.'),('s6385','The biggest troublemakers at Macdonald Hall are Bruno and Boots, who are caught and face an unthinkable punishment: separation into different dorms.'),('s6386','In this historical drama series, young Prince Siddhartha undergoes an intense spiritual journey that eventually transforms him into the Buddha.'),('s6387','Two Indonesian brothers learn the ways of the American cowboy before returning home to avenge the murder of their father.'),('s6388','A willing team of chefs and researchers goes on a gastronomic adventure around the globe to weigh the benefits of using bugs as a future food source.'),('s6389','When four college friends reunite for a bachelor party, their hunt for cash said to be hidden in Kentucky\'s backwoods leads to bloodshed and betrayal.'),('s6390','A clever uncle-nephew duo solves mysteries, crimes and other problems for the citizens of a colorful town where something zany is always going down.'),('s6391','After leaving Iowa with stars in her eyes, Ali arrives at a Los Angeles burlesque lounge with dreams of taking the stage with her soaring voice.'),('s6392','This revealing documentary probes the onstage personas of Portland, Oregon, burlesque performers who practice wildly different art forms.'),('s6393','An aspiring writer goes to the airport to pick up a high school friend returning from a trip to Africa but is disheartened to see her with another man.'),('s6394','This sketch series focuses on the eccentric characters in a small Scottish town, including bumbling cops, \"DJ Jesus\"\" and a disgruntled serial killer.\"'),('s6395','When their diverse neighborhood is besieged by a mysterious militia, a grad student and an ex-Marine become an unlikely team in a battle for survival.'),('s6396','Elizabeth Taylor won an Oscar as Gloria Wandrous, a stylish call girl who yearns to go straight, especially after she thinks she\'s found Mr. Right.'),('s6397','This historical drama explores the long and often volatile friendship of painter Paul Cézanne and writer Émile Zola, who first met as schoolboys.'),('s6398','As a flesh-eating virus rips its way through a remote woodland cabin, the terrified teens vacationing inside wonder who\'ll fall victim next.'),('s6399','Engineer Dick Strawbridge and craftsman Will Hardie tour eight unique cabins built for a pop-up hotel in Wales, and construct No. 9 on their own.'),('s6400','After witnessing a child’s death during a violent clash, a former soccer player launches a youth team to help local kids avoid further bloodshed.'),('s6401','When Julia literally falls into Alejandro\'s backyard from her apartment above, it\'s just the jolt that\'s needed to nudge these two loners together.'),('s6402','Gifted doctor Cho-in leads a charmed life while his older brother Seon-woo seethes with jealousy in this series inspired by Biblical characters.'),('s6403','When their aging father’s illness reunites two sisters under one roof, new tensions arise between them as old wounds and hidden secrets surface.'),('s6404','Five calendar models try to navigate the twists and turns thrown in their path by the seductive and ruthless world of glamour.'),('s6405','The adorable residents of Sylvanian Village always have lots of fun with their friends and families!'),('s6406','Freya heads into town with her mother for a very special occasion: a dress designed by her sister Stella is going to be in a fashion show!'),('s6407','Freya and her friends inspire the mayor to put on a competition at the fete to pick the loveliest thing in Sylvanian Village.'),('s6408','On his path to becoming Pope Francis, Father Jorge Bergoglio pursues his religious vocation in a country ravaged by a brutal military dictatorship.'),('s6409','Inspired by the famous song \"Contrabando y Traición'),('s6410','With the digital revolution just around the corner, the employees of Bibideaux camera store strive to stay relevant amid unstoppable change.'),('s6411','A young boy attends summer camp, where he overcomes his fears, stands up to bullies and learns important lessons about faith and life.'),('s6412','Established during World War II, North America\'s first secret agent training school – known as Camp X – paved the way for present-day espionage.'),('s6413','Fresh Army recruit Amy Cole is assigned to Guantanamo Bay\'s Camp X-Ray, where she forms a surprising bond with one of the prisoners in her charge.'),('s6414','On the cusp of marriage or divorce, four couples consider the meaning of love, sharing a life, meddling families and the weight of their commitment.'),('s6415','At a wild high school graduation party, aspiring writer Preston hopes to declare his love to popular girl Amanda, who just got dumped by the class jock.'),('s6416','Grad student Helen Lyle unintentionally summons the Candyman, a hook-handed creature made flesh by other people\'s belief in him.'),('s6417','When a huge marijuana shipment falls prey to thieves, the aftermath touches players from all ranks of the drug trade between Morocco and Europe.'),('s6418','Based on economist Thomas Piketty\'s best-selling book, this documentary examines wealth accumulation and its looming social repercussions.'),('s6419','Richi is a director of commercials whose computer memory drive is accidentally switched with that of Sneha, a woman he soon falls in love with.'),('s6420','A low-level drug dealer decides to move up the ranks of the illegal narcotics trade in Darndale, Dublin, putting him and his gang on a violent path.'),('s6421','Nestled in a faraway cloud is a rainbow-colored world called Care-a-Lot, home to the magical Care Bears who each have a special talent.'),('s6422','Sarah leaves her son in the Philippines to reunite with her husband in London, where she struggles personally and professionally as a care-home worker.'),('s6423','In the 1950s, a glamorous married woman and an aspiring photographer embark on a passionate, forbidden romance that will forever change their lives.'),('s6424','An outcast teen with telekinetic ability lashes out with her deadly power when the high school \"in crowd\"\" torments her with a sick joke at the prom.\"'),('s6425','As a lethal virus spreads globally, four friends seek a reputed plague-free haven. But while avoiding the infected, the travelers turn on one another.'),('s6426','Will Ferrell stars as a Spanish-speaking cowboy in this comedy about a Mexican clan trying to rescue their ranch from greedy creditors.'),('s6427','Turned into a young boy by a sinister potion, teen sleuth Conan helps solve baffling crimes while tracking down the nefarious agents who poisoned him.'),('s6428','Daniel Craig makes his debut as the newly minted agent 007, who\'s pitted against an infamous financier of global terrorism – at the poker table.'),('s6429','When Japanese troops invade Hong Kong, young Benny Ho flees to Macau and rises to the top of the city\'s casino business with pluck, diligence and wit.'),('s6430','Casino mogul Benny Ho wields enormous power. But a feud with his former partner and a massive fraud scheme soon threaten his family and his empire.'),('s6431','As four couples with different lifestyles go through the ebbs and flows of joy and sorrow, each must learn how to live a good life.'),('s6432','Members of a Southern clan scramble to curry favor with a dying, wealthy patriarch in this adaptation of Tennessee Williams\'s sizzling stage drama.'),('s6433','This documentary explores the worldwide economics of the burgeoning solar energy industry and its impact on hopeful job seekers in the United States.'),('s6434','Cats and dogs must set aside their differences and merge animal instincts when Kitty Galore decides to claw her way to global domination.'),('s6435','This fun, charming documentary follows the exploits of some very feline-friendly folks as they strive to get their kitties crowned Canada’s top cat.'),('s6436','Torn between old camaraderie and recent tensions, three ex-soldiers reunite to explore a deadly cave but soon discover terror beyond all expectations.'),('s6437','This documentary chronicles the philosophy and life\'s work of archivist P.K. Nair, who made a mission of preserving Indian cinema’s rich history.'),('s6438','Vying for a spot in the American Ballet Company, 12 dance 