s down, six friends pass their time exchanging horror stories, unaware that they may be part of one themselves.'),('s6569','In this chilling horror anthology series, actress and model Bipasha Basu meets people who have had disconcerting paranormal experiences.'),('s6570','After returning from school and getting married, a popular farmer begins to arouse resentment and jealousy among those around him.'),('s6571','An African American Gullah family leaves their coastal island home in 1902 and risks losing their culture to start a new life on the U.S. mainland.'),('s6572','A detective assists with an investigation into a brutal mass murder case in which his twin brother is the prime suspect.'),('s6573','A model student resorts to violence after witnessing greed and corruption wreak havoc on his life.'),('s6574','Following the shooting death of his older brother, a depressed and aimless 13-year-old boy falls in with a gang in rural Arkansas.'),('s6575','A YouTuber becomes obsessed with figuring out how his copycat archnemesis manages to steal all of his ideas.'),('s6576','Iconoclastic film director Brian DePalma takes a look back at the production of such classic movies as \"Carrie'),('s6577','After several failed attempts at taking his own life, a young man hires an aging assassin who’ll do anything to fend off retirement.'),('s6578','A surgeon’s perfect life is rattled when his daughter is taken hostage in their own home and he\'s given 24 hours to pay a hefty ransom.'),('s6579','After a series of strange deaths, a high school reporter tries to pin down the killer who\'s targeting students eligible for a prestigious scholarship.'),('s6580','As his father takes steps to move on, a New Yorker grieving his mom\'s death visits Los Angeles where new possibilities may bring him out of his funk.'),('s6581','A father and son bond on an impromptu road trip over deep conversations, unexpected confessions, strange encounters ... and a drunken escapade.'),('s6582','When he gets a fan letter from a young monster movie buff, Dracula visits him and soon has a new friend helping him to get his confidence back.'),('s6583','Finding a letter mailed to Santa by a girl asking for a new wife for her daddy, twentysomething Crystal sets out to make the girl\'s wishes come true.'),('s6584','When a Los Angeles family\'s patriarch dies, his dutiful eldest son plans the funeral – which becomes a fiasco thanks to a colorful cast of attendees.'),('s6585','Two federal agents battle through an army of rioting prisoners – and their sense of reality – inside a high-tech prison modeled after Dante’s Inferno.'),('s6586','Mountain bikers – including legend Brendan Fairclough – put their skills to the test and engage in daring feats set against vivid backdrops.'),('s6587','Former FBI agent Joe Pistone, the real-life \"Donnie Brasco'),('s6588','Back in Bondi Beach, where she grew up, DC Tori Lustigman investigates a gay man\'s murder and finds a link to her brother\'s death decades earlier.'),('s6589','Hired by a singer to defend her friend, who has been accused of murder, a formidable lawyer learns that the man he represents may not be innocent.'),('s6590','This film documents the story of minister Waitstill Sharp and his wife, Martha, who risked everything to save thousands of refugees fleeing the Nazis.'),('s6591','A man with a history of mental issues moves into his late parents\' mansion and comes to suspect his new home may be haunted.'),('s6592','After Zimbabwe\'s disputed 2008 election results, political enemies are asked to write a new constitution and save their country from a bleak future.'),('s6593','A highly skilled crew of bank robbers plotting a heist at the supposedly impenetrable Federal Reserve faces off against an elite unit of L.A. cops.'),('s6594','In the stand-up performance that made him a legend, comedian Denis Leary caustically holds forth on nonsmokers, vegetarians and other undesirables.'),('s6595','In a severe, drought-ravaged dystopia, the youngest of a farm family starts a quest for revenge after his brothers betray him and leave him for dead.'),('s6596','Along with her son and best friend, a grieving widow hikes into the woods to scatter her late husband\'s ashes, only to discover they\'re being stalked.'),('s6597','A man begins to regret his choices when his brother decides to join him as a member of the same terrorist organization.'),('s6598','Convinced his stepfather caused the crash that left his mother in a coma, a law student drunkenly agrees to his murder, then can\'t rescind the deal.'),('s6599','In a tailspin after her marriage collapses, Jamie falls for a helpful gentleman whose interest in her welfare hides sinister motives.'),('s6600','On a small Finnish island in 1666, a teenage girl in love with a married fisherman becomes the center of a tragic witch hunt and power struggle.'),('s6601','Seeking a missing woman in North Dakota, an FBI agent and a sheriff focus on her religious zealot husband but discover something far more sinister.'),('s6602','Through chats with host Rasika Dugal, mythologist Devdutt Pattanaik explores the meaning and modern-day relevance of Indian folklore and philosophy.'),('s6603','After science student Shesh Shahi – a shy eccentric with a strange connection to nature – is examined by a team of mental hospital doctors, a gripping portrait of schizophrenia emerges.'),('s6604','By day, mild-mannered Dexter is a blood-spatter analyst for the Miami police. But at night, he is a serial killer who only targets other murderers.'),('s6605','Tipped off about buried money in Goa, four ne’er-do-well friends go on the hunt, chased by a police officer who wants the treasure for himself.'),('s6606','Framed by an empress who plans to steal a dragon-taming mace, imperial magistrate Dee Renjie soon uncovers a greater plot that threatens the kingdom.'),('s6607','This illuminating documentary examines the aftermath of Princess Diana’s tragic death and the tense, dramatic week leading up to her funeral.'),('s6608','Featuring archival footage and personal recordings, this documentary offers candid insight into the life of the beloved princess.'),('s6609','An attractive young woman goes to work as a chambermaid for a troublesome couple. The wife is unreasonable, and the husband won\'t stop hitting on her.'),('s6610','Pierce Brosnan\'s final outing as 007 finds James Bond facing off against a North Korean terrorist who\'s in league with a British diamond merchant.'),('s6611','The sophisticated son of a powerful businessman falls for a simple, free-spirited girl whose older sister is in love with him.'),('s6612','In each episode, four celebrities join host Jon Favreau for dinner and share revealing stories about both show business and their personal lives.'),('s6613','The host of a dinner party invites his friends to bring the saddest loser they can find. But the ultimate schmuck turns everyone else into the losers.'),('s6614','Top scientists and paleontologists examine dinosaur fossils located throughout Canada, while searching for elusive new species.'),('s6615','Shaolin monk San Te returns to protect a fellow hero with a talent for finding trouble in this action-packed sequel to \"The 36th Chamber of Shaolin.\"\"\"'),('s6616','Follow Todd Standing, Dr. Jeff Meldrum and other researchers into the wilderness, where they try to capture definitive proof of Sasquatch\'s existence.'),('s6617','An intelligent but intense honor student traumatizes his high school teacher and mentor when he doesn\'t get the grade he believes he deserves.'),('s6618','After years of segregation and forced labor, a race of stranded aliens enlists in a resistance movement spearheaded by a rogue government agent.'),('s6619','In this reality series, brides-to-be stop at nothing to have their dream weddings despite meager funds, fallouts with friends or even absent grooms.'),('s6620','A young physician and his beautiful mistress get swept up in the danger and drama of the Bolshevik Revolution in this Oscar-winning epic.'),('s6621','A delusional ex-con rejoins his unhinged former partners for one last job: kidnap the baby of a mobster\'s enemy for ransom.'),('s6622','After losing his mom, 10-year-old Luke abandons competitive swimming. It takes a friendly dolphin to get him back in the water – and help him heal.'),('s6623','Winter the dolphin, who survived a tragic injury by receiving a prosthetic tail, bonds with an orphaned baby dolphin after her beloved pool mate dies.'),('s6624','A Copenhagen police officer hunts for the man who attacked his partner, only to stumble into a high-stakes game of espionage.'),('s6625','In this modern adaptation of a Spanish classic, an eccentric, elderly gentleman sets out with his honest sidekick to right the wrongs of the world.'),('s6626','A questionable character working as a self-styled \"biblical archaeologist\"\" advances his cause by creating phony religious artifacts.\"'),('s6627','Young Sally Hurst discovers she isn\'t alone in her new house: strange creatures live there – and they might not be as friendly as Sally thinks.'),('s6628','There are risks. Then there are risk-takers. In an around-the-world trip, follow athletes perform jaw-dropping acts in unpredictable elements of nature.'),('s6629','Using state-of-the-art technology, this stunning sequel follows athletes pulling off daring feats under extreme conditions in extraordinary locations.'),('s6630','Through deserts, above mountains and deep into oceans, elite athletes — both veteran and new — form bonds and pursue adventure in sumptuous landscapes.'),('s6631','A recovering addict becomes her estranged daughter\'s only hope after the teen awakens a terrifying child-stealing witch from an urban legend.'),('s6632','Aided by dramatic reconstructions and archive footage, Sir Richard Branson recounts his daring attempts to break hot air balloon records.'),('s6633','Six talented but struggling improv comics see a sudden shift in their troupe\'s dynamic after one of them lands a much-coveted gig on television.'),('s6634','When FBI agent Joe Pistone goes undercover to infiltrate the mob, he starts to identify with the made men he\'s charged with taking down.'),('s6635','A special ops squad investigating a distress signal from a distant planet discovers that mutant aliens have already wiped out most of the population.'),('s6636','This series highlights a diverse group of survivalists as they prepare for various catastrophic scenarios that could cause civilization to collapse.'),('s6637','When the tenant in their flat dies under suspicious circumstances, two bickering cousins are forced to navigate both sides of the law.'),('s6638','Sister Aloysius begins to have doubts about doting Father Flynn, who seems to have become overly involved in the life of an African American pupil.'),('s6639','The human-equine bond propels the unique and challenging sport of reined cow horse, in which dedicated trainers compete for the national championship.'),('s6640','While Mom is away, a bored little boy and girl are visited by the Cat in the Hat, who proceeds to turn the house into the \"mother of all messes.\"\"\"'),('s6641','A grump with a mean streak plots to bring Christmas to a halt in the cheerful town of Whoville. But a generous little girl could change his heart.'),('s6642','In ancient times when majestic fire-breathers soared through the skies, a knight comes face to face and heart to heart with the last dragon on Earth.'),('s6643','When an aspiring knight crosses paths with a dragon, the two form an unlikely alliance in a high-stakes battle against a malicious sorcerer.'),('s6644','This sequel introduces Draco the dragon\'s offspring, Drake, who dreams of becoming a knight and teams up with a stable boy to master his skills.'),('s6645','When the king of Brittania dies, the dragon who shares his heart must find a new ruler, but the monarch\'s grandchildren go to war over the throne.'),('s6646','Bheem helps to reopen Dragonpur\'s abandoned magic and martial arts school, but is tested like never before when an ex-student returns seeking revenge!'),('s6647','A huge fan of a Korean TV drama is transported to a magical realm where she has the power to alter her favorite show\'s story line as a \"Facilitator.\"\"\"'),('s6648','Narrated by Jeff Bridges, this compelling documentary examines some incredible achievements of engineering from across the globe.'),('s6649','On a cruise for gay men, five passengers of different nationalities take a break from their families and cultures to party and reflect on life.'),('s6650','This documentary explores the intense passion and distinctive talent that make Dries Van Noten one of the most unique fashion designers in the world.'),('s6651','A young dancer grapples with her dream to join a famed ballet company against the wishes of her mother, who pushes her to pursue a more practical path.'),('s6652','This absorbing documentary series follows the entire supply chain of the illicit drug trade, tracing its production, export, sale and consumption.'),('s6653','When Anastasia Cardona\'s drug lord husband is murdered, she inherits his cocaine empire, leading to a life of wealth, power, violence and betrayal.'),('s6654','A young mother embarks on a desperate quest for freedom when she kidnaps her 10-year-old daughter to save her from a tribal marriage.'),('s6655','When one of his colleagues becomes corrupted by power and goes over to the dark side, a young police officer tries to bring the offender to justice.'),('s6656','This wacky prequel to the 1994 blockbuster goes back to the lame-brained title characters\' days as classmates at a Rhode Island high school.'),('s6657','This documentary investigates the surge in vaping culture and whether e-cigarettes can really help smokers kick the habit.'),('s6658','When a construction project begins in their neighborhood, four friends start receiving bizarre encoded text messages on their cell phones.'),('s6659','Curious about everything and excited about science, 6-year-old Luna, her brother Jupiter and pet Clyde explore nature to learn about the world.'),('s6660','Earth\'s most sublime landscapes can also be the most forbidding. Discover how inhabitants survive and flourish in our planet\'s harshest environments.'),('s6661','From the Arctic to the Outback, humans battle the elements and use their ingenuity to survive in the most extreme environments in the world.'),('s6662','She’s not the usual candidate for the role, but a dogged Mexican-American mother makes it her mission to become a talented sushi chef.'),('s6663','When a lie about Olive\'s reputation transforms her from anonymous to infamous at her high school, she decides to embrace a provocative new persona.'),('s6664','Years after a wealthy man is healed by a rural herbalist, fate lands him in the same hospital where the woman\'s granddaughter is treating patients.'),('s6665','After deciding to reshape her life after divorce, Liz travels around the world in search of good food, spirituality and true love.');
INSERT INTO `description` VALUES ('s6666','Flashing the wild stand-up comedy that made him a household name, Eddie Murphy unleashes uncensored observations and parodies in this 1983 live show.'),('s6667','Two young adults with families on opposite ends of the political spectrum fall in love in a Kerala city torn by violence.'),('s6668','Driven by the lessons he learned from his mother, and the values of the Sikh religion, a man sets out on a mission to serve humanity.'),('s6669','A poor bus conductor\'s efforts at obtaining information about his enormous electricity bill are hindered by a corrupt system.'),('s6670','Imprisoned for underworld crimes she didn’t commit, a vengeful woman breaks free and goes scorched earth on the smooth-talking suitor who framed her.'),('s6671','A security expert and ex-CIA agent living in Belgium must go on the run with his estranged teen daughter when they\'re both marked for assassination.'),('s6672','Forty young crew members traveling aboard a training vessel are in for the adventure of a lifetime – especially when a storm leaves them lost at sea.'),('s6673','One man makes a fateful decision to get involved with a Colombian drug cartel in this series based on a novel by Andrés López López.'),('s6674','Drug trafficker Pepe Cadena navigates the treacherous waters of warring cartels in Mexico and Colombia while avoiding capture by the DEA and police.'),('s6675','El Chavo is a poor, nameless orphan who lives in an apartment building with La Chilindrina, Quico, Doña Florinda, Don Ramón and Professor Jirafales.'),('s6676','Spanish-Mexican writer Paco Ignacio Taibo II hits the road to trace the footsteps of Ernesto \"Che\"\" Guevara and sheds new light on the revolutionary.\"'),('s6677','Religion thwarted Lucas and Jade\'s young love. They reunite decades later, but Jade\'s heart is torn between the man she knew and his younger clone.'),('s6678','This documentary chronicles the decade-long process that led to the end of the ETA, a Basque terrorist group that operated for more than 50 years.'),('s6679','Regional Mexican singer El Vato and his friends struggle to succeed in the enticing but deceptive music world in Los Angeles, California.'),('s6680','Popular South American bands Márama and Rombai share footage of behind-the-scenes antics and discuss their sudden rise to stardom.'),('s6681','Friends Proog and Emo live in a capricious, seemingly infinite machine with a sinister purpose in this experimental computer-animated short.'),('s6682','A blend of the royal family\'s intimate recollections and rarely seen home movies pays tribute to Queen Elizabeth II on the eve of her 90th birthday.'),('s6683','When a young newlywed enters the one chamber in her husband’s mansion that’s off-limits, she faces the horrifying consequences of defying the rules.'),('s6684','Trace the overlapping journeys of exceptional women swept up in World War I and hear their tales of bravery on history\'s front lines.'),('s6685','Mothers, nurses, soldiers and deportees – these women fought against persecution for freedom and survival amid the turbulence of World War II.'),('s6686','From Asia, Africa and Latin America, five women share extraordinary stories of strength and determination in the face of violence and inequality.'),('s6687','Then and now footage of bit players who appeared in \"Star Wars\"\" tells the story of how the film and its legions of fans changed their lives forever.\"'),('s6688','A suburban couple hires a new sitter to watch their three kids for the night, unaware that the young woman isn\'t who she claims to be.'),('s6689','In 1950s Makassar, the life of a devoted mother is upended when another woman enters her husband\'s life.'),('s6690','Expelled from private school for attempted suicide, emo Ethan enters the world of Seymour High and meets a cute Christian who\'s ready to convert him.'),('s6691','Two pairs of contestants go head-to-head for several rounds, deciphering puzzles and messages comprised of emojis for a chance at a $10,000 prize.'),('s6692','This documentary explores the extent to which our sense of smell directs our survival instincts and enriches our sensual experiences.'),('s6693','Warehouse workers Vince and Zack compete in a full-on war to be named Employee of the Month and win a date with their dream girl.'),('s6694','This fictional series tells the stories of what happens to people when they feel caged in, whether physically, psychologically or emotionally.'),('s6695','After accidentally killing a young mobster, a guilt-stricken police officer searches for the parents who never came forward to claim their son\'s body.'),('s6696','This documentary series tries to get at the root of some of the most heinous crimes ever committed by deranged, cold-blooded criminals.'),('s6697','Officers Taylor and Zavala patrol the streets of South Central Los Angeles, an area of the city ruled by gangs and riddled with drug violence.'),('s6698','Siblings separated as children who no longer recognize each other are pitted against each other in a war involving drugs, crime and betrayal.'),('s6699','When a humdrum academic spots his double in a movie, he launches a search that leads him to a small-time actor who looks exactly like him.'),('s6700','This documentary digs deep to recount the saga of the superstar self-help guru convicted of negligent homicide in the deaths of three followers.'),('s6701','After his ailing father makes a shocking confession, a desperately depressed man sets out to find the woman he believes will change his destiny.'),('s6702','Recruited by a British agent, Shaolin master Lee infiltrates a remote island and a brutal martial arts tournament to spy on a sinister crime lord.'),('s6703','Two young lovers depart from the norm simply by having romantic feelings for each other in a society where humans have been relieved of all emotions.'),('s6704','In a dystopian future, a totalitarian regime maintains peace by subduing the populace with a drug, and displays of emotion are punishable by death.'),('s6705','Artistic rebellion ignites at the movies when film characters suddenly speak freely to the audience, prompting a surly censor to combat the uprising.'),('s6706','Cora has three sons and a daughter and she´s almost 80. One day during a family reunion the big question comes up: who will be her heir?'),('s6707','An ill and addled man recalls what seems to be a brief but powerful past romance with a kindred spirit, a young Russian woman who lived a lonely life.'),('s6708','While investigating a brutal string of deaths, a detective begins to suspect that mind control may have played a part in the murders.'),('s6709','An entrepreneur prone to partying and his estranged brother, a teacher resigned to a humdrum life, begin to bond under fragile circumstances.'),('s6710','Singers from all over Europe represent their countries in an international showdown and vie for superstar glory.'),('s6711','God summons narcissistic Evan to build an ark in preparation for a flood. Meanwhile, Evan\'s family interprets his new hobby as a midlife crisis.'),('s6712','After a signal is received from a long-missing spaceship, a rescue ship investigates, but the crew soon realizes something unimaginable has happened.'),('s6713','After a paramedic’s violent death during a weekend trip, his spirit inhabits his friends’ bodies in an effort to save them from a similar fate.'),('s6714','Journeying back to her small Spanish hometown for her sister\'s wedding, Laura must grapple with long-buried secrets when her daughter is abducted.'),('s6715','Materials scientist Mark Miodownik takes us into the world of everyday objects that make our lives more comfortable than those of our ancestors.'),('s6716','After two community college geology professors discover microscopic alien life-forms on a meteorite, the military and government become involved.'),('s6717','A coder at a tech company wins a week-long retreat at the compound of his company\'s CEO, where he\'s tasked with testing a new artificial intelligence.'),('s6718','Still haunted by the traumatic event that ended her high school romance, a young professional gets a new subordinate: her former sweetheart.'),('s6719','Young journalists working for a magazine juggle careers, romance and other challenges while reporting on social issues and news stories in Malaysia.'),('s6720','When terrorists hijack a 747 and turn it into a nerve gas bomb aimed at Washington, D.C., commandos use an experimental plane to try to stop them.'),('s6721','Featuring interviews with participants on all sides, this documentary questions Norway and the West\'s protracted military involvement in Afghanistan.'),('s6722','When James\'s living situation turns sour, he has little choice but to move in with his new girlfriend – a decision he almost immediately regrets.'),('s6723','Maverick cop Orin Boyd joins forces with an unlikely ally in gangster Latrell Walker to take down a group of dirty Detroit cops.'),('s6724','Mistakenly accused of kidnapping, a veteran soldier leaves a trail of broken bad guys in his wake as he tries to rescue a teen sex trafficking victim.'),('s6725','Grasping hungrily for stardom, bit actor Andy Millman and his pal Maggie spend their days chasing after work as film and TV extras.'),('s6726','A clarinet player who lives with his grandparents in a small village is forced to move to Istanbul, where he meets a singer enjoying sudden fame.'),('s6727','Hüseyin has found his father, and now has one more mission – to get together with the girl of his dreams, with a little help from his new friend.'),('s6728','Life is tough for Hüseyin after marrying his true love. He works day and night to support his growing family, while singer Firuzan copes with fame.'),('s6729','A young man framed for a crime escapes a prison sentence by faking his own death and assuming a new identity as he seeks revenge.'),('s6730','Maddy and Cole were inseparable before high school. Then she got popular; he didn\'t. But after Maddy is betrayed, she and Cole reunite – to ruin prom.'),('s6731','Two former friends, who now live far apart, learn about each other\'s insecurities and secrets over a series of video chats.'),('s6732','When four young wizards team up to take jobs across the kingdom, they forge a bond more powerful than any magic and grow stronger with every mission.'),('s6733','Fiona Bruce and Philip Mould use investigative skills and scientific techniques to determine if paintings are real or just impressive forgeries.'),('s6734','A young man enlists the help of his friends to avenge his uncle\'s death by taking on a powerful, unscrupulous politician.'),('s6735','Following a night of hard partying that left their tycoon boss dead, four women try to keep it a secret in hopes of closing a billion-dollar deal.'),('s6736','A tough homicide cop faces his most dangerous assignment when he must stop a murderous evil spirit who can move from one host to the next.'),('s6737','An ex-con struggles to take care of his two brothers, a gambling addict and a young man with Down syndrome, after being released from prison.'),('s6738','Follow an 11-year-old boy as he goes from ordinary child to colorful competitor in his quest for a big win at India’s biggest kite-flying festival.'),('s6739','When a successful young rap star has an affair with an obsessive fan, his life is turned upside down when she kidnaps him.'),('s6740','Spunky, lower-caste lad Jabya falls for lovely, upper-caste Shalu. But his family\'s derided social position proves a stubborn stumbling block to love.'),('s6741','A beauty expert, a drug dealer and a bungling revolutionary end up in the grips of an extremist group after meeting on a plane to Lebanon.'),('s6742','A young man from a humble family is drawn into a life of crime – and soon confronts a determined cop in hot pursuit.'),('s6743','A modest, compassionate priest doubles as an effective crime solver in this series based on the short stories by G.K. Chesterton.'),('s6744','A sportswriter and his Samoan lawyer embark on a hallucinogenic three-day romp from Los Angeles to Las Vegas in this counterculture cult favorite.'),('s6745','Possessed lovers, witches, haunted houses and more bring tales of horror to the screen in this anthology series.'),('s6746','Talking squarely to the hip-hop generation, musicians, athletes and others outline the benefits of exercise, a healthy diet and spiritual wellness.'),('s6747','This adaptation of the musical chronicles the trials of a Jewish peasant, his wife, and their three strong-willed daughters in pre-revolutionary Russia.'),('s6748','In Lagos, Nigeria, four successful women on the verge of 50 take stock of their lives and loves over the course of one week.'),('s6749','Quirky little Figaro has a whole alphabet\'s worth of phobias. These wordless animated shorts follow his many fears from A to Z.'),('s6750','In this documentary, passionate high schoolers travel the country and come of age during a turbulent yearlong prep for a national speech competition.'),('s6751','In 19th-century Istanbul, a young police officer investigates crimes and falls in love with the daughter of a wealthy merchant conspiring against him.'),('s6752','Leon Vitali had a thriving acting career most others would envy. Then he gave it all up to devote himself completely to the vision of Stanley Kubrick.'),('s6753','The level-headed owner of a struggling coffee shop finds his future at risk when his partner – a talented but cocky barista – makes a major bet.'),('s6754','After narrowly avoiding a fatal plane explosion, a group of seemingly lucky teen classmates finds that Death is not so easily cheated.'),('s6755','On a road trip with friends, Kimberly has a premonition that saves everyone from a freak accident. More terrifying visions prompt her to seek help.'),('s6756','When a girl prevents her premonition of a deadly roller-coaster mishap from coming true, the survivors must face the consequences of cheating death.'),('s6757','Heartbreak, hope and nostalgia collide in this complex portrait of Lampedusa, a Mediterranean island where thousands of migrants land each year.'),('s6758','Grappling with love and loss in their respective lives, two estranged brothers must confront their traumatic, unresolved past when they cross paths.'),('s6759','Unaware they’ve matched online, a struggling writer embellishes his lifestyle to impress a successful exec with whom he sparks an unexpected romance.'),('s6760','A stock broker brings his young son back to the town where he grew up for a hunting trip, but things take a dangerous turn when they witness a crime.'),('s6761','A young couple fights supernatural foes in an attempt to save their daughter from the dark and mysterious forces that follow her every move.'),('s6762','In this exploration of the life-changing power of the ocean, six people from very different backgrounds find purpose and meaning in the sea.'),('s6763','Harry Dean Stanton narrates this documentary that follows two modern-day cowboys as they welcome new calves at Montana\'s Fishtail Basin Ranch.'),('s6764','In this reality series, physique meets fashion as contestants compete in challenges to transform both body and image for the grand prize of $100,000.'),('s6765','Top athletes from around the globe test their fitness in a four-day competition at the first-ever CrossFit Sanctional event. Let the games begin.'),('s6766','When five ninjas whose fighting styles are based on natural elements unleash their fury on a rival school, a lone survivor vows deadly revenge.'),('s6767','A team of skilled contractors and designers hosted by Antonio Sabato Jr. renovates houses, cabins and even RVs, transforming properties in one day.'),('s6768','A college professor goes up against the giants of the auto industry when they fail to give him credit for inventing intermittent windshield wipers.'),('s6769','Nosy family in tow, a fun-loving bachelor goes on a romantic getaway, but he ends up pretending to be married to a complete stranger to avoid trouble.'),('s6770','One night in 1959, four young musicians venture from Pasadena to South-Central Los Angeles in the hopes of hearing a living jazz legend play.'),('s6771','An ordinary student, who forms an advice club with her friends to help others, gains special powers after a mysterious encounter.'),('s6772','The emperor\'s reign of terror expands. Heroic outlaw Ma Teng joins a squad of female rebels, whose leader is torn between family loyalties.'),('s6773','Aspiring to be an internet celebrity and make big bucks, a filmmaker travels the world to learn the tricks of the trade from social media influencers.'),('s6774','In this series, TV presenter Michael Mosley and botanist James Wong explore the physics, chemistry and biology inside every bite of food we eat.'),('s6775','Familial bonds strain as dramas concerning love, greed, business and generosity simmer across generations.'),('s6776','This documentary follows 10 men who agree to walk the Camino de Santiago, a 500-mile, 40-day trek that will challenge their strength and faith.'),('s6777','This adaptation of Ntozake Shange\'s play consists of a series of poetic vignettes that explore the lives of modern African American women.'),('s6778','As chef Curtis Duffy oversees every aspect of opening his own restaurant, Grace, he recalls his turbulent childhood and difficult adult relationships.'),('s6779','When a vicious war against Catholics is waged in Mexico in the 1920s, a retired general joins the militia fighting to preserve religious freedom.'),('s6780','When a goofy but likable millionaire discovers his fiancée’s plan to steal his wealth, he devises an unromantic scheme to make her life a living hell.'),('s6781','A woman with a passion for fowl keeps a menagerie of birds that draws the ire of neighbors, animal rights advocates and even her own family.'),('s6782','Benji and his owner get separated in Greece. On his quest to find them, he\'s targeted by various bad guys who want to get their hands on him.'),('s6783','Frisbee national champion Brodie Smith challenges inventive athletes across the US to an exhibition match in the unconventional sports they\'ve created.'),('s6784','This documentary chronicles the tragic, true story of Justin Fashanu, the first – and only – openly gay man to have played professional soccer.'),('s6785','A pulp-fiction sci-fi classic, Forbidden Planet stars Leslie Nielsen as a heroic starship captain who finds the paradise planet Altair-IV.'),('s6786','This dynamic series spans the globe to explain the complex natural forces that govern the planet, from shape and color to motion and the elements.'),('s6787','In the wake of the plane crash that claimed the lives of 71 people, the Brazilian soccer club Chapecoense seeks to rebuild the team that made history.'),('s6788','The furor over the addition of two Muslim players to the Beitar Jerusalem soccer club underscores the role of institutionalized racism in Israel.'),('s6789','Teenage Xue Ming was forced to marry the man who raped her. Years after abandoning her young sons to find a better life, can she escape the guilt?'),('s6790','According to the research of two food scientists, the popularity of processed foods has led to epidemic rates of obesity, diabetes and other diseases.'),('s6791','A dating couple is forced to spend their first Christmas together visiting each of their four divorced parents – in a single day.'),('s6792','As Havana slowly revolves through the year, wistful detective Mario Conde probes the sultry heart of the city to investigate dark and deadly crimes.'),('s6793','A commitment-phobic Brit tries to reconnect with an alluring American who\'s about to make a seemingly awful mistake by marrying a wealthy, boring man.'),('s6794','Ted Crawford, who allegedly attempted to murder his wife, is now locked in a battle of wits with a young assistant district attorney.'),('s6795','Determined to make it as a 