y upsets a vengeful demon.'),('s6847','World War IV is over, but a bomb has gone off in Newport City, killing a major arms dealer who may have ties with the mysterious 501 Organization.'),('s6848','After selling his soul to save a loved one, daredevil biker Johnny Blaze pays the price by becoming a flame-skulled bounty hunter for Mephistopheles.'),('s6849','As Motoko and Batou attempt to thwart a mysterious terrorist group, Togusa tracks the killer of a man with a prosthetic leg made by Mermaid\'s Leg.'),('s6850','Two history buffs with an eye for valuables traverse through forgotten mines and abandoned landmarks in the wild, wild West to score collectibles.'),('s6851','Freed of her responsibilities for the 501 Organization, Motoko must now learn how to take orders from Aramaki.'),('s6852','Giving up his life of crime for love, a gangster struggles with a moral dilemma when tragic events and enduring enemies take him back to the underworld.'),('s6853','Indonesian activist Soe Hok Gie experiences a political awakening during the tumultuous regimes of Suharto and Sukarno. Inspired by true events.'),('s6854','Gigi\'s an avant-garde French waif being groomed as the fille de joie of affluent and handsome Gaston. Soon Gigi metamorphoses into a stunning beauty.'),('s6855','With the Cold War looming over them, teen best pals Ginger and Rosa share everything in early 1960s London – until betrayal drives them apart.'),('s6856','Quadruplets separated as babies reunite in Manila when one needs a liver transplant, but long-held family resentments threaten to derail everything.'),('s6857','This engaging documentary chronicles the 1980s phenomenon \"The Gorgeous Ladies of Wrestling'),('s6858','Amid Malaysia\'s charcoal industry, a woman deftly adapts to her environs as she juggles three men in her life: her husband, her lover and her friend.'),('s6859','After a young mother is widowed by war, her faith is tested as she struggles to stay afloat financially and raise her daughter.')