 of hyperprivileged Manhattan private-school kids seem to get away with everything. Except an anonymous blogger is watching their every move.'),('s6887','After a car crash, a criminal psychiatrist awakens to find that she\'s a patient in the same mental institution that currently employs her.'),('s6888','A former freedom fighter is forced to navigate the corridors of a disinterested bureaucracy to prove that he fought in India\'s freedom movement.'),('s6889','A newly widowed Korean War veteran faces his racism and his past when the son of the Hmong family next door tries to steal his beloved 1972 Gran Torino.'),('s6890','Host Kevin McCloud presents people who take self-building houses to a new level, following every step of their ambitious plans from beginning to end.'),('s6891','To learn the truth about his sister\'s mysterious disappearance, a young man infiltrates a hotel in the guise of a footman and begins an investigation.'),('s6892','Leaving their wives at home, three randy friends look forward to some raunchy extramarital fun at their college reunion.'),('s6893','Good girl Cam recruits her pot-loving bestie Jinky to help deliver a backpack full of weed for her drug-dealing fiancé.'),('s6894','John Travolta and Olivia Newton-John star in this hit musical comedy about a greaser and the good girl he falls for – much to his friends\' chagrin.'),('s6895','In this reality series, amateur interior designers on tight budgets test their mettle transforming rooms with speed and style.'),('s6896','This series explores the effects of the extreme temperature variations at Yellowstone National Park on the animals that live there.'),('s6897','At the end of their low-budget tour, a punk band accepts a gig at an isolated rural club, only to discover that their hosts are neo-Nazis.'),('s6898','Three young Nigerian bohemians, each from one of the country\'s major ethnic groups, explore the directions in which their lives could go.'),('s6899','Tech tycoon John McAfee made millions from his anti-virus software. Now, he may be best known for his bizarre and scandalous lifestyle.'),('s6900','Filmmakers follow a Colorado family\'s highly public battle for the rights of their transgender daughter, Coy, in a landmark civil rights case.'),('s6901','Two roaming Kenyan bandits attempt to change the course of their lives by exchanging their rifles for running shoes.'),('s6902','On the surface, the Social Welfare Agency appears to help orphaned schoolgirls, but it\'s actually turning them into lethal agents.'),('s6903','Guy Martin assists in preparing the last airworthy Vulcan bomber for a farewell tour while revealing the stories behind the iconic aircraft.'),('s6904','When an earthquake hits Chile, rescue workers must put aside their differences to save the country from a businessman\'s evil scheme.'),('s6905','When an uneducated mother of eight suddenly becomes mayor, she uses the skills she\'s learned as a housewife to keep her town running like clockwork.'),('s6906','In 1949, with freedoms threatened, housewife Hükümet is unaware of her future life in politics as she faces off with liar and mayoral hopeful Faruk.'),('s6907','Three comedians launch a company designed to spread happiness far and wide in this Thai sitcom packed with gags, sound effects and special guests.'),('s6908','The son of an astrologer faces opposition from his superstitious father regarding his scheme of launching a mango business.'),('s6909','A young woman recovering poorly from a bad romance gets a new lease on life after encountering a handsome man during a job interview.'),('s6910','In 1962, ambitious plus-size teen Tracy Turnblad tries to integrate a racially divided Baltimore one Watusi at a time.'),('s6911','This anthology features seven independent anime shorts from renowned directors, delving into the futuristic universe of the video game franchise Halo.'),('s6912','Witness the origins of Master Chief and the Spartan program as a group of children transform into en