en an aging Lothario gets the boot from his sugar mama, he must pull out all the stops to find a new female sponsor.'),('s7016','Dray lives life one woman at a time and is the envy of all his friends, until his sister decides to show him the error of his philandering ways.'),('s7017','In the 1970s, a group of activists who gathered to protest nuclear testing formed the iconic Greenpeace environmental organization.'),('s7018','Real estate expert and TV presenter Sarah Beeny meets with clever property owners who share their colorful stories about living mortgage free.'),('s7019','A conflicted young woman spends the summer with her grandmother, her great-aunt and their quilting circle, whose life stories captivate her.'),('s7020','This whimsical look at rough-and-tumble American politics examines the influence of money, religion and even ancient Rome on presidential campaigns.'),('s7021','A schoolteacher known for his good deeds and benevolence takes a walk on the dark side after undergoing a heart transplant.'),('s7022','This action-packed animated double feature pits the Hulk against two of the Marvel Universe\'s most powerful characters: Wolverine and Thor.'),('s7023','A scheming matriarch plots to cut off her disabled stepson and his wife from the family fortune, creating a division within the clan.'),('s7024','Two kindred spirits who are betrothed to others must decide whether to go through with arranged marriages or brush aside convention for true love.'),('s7025','To fulfill her mother\'s dying wish, middle-class Khirad marries elite Ashar. But those who disapprove plot to turn Ashar against his wife.'),('s7026','While filming his daily life for a media course, Cowen discovers his small English town may be under an ominous and otherworldly influence.'),('s7027','U.S. Border Patrol agent and deadly hunter Jim Rhodes takes violent revenge when a group of desperate thieves kidnaps his daughter after a robbery.'),('s7028','A hired gun has second thoughts when he\'s 