py and a smooth operator from Miami scheme to sell a Soviet submarine to a Colombian drug cartel for $35 million.'),('s7675','Drs. Chris and Xand van Tulleken take an entertaining approach to educate children about medicine and biology through experiments and hospital visits.'),('s7676','On Yi-seul\'s wedding day, her friend Baek-ho wishes he could turn back time to tell her he loves her. Soon he gets a chance to change everything.'),('s7677','A special task force takes on a risky operation to evacuate civilians amid civil war. Based on the 2015 mission to rescue Chinese citizens in Yemen.'),('s7678','When a programmer uses his wife\'s sympathetic voice for his company\'s customer service app, he starts to rely more on her idealized self than her.'),('s7679','Leader of the Ten Kwangtung Tigers, Tieh Chiao-san works with his kung fu students to protect his village from crime. But when an opium dealer starts to ruin the town, Tieh Chiao-san struggles to fight back, thanks to his growing opium addiction.'),('s7680','This documentary series explores the stories behind history\'s most fascinating innovations, including games, technology, sports, medicine and more.'),('s7681','When the village\'s biryani cook unexpectedly passes, a widow steps up to the plate and takes on new delectable challenges.'),('s7682','After inventing a drug that induces time-compressed virtual realities, young Ren grapples with partner Sam over how to use their powerful creation.'),('s7683','Young orphan Kuttappayi goes to live with his grandfather in the country, but his new life takes a hard turn when his grandfather\'s health fails.'),('s7684','In 1986, Tommaso Buscetta became the first top-level Mafia boss ever to testify against the mob. It cost him and his family everything.'),('s7685','A young man invents a device he hopes will generate wireless energy, but instead, it proves to spark sinister, supernatural activity in his home.'),('s7686','In a battle of the bands, a percussions student and her musical kindred spirits set out to prove the merits of Chinese folk against the Western canon.'),('s7687','After a failed mission, an ex-Royal Marines Commando tries to overcome his demons while investigating the death of his ex-girlfriend\'s father.'),('s7688','An orphan girl taught magic by her sick grandma must find work in seedy Bangkok, where unsavory characters run afoul of her increasingly dark powers.'),('s7689','A prostitute who is down on her luck gets caught in the middle of an elaborate scheme orchestrated by two local politicians.'),('s7690','P. King, the daring but hapless duck, teams up with best buddies Wombat and Chumpkins to find wacky and wild ways to solve their problems.'),('s7691','When she loses her beloved husband to a brain tumor, grieving widow Holly Kennedy learns that he left a series of letters behind to help her cope.'),('s7692','A face painter for Theyyam rituals who is himself disfigured conceals his guilt over the fact that he performs abortions as a medical practitioner.'),('s7693','This documentary traces the steps of druglord Pablo Escobar with vivid eyewitness accounts that reconstruct his bloody reign in Colombia.'),('s7694','In this animated satire, a covert squad of operatives short on smarts but long on confidence tackles crime on the glitzy Gold Coast of Australia.'),('s7695','When profit-seekers threaten to take over a bar in a tourist town, local martial artists put their skills to the test and fight back.'),('s7696','This fictionalized account of three real-life notorious Harlem drug dealers is told in flashbacks as they plunge into the world of hustling.'),('s7697','In the wake of a young artist’s suicide, his pianist mother and his despairing girlfriend square off in a living nightmare beset by guilt and blame.'),('s7698','In this dramatized rendition, students undergo rigorous study at Master Yu\'s Peking Opera school, a cradle for future Hong Kong film stars.'),('s7699','From the comfort of their bedroom, the P