ing of Christmas from a group of children when he is mistaken for a donated Christmas toy and is shipped to a foreign land.'),('s7790','The chaotic ramblings of a young architect\'s mind take hold of his life as he leaves behind his past in India to work in Prague.'),('s7791','Frank Capra\'s documentary chronicles the rise of authoritarianism in Germany, Italy and Japan as America prepares for a defense of liberty.'),('s7792','A man and a woman struggling to keep their respective marriages afloat run into each other at a marriage counselor\'s office, with unexpected results.'),('s7793','A documentarian uses his own family\'s experiences as a springboard to explore the ethical issues surrounding the FDA and pharmaceutical industry.'),('s7794','When a blood-spattered altar boy is found running from a murder scene, his conviction seems certain – but his attorney is determined to win the case.'),('s7795','Two young buddies seek love in Hawaii, and upon returning home in disappointment, soon entangle themselves in a messy identity swap.'),('s7796','A prince and a commoner who are best friends keep having to thwart the plots of the prince\'s scheming, ambitious minister.'),('s7797','A teenager moves to Chicago for the summer and finds a poignant mentor in her aunt and a sweet love interest in a girl who works in the neighborhood.'),('s7798','When a confident college professor is courted by four eligible and well-established men, she struggles to decide who she likes the best.'),('s7799','Ken Burns\'s documentary traces the passage of the 18th Amendment, the social and legal effects of prohibiting alcohol, and the repeal of Prohibition.'),('s7800','A gripping profile of Ben Ferencz, the last surviving lead prosecutor at the Nuremberg trials whose lifelong desire for justice altered the rule of law.'),('s7801','A Spanish con man masquerades as a therapist and starts leading group sessions in Argentina for a crew of gullible misfits.'),('s7802','A notorious terrorist manipul