.'),('s7920','This documentary profiles the celebrated Hindi film director known as much for his embrace of leftist politics and social concerns as lyrical cinema.'),('s7921','A team of journalists are sent to find out who\'s behind a classified ad seeking a companion for time travel, then must decide how to approach him.'),('s7922','A charming cabbie, a cop turned assassin and a housewife who’s also a hooker share one thing in common: a bizarre and violent afternoon in Kolkata.'),('s7923','When two college students – a rich man’s daughter and a fisherman’s son – defy social edicts by falling in love, violence erupts in their village.'),('s7924','Caught in a downward spiral of failed career moves, misguided ambitions and bad relations, a pair of lost souls find hope in an unexpected friendship.'),('s7925','A street vendor\'s simple life is turned upside down after the Egyptian revolution of 2011, forcing him to contend with criminals and cops alike.'),('s7926','On a family visit, a young man and his girlfriend set out to discover why his eccentric uncle has been mysteriously confined to one room for years.'),('s7927','When a young girl is killed in a suspicious train accident, three very different lives become intertwined in their quest for answers.'),('s7928','Disliked for his stinginess, Samir finds his life turned upside down when he receives a windfall and launches a television channel.'),('s7929','The Biblical story of Samson becomes this sword-and-sandals epic about an Israelite warrior whose God-given brawn is undone by a beautiful temptress.'),('s7930','The king’s ship has been taken over by seemingly fearless pirates! Can Bheem find the one thing that might scare them away?'),('s7931','After the Allies invade Italy, the Liri Valley town of San Pietro becomes an example of the brutal effects of combat, both for soldiers and civilians.'),('s7932','In an effort to honor the family matriarch\'s dying wish, Urmila and her husband, Shrikant, embark on a quest to 