eft to raise her alone.'),('s7985','After a Ukrainian high school teacher\'s tirade against government corruption goes viral on social media, he finds himself the country\'s new president.'),('s7986','A diamond heist goes horribly wrong, and the group of friends who sought to make a fortune must instead fight for their very survival.'),('s7987','Best friends Carrie, Miranda, Samantha and Charlotte take a break from their busy New York lives for an all-expenses-paid luxury vacation to Abu Dhabi.'),('s7988','When Carrie\'s big step forward in her relationship goes awry, best friends Charlotte, Miranda and Samantha are there to help her pick up the pieces.'),('s7989','A high-end call girl falls for a handsome man she meets at a nightclub, but he harbors a secret that throws a wrench in their relationship.'),('s7990','Passions flare and alliances form when neighbors Ana and Miguel each start an affair with former lovers, right under their spouses\' noses.'),('s7991','A homeless vet who has PTSD steals a motorcycle and hits the road, trying to sort out what life means now that war is in the rear-view mirror.'),('s7992','This documentary series explores the explosive 2006 murder case of a 13-year-old Israeli girl and the subsequent conviction of a Ukrainian immigrant.'),('s7993','At large in the city, five inmates of a mental asylum run up against the insanity of the outside world while trying to prevent a terrorist plot.'),('s7994','This miniseries recounts the early 19th-century conflict between the expanding British Empire in Africa and Shaka, the leader of the vast Zulu Nation.'),('s7995','A young mother must break free of the clutches of her husband\'s feudal family and bring herself and her young child to safety.'),('s7996','Three disparate characters uncover government corruption as a small Indian town receives an influx of foreign money to turn it into the next Shanghai.'),('s7997','Unable to bribe his way out of a reckless driving charge, an arrogant rich kid is 