 woman seeks revenge on the forces that tore apart and wrongfully imprisoned her family.'),('s8024','As the result of a TV journalist\'s curiosity, the amazing saga of an honorable government tax collector\'s past comes to light.'),('s8025','Unemployed and immature, a somewhat pathetic bachelor sets his sights on finding a date for the wedding of his younger, more successful brother.'),('s8026','Nearly a century after artificial intelligence tried to eradicate people from Earth, two survivors search for a human enclave rumored to still exist.'),('s8027','A psychologist and her mute son confront evil forces at the site of a terrible tragedy involving an ancestral Ouija board and a demonic secret society.'),('s8028','A groom-to-be and his pals celebrate with a debauched night out that ends with a supernatural assault by a stripper who is not what she appears to be.'),('s8029','After the death of their beloved mother, three foster sisters find their bond tested by old grudges, career tensions and a startling revelation.'),('s8030','A New Jersey detective whose family was killed by an international gangster teams up with a Bangkok cop on a quest to bring down a criminal empire.'),('s8031','Artists test their creativity and body painting skills as they face off in a series of elaborate challenges, vying for a grand prize of $100,000.'),('s8032','In each episode of this \"Skin Wars\"\" spinoff hosted by RuPaul'),('s8033','To capture a crime lord who killed his partner and kidnapped his partner\'s daughter, a Hong Kong detective teams with a smart aleck American gambler.'),('s8034','The security chief at a top-level medical facility must fight to ensure that revolutionary cancer research doesn\'t fall into the wrong hands.'),('s8035','Only a few women pilots take part in the sport of aerobatics. Director Fredric Lean captures their powerful spirit at the World Aerobatic Championships.'),('s8036','After a wild night of partying, Terry discovers that he\'s one of the few people left on Earth, then sets out to solve the mystery of what happened.'),('s8037','Many years after hooking up in college, two people cross paths and realize they are both serial philanderers who need each other\'s help to reform.'),('s8038','As high school approaches, four best friends have a summer sleepover and participate in a scavenger hunt against their popular archrivals.'),('s8039','A man returns home after being released from a psychiatric hospital, where he\'d been confined since age 12 for murdering his mother and her lover.'),('s8040','A divorcée moves into a high-rise with a sordid past and begins a steamy affair with her neighbor, unaware that her every move is being monitored.'),('s8041','Welcome to the irreverent world of Robert Hall – aka Slobby Robby – a pop culture junkie who buys and sells collectable goods from the \'80s and \'90s.'),('s8042','Determined to find the woman he loves, a Scottish teenager braves the Western frontier of 19th-century America, with bounty hunters hot on his trail.'),('s8043','When the Commando Elite, a group of toy action figures, are released before they\'ve been tested, they attack the children playing with them.'),('s8044','An unexpected romance and a surprise visit from his wild brother turn the life of widowed professor Lawrence Wetherhold upside down.'),('s8045','Buckle up for a look inside a biannual school bus race in Florida, a harrowing event where carnage and collisions are most definitely encouraged.'),('s8046','To keep his teen crush from spotting him in an embarrassing YouTube video, Anthony and his friend Ian must enter the virtual world and alter the clip.'),('s8047','After a mission to rescue a U.S. congressman from the Taliban ends with two men left behind, their sniper buddies go against orders to get them back.'),('s8048','An arranged marriage becomes a friendship for Viren and Aditi, who aren\'t in love – until they begin having unexpected feelings for each other.'),('s8049','This documentary foll