ionship with a woman, leaving sex and physical intimacy out of it.'),('s8101','A young woman rattles her former boyfriend’s family when she reveals she is pregnant with his child — despite his death five years ago.'),('s8102','As a writer ponders how to kill off her main character, the man begins hearing her voice in his head and realizes that his days are numbered.'),('s8103','Join Strawberry Shortcake and her berry best friends in the whimsical land of Berry Bitty City, where they learn about teamwork and decision-making.'),('s8104','Dumped by his partner just before a major dance competition, gifted hoofer Scott Hastings is forced to take a graceless neophyte as his new partner.'),('s8105','A quarter-century later, this documentary relocates the male dancers who backed Madonna on her 1990 Blond Ambition tour, as seen in \"Truth or Dare.\"\"\"'),('s8106','After losing everything, an indolent sad sack impulsively joins the U.S. Army and cajoles his best friend into enlisting, too.'),('s8107','A former FBI employee works as a stripper to finance her custody battle for her daughter when a secretly shady congressman takes an interest in her.'),('s8108','Born with supernatural strength, Bong-soon fights evil and procures justice while getting tangled in a love triangle with her CEO boss and cop crush.'),('s8109','After a tough upbringing, natural-born fighter José Aldo confronts his personal demons in his quest to become an MMA champion in this sports biopic.'),('s8110','From Spain\'s countryside to Scotland\'s stony terrain, this collection of uplifting documentaries explores the cultural roots of great strongman traditions.'),('s8111','Zany misadventures are in store as lovable city mouse Stuart and his human brother, George, raise the roof in this sequel to the 1999 blockbuster.'),('s8112','After a near-death trip home, a Marine looking to help his comrade survive returns to the underground world of MMA, where new battles await.'),('s8113','A grueling battle over turning a seaside town near Rome into a gambling paradise exposes criminal rivalries and endemic corruption on a grand scale.'),('s8114','When his boyhood crush Ern returns, Ped forms a band with his friend to impress her. Romantic rivalries bloom after the talented Ern joins the group.'),('s8115','When a soccer club manager brings one of his injured foreign players home to recuperate, they form an unlikely bond despite their cultural differences.'),('s8116','A failed businessman must kill himself to pay off a loan shark or his family will die, but a detective discovers the case turns on a shocking secret.'),('s8117','Waiting for news of her prisoner-of-war husband, a French woman in Nazi-occupied France reluctantly falls for a German officer quartering in her home.'),('s8118','A renowned corporate attorney at a prestigious firm gambles on a dropout with a photographic memory but no law degree to help on high-stakes cases.'),('s8119','A group of 20-somethings in a small town experience a variety of personal and relationship issues leading up to a gathering at the local watering hole.'),('s8120','When a quirk of fate kicks the Danish national soccer team into the European Championship final, the coach must whip his unprepared squad into shape.'),('s8121','While investigating a child kidnapping, a Mumbai police inspector is haunted by a shadowy dream figure and memories of his own abducted daughter.'),('s8122','In this 3D-animated spinoff from the Chhota Bheem series, valiant superhero Bheem goes beyond his village to fight the good fight across the universe.'),('s8123','Hoping to find a magical root, a monster has captured farmers in the land of Vyom. It’s up to Bheem and the gang to foil his plan and save the kingdom!'),('s8124','A tragic accident drives a wedge between two teenage boys, threatening a friendship that had seemed firm and unshakeable.'),('s8125','A loving, concerned American grandson travels to Mumbai to rescue his unappreciated grandmother from her drudgery and fulfill her true potential.'),('s8126','A cheerful jet and his transforming pals strive to find peaceful solutions to their problems while delivering packages to children around the globe.'),('s8127','Hoping to have sex before college, high school seniors Seth and Evan try to score booze for a huge party, leading to a series of wild misadventures.'),('s8128','To get away from the thug life, cocaine dealer Youngblood Priest puts together one last deal that will net him enough money to start over.'),('s8129','When Superman returns to Metropolis, he finds that Lois Lane has moved on to another man and Lex Luthor is developing a new plan to rule the world.'),('s8130','This series examines the aerodynamics of flight and the evolutionary processes that have enabled certain species to survive by taking to the skies.'),('s8131','A socially awkward Catholic schoolgirl vows to win a dreamy classmate’s affections by taking first prize at an upcoming talent show.'),('s8132','Hoping to fulfill her deceased mother\'s final wish, a young woman travels to Prague to deliver an old letter to a mysterious man.'),('s8133','As more women come forward with harrowing accusations against R. Kelly, his criminal case gains momentum in this follow-up to the powerful docuseries.'),('s8134','Former inmates, officers and celebrities critique the U.S. prison system in this documentary packaged as a how-to handbook for the incarcerated.'),('s8135','Beyond her larger-than-life persona, this documentary reveals the woman behind the famed event planner, and her legacy as a cultural icon and activist.'),('s8136','Chef Rick Bayless, farmers and others discuss the history leading to the sustainable food movement and how it could change what we eat in the future.'),('s8137','After she enters into an arranged marriage, a spirited and intellectual young woman tries to adjust to life with a man who was not her choice.'),('s8138','Born into poverty and denied an education, a village boy overcomes society’s obstacles to become India’s foremost spiritual guru, revered by millions.'),('s8139','After being falsely imprisoned, a vengeful murderer covers his tracks by enlisting the help of a baker whose meat pies become the toast of London.'),('s8140','In a remote Alaskan town reeling from a sudden triple murder, a former rodeo champ befriends a lone newcomer with a violent occupation.'),('s8141','A washed-up corpse with surprising abilities gives a hopeless man stranded in the wilderness someone to talk to – and a newfound reason to live.'),('s8142','Haunted by the past, a master swordsman masks his identity to work anonymously as a janitor in a brothel, setting in motion a violent chain of events.'),('s8143','Shaolin warrior Tung Chien-chen is injured in battle against the hated Wu Tang clan, and nursed back to health by a knife-throwing master. As he recovers, Tung learns this deadly art, and also falls in love with his teacher\'s daughter.'),('s8144','Aliens fleeing their planet land on Earth, pose as teenagers and fight off mutant space monsters by joining forces to become a powerful giant robot.'),('s8145','Businessman Manav falls for aspiring singer Mansi, but their romance faces an uphill climb when Manav must depart and Mansi\'s suave manager moves in.'),('s8146','After his family\'s donkey is confiscated by a moneylender, 8-year-old Tahaan travels across conflict-torn Kashmir to find his beloved pet.'),('s8147','Set in the financial boom of the late 1980s, this tale centers on a recent college grad trying to figure out what to do with his life.'),('s8148','After a personal tragedy upends his life, a highly skilled former Green Beret is drawn into a career as a secret government operative.'),('s8149','In 1976, naive Mary Ann Singleton moves to San Francisco and finds a new family in her bohemian landlady and the eclectic residents at 28 Barbary Lane.'),('s8150','A man and a woman on the run from the law are drawn to each other through the common bond of their mutual dependency.'),('s8151','A night out in Paris quickly unravels when two friends provoke the wrong taxi driver, who\'s after something bigger than cab fare.'),('s8152','After being shipwrecked off the African coast, a lone child grows up in the wild, and is destined to become lord of the jungle.'),('s8153','How did the King of the Jungle ascend to the throne? Find out in this charming prequel to the hit animated movie that catches Tarzan as a young child.'),('s8154','A down-on-his-luck man must prove he\'s not as hapless as he seems when the woman he\'s on a date with is suddenly kidnapped.'),('s8155','After he loses his favorite racing car, Duri ventures to a mysterious, magical land filled with toys that have been thrown away.'),('s8156','It\'s been decades since Brown v. Board of Education, yet American schools remain largely segregated. Some leaders are working to change that.'),('s8157','Luck brings together math expert Perci Trachtenberg and obscure genius Venkat Subramaniam in a casino, but the foundations of probability may be utterly altered when their chat leads Subramaniam to try a new theory in the gambling dens of Mumbai.'),('s8158','Two teen girls form an intense bond and launch a lucrative webcam business, leading them to a dangerous encounter with a middle-aged married man.'),('s8159','In this animated adventure, Master Splinter whips the four Ninja Turtles back into shape to defeat monsters running amok in New York.'),('s8160','The evil Shredder decides that ooze is what gives the ninja turtles their power, so he obtains some of the toxic junk and creates dangerous mutants.'),('s8161','After exposure to a strange, glowing ooze, four mutant turtles train as ninjas in the sewers and fight crime wherever they find it.'),('s8162','A flamboyant con artist and his band of gleeful robbers gamble with fate when smugglers hire them to swipe antiques from a speeding train.'),('s8163','Three teenaged best friends on the planet Telluria begin an incredible journey of adventure as they fight against the most evil being in the universe.'),('s8164','Animosity gives way to love and forgiveness when an angry teenager reunites with his estranged biological father in the wilds of Patagonia.'),('s8165','Five shorts reveal a fictional Hong Kong in 2025, depicting a dystopian city where residents and activists face crackdowns under iron-fisted rule.'),('s8166','We all want so much more than we have, but how far are we willing to go to get it?'),('s8167','Ten years after John Connor saved Earth from Judgment Day, he encounters T-X, a robotic assassin ordered to finish what T-1000 started.'),('s8168','All grown up in post-apocalyptic 2018, John Connor must lead the resistance of humans against increasingly dominating militaristic robots.'),('s8169','This visually arresting documentary essay reflects on our relationship to other living creatures as humanity becomes more isolated from nature.'),('s8170','On Halloween night, inside a dilapidated apartment building, Art the Clown stalks his victims, slicing and slaughtering in terrifying silence.'),('s8171','New beginnings appear to be on the horizon after a simple country boy forms a bond with a sophisticated urban girl with modern ideas.'),('s8172','This high-octane thriller tells the story of a man on a mission to reclaim what was taken from him and the agent who\'s determined to stop him.'),('s8173','A hungry fox and three resourceful, surprisingly formidable birds turn the animal kingdom on its head in this lively animated series.'),('s8174','From controversial cartoonist to powerful Mumbai politician, this biopic maps the meteoric rise of far-right Shiv Sena party founder, Bal Thackeray.'),('s8175','Feel groovy in 1970s suburbia, where a teen and his pals hang in the basement, listening to rock and indulging other hazy benefits of \'70s culture.'),('s8176','Examine the triumphs, tragedies, cultural shifts and technological leaps that occurred during the millennium\'s first decade.'),('s8177','An intense rivalry between Henry Ford II of the Ford Motor Company and Enzo Ferrari results in the most epic showdown in racing history.'),('s8178','In a violent prison in 1970s Mexico, a young inmate lands a spot on a football team that doubles as an enforcer squad for a corrupt administration.'),('s8179','Decades after WWII, a former SS officer stands trial in his native Germany after being charged for his complicity in the murder of Jews at Auschwitz.'),('s8180','Author Stephen Elliott has a problem separating his own life from incidents in the life of a convicted murderer about whom he\'s writing a book.'),('s8181','An insurance adjuster investigates cases of possible fraud while hiding a romance with a colleague, unaware that someone he trusts is toying with him.'),('s8182','After finding a peculiar key, three smart and adventurous kids launch a quest to uncover the whereabouts of a coveted archaeological treasure.'),('s8183','Imagine your worst fears, then multiply them: Figaro is a boy with any number of phobias and a highly quirky and imaginative way of dealing with them.'),('s8184','A 10-year-old dreamer\'s imaginary friends – mighty Sharkboy and fire-producing Lavagirl – come to life to seek his help battling a nefarious baddie.'),('s8185','This 3-D motion capture adapts Georges Remi\'s classic comic strip about the adventures of fearless young journalist Tintin and his trusty dog, Snowy.'),('s8186','In the City Without a Voice, only faceless singer the Voice can still vocalize. Everyone else has lost the power of speech as they let Mr. TV\'s broadcasts speak for them. But when Mr. TV kidnaps the Voice, things change.'),('s8187','Formerly a Korean resistance fighter, a policeman working for Japan is tasked with tracking down resistance leaders before they acquire explosives.'),('s8188','The widowed president strikes up a romance with a beautiful Washington lobbyist – but can the couple keep their private and political lives separate?')