egin to heal.'),('s8202','Britain\'s most ineffective but caring teacher takes his class to Cornwall for one last school trip, where anything could happen –\n and probably will.'),('s8203','In this documentary, teachers at a Mojave Desert high school adhere to a belief that compassion and life skills can profoundly help at-risk students.'),('s8204','While working at a family friend\'s business, a penniless orphan draws the attention of a corrupt competitor and is torn between divided loyalties.'),('s8205','Known for tortuous role-play with victims in his basement, a twisted serial killer abducts a musician who has a deeper connection to his mind games.'),('s8206','Director John Ford captures combat footage of the Battle of Midway, an air and sea campaign that was a turning point in the war in the Pacific.'),('s8207','The artistic pursuits of two childhood friends, an aspiring singer and a talented dancer, lead them to four other 20-somethings in a drumming group.'),('s8208','Using breakthroughs in technology and neuroscience, this series examines how environment affects infants – and how infants can affect our future.'),('s8209','Host Francesca Stavrakopoulou travels across the Middle East, offering extraordinary insights into the stories of the Old Testament.'),('s8210','In a global competition, eight fishing enthusiasts battle extreme conditions and dangerous waters to be crowned the ultimate angler.'),('s8211','This documentary highlights spontaneous encounters with the elusive, comedic veteran, who touches lives by simply showing up anywhere.'),('s8212','A couple\'s new dream home morphs into a nightmare after they learn that an evil and lustful spirit resides in their basement.'),('s8213','When their parents fail to pick them up for winter break, two students stay on at an all-girls boarding school in the company of a terrible presence.'),('s8214','Husband. Father. Fighter. Meet Chuck Wepner, the liquor salesman and self-proclaimed real-life inspiration behind 