eir home condo.'),('s8228','A Yoruba prince and a young lady from a prominent Igbo family face tribal prejudice and parental pressure when they secretly wed.'),('s8229','Brothers Jake and Will Grimm travel from village to village, posing as exterminators of magical creatures. But in reality, they\'re expert con artists.'),('s8230','Two terminally ill men bust out of the cancer ward with a plan to experience life to the fullest before they kick the bucket.'),('s8231','A taxi driver longs to be a pop singer, but the road to stardom is wrought with competition and struggle until he befriends a helpful belly dancer.'),('s8232','After losing everything, a young man rebuilds his life and finds love in 1920s Shanghai – all while rising to power in an organized crime syndicate.'),('s8233','Three college students move into an off-campus house and discover they\'ve unwittingly unleashed a supernatural killer known as the Bye Bye Man.'),('s8234','His way of life under threat due to the oil fracking boom, a young rancher defends a Lakota woman and becomes entangled in human trafficking.'),('s8235','When a German baker travels to Jerusalem in search of his dead male lover’s family, his growing involvement with them may expose his truth.'),('s8236','Food-crazed travel junkies journey across India, completing bucket list challenges for a chance to win a once-in-a-lifetime scholarship.'),('s8237','Eight years after their daughter\'s abduction tore them apart, her parents receive enigmatic clues from the kidnapper hinting that she\'s still alive.'),('s8238','In his small Southwestern town, sheriff Wade Parent must find out who — or what — is running people down via a mysterious, driverless black sedan.'),('s8239','Featuring eight-time NBA All-Star Vince Carter, this documentary takes an in-depth look at his impact on pop culture and the Canadian basketball scene.'),('s8240','Bothered by his wife\'s unyielding belief in Christianity, an investigative reporter sets out to use verifiable facts to poke holes in her faith.'),('s8241','A special operations officer vows to get revenge against the terrorist who killed his friend in a brutal attack.'),('s8242','A group of executives heads to a telecommunications retreat to pick the firm\'s new CEO until they find themselves in a contest to win – and stay alive.'),('s8243','After an architect transforms a slaughterhouse into trendy lofts, its new inhabitants discover that the structure is haunted by its evil past.'),('s8244','Home cooks face off against trained chefs to see if passion can beat profession in the kitchen in this reality competition show.'),('s8245','A detective investigates the murder of a young musician, whose philandering lifestyle leaves a long list of suspects and a lot of questions.'),('s8246','In 1937, Spanish revolutionary Ramón trains as a Soviet spy, impersonating a wealthy Belgian as part of a plot to assassinate Leon Trotsky in Mexico.'),('s8247','Young Ulises falls in love with teen Sofia, even as he is forced to lure her into his family\'s prostitution ring. Now he\'ll do anything to rescue her.'),('s8248','A progressive new minister\'s arrival in a small village threatens to end an age-old tradition that brings a yuletide miracle to one of the residents.'),('s8249','Four brothers prepare for war when they\'re forced to deliver secret holiday gifts to the school bullies. But they soon learn kindness goes a long way.'),('s8250','In Depression-era New Orleans, cocksure stud poker player Eric Stoner – the titular Cincinnati Kid – challenges longtime champ Lancey \"The Man\"\" Howard to a showdown at the table'),('s8251','In this three-part documentary series, host Marcus du Sautoy examines the mathematical code underlying all of life on Earth and the universe itself.'),('s8252','A successful businessman comes face-to-face with America\'s downsizing epidemic when he loses his job and is forced to take a construction gig.'),('s8253','After developing an \"infidelity formula\"\" said to repel cheating'),('s8254','A divorced handyman with a drinking problem bonds with his 8-year-old son when a search for his stolen toolbox leads to a series of misadventures.'),('s8255','Actress Robin Wright plays herself in this surreal drama about a film star who agrees to have her digital image recorded for reuse in future films.'),('s8256','A notorious forger known for his ability to create fake passports and visas finds himself the target of a con man\'s ruse.'),('s8257','At a Catholic school, a new girl falls in with a clique of teen witches who wield their powers against anyone who crosses them, even their parents.'),('s8258','Thirtysomething career woman Jae-yeong attempts to juggle her job and personal relationships, all the while never failing to eat well.'),('s8259','When an earthquake obliterates their cave, an unworldly prehistoric family is forced to journey through unfamiliar terrain in search of a new home.'),('s8260','One year after Eric Draven and his fiancée are murdered, Draven – watched over by a hypnotic crow – returns from the grave to exact revenge.'),('s8261','When the captain of a pleasant cruise ship mistakes a mischievous stowaway the entertainment director, wild and wacky hijinks ensue.'),('s8262','IRA terrorist Fergus bonds with his prisoner, Jody. Jody tells Fergus of his girlfriend, Dil, with whom Fergus later falls in love.'),('s8263','On an ominous island off of Nova Scotia, two brothers chase historical theories on a quest for enigmatic treasure.'),('s8264','A loser in charge of planning his high school class\'s 20-year reunion thinks he\'s scored a major coup when he gets a marginally famous alum to attend.'),('s8265','An optimistic farmer is determined to succeed in spite of the lack of rain in his region, and the sinking spirits around him.'),('s8266','Orphaned by a tragedy that took the lives of her parents, Srintil grows up in a poor Indonesian village aspiring to be a sacred dancer.'),('s8267','In this mythical tale, Jen, the last of the Gelfling race, is charged with healing the Crystal of Truth after its mutilation sets off an era of terror.'),('s8268','Struggling with Mumbai\'s pressures and private battles with depression, six lives intersect just as they reach a breaking point.'),('s8269','An aspiring filmmaker records the chaos of an alien invasion while struggling to stay alive with her sister and a bickering band of survivors.'),('s8270','Having returned home for his cagey father\'s wedding, an estranged man gets to know his childhood friend\'s family and uncovers a devastating secret.'),('s8271','Cameras follow Tommy Caldwell and Kevin Jorgeson as they take on the staggering challenge of free-climbing Yosemite’s most formidable rock formation.'),('s8272','A boy and his best friend – his newly detached butt – embark on wacky adventures in a world where humans and their butts live side by side.'),('s8273','Two rookie Boston cops are sent deep undercover – one inside the gang of a charismatic Irish mob boss and the other double-crossing his own department.'),('s8274','While traveling across Argentina to a new job, a longtime maid encounters a salesman who opens her eyes to life\'s beauty and possibilities.'),('s8275','Five high school students serving Saturday detention in a former corrections facility must find a way to outsmart an unseen menace out to kill them.'),('s8276','In Rome, \"Exorcist\"\" director William Friedkin follows a 91-year-old priest who performs a real demonic exorcism on a woman from a small Italian town.\"'),('s8277','At once spooky and grisly, this thriller follows a woman\'s quest to find the truth behind claims her mother killed three people during an exorcism.'),('s8278','Thwarted in their attempt to take over the world of Ente Isla, Satan and his general Alciel land in modern-day Tokyo, where they take on human form.'),('s8279','This documentary details DuPont\'s alleged decades-long cover-up of the potential harm caused by chemicals used to make popular Teflon products.'),('s8280','Terrorized by unexplained disturbances and horrific visions in her home, a young widowed mother turns to her scientist boyfriend for help.'),('s8281','A trio of friends struggles to make it through adolescence, all while hoping that bigger and better things await them.'),('s8282','Child psychologist Tom Seymour\'s testimony helped convict a boy of murder. Years later, their paths cross again, raising uncomfortable questions.'),('s8283','A variety-show production trips up big time when the cast members take their roles to new heights, and the line between fact and fiction blurs.'),('s8284','In 1866, a Texas Ranger investigates some suspicious deaths in a town ruled by a religious despot whose past contains a disturbing link to his own.'),('s8285','The Duke boys are back in this comedy based on the TV series, following Bo and Luke as they tear around Hazzard County in their trusty Dodge Charger.'),('s8286','The mischievous Duke boys, Bo and Luke, are sent to live with their Uncle Jesse and cousin Daisy in this prequel movie to the popular TV series.'),('s8287','This is the astonishing true story behind a moment in TV history: the live 1961 broadcast of Nazi mass-murderer Adolf Eichmann\'s trial in Jerusalem.'),('s8288','This nostalgic documentary series relives the 1980s from a variety of angles, exploring its impact on the politics, technology and culture of today.'),('s8289','\"Rolling Stone\"\" reporter David Lipsky shadows famed writer David Foster Wallace in this fictionalized account of their revealing five-day encounter.\"'),('s8290','As kids, they escaped a UFO death cult. Now, two adult brothers seek answers after an old videotape surfaces and brings them back to where they began.'),('s8291','During a stop at a remote cabin deep within the woods, a group of teens begins turning into flesh-eating zombies in director Sam Raimi\'s cult classic.'),('s8292','During World War II, a Nazi officer charged with protecting an exiled Kaiser Wilhelm II from spies begins a steamy affair with a secretive Dutch maid.'),('s8293','At the remote farmhouse where she once witnessed a traumatic childhood event, a young woman develops a grisly fascination with violence.'),('s8294','Richie Beckett is an aging Brighton crime boss who\'s struggling with the onset of dementia, just as a rival gang is trying to take over his territory.'),('s8295','After 20 years on Death Row, self-educated inmate Nick petitions the court to be executed, then tells his twisting, turning tale of despair and hope.'),('s8296','During their bachelorette weekend, a lesbian couple\'s relationship hits a snag when one of the brides confesses to never having an orgasm.'),('s8297','After a string of defeats, a boxer rediscovers his fighting will with help from his trainer and half-brother, a once-talented pugilist.'),('s8298','When a pair of friends discovers a mystical sculpture in an abandoned shrine, good fortune is bestowed upon them – until luck starts running out.'),('s8299','Nick O\'Bannon thinks he\'s cheated death when he keeps a grisly premonition from becoming reality, but he soon realizes that fate has other plans.'),('s8300','Two determined Athenian attorneys spearhead a lawsuit against the British Museum for the return of the Parthenon Marbles to Greece.'),('s8301','Jesus, who\'s hitting the big 3-0, brings a surprise guest to meet the family. A Christmas special so wrong, it must be from comedians Porta dos Fundos.'),('s8302','Following a friend\'s suicide after her husband dumps her for a younger model, three women plot payback against their two-timing exes.'),('s8303','Twenty years after 5-year-old Jesse disappears near his home, his DNA turns up at the scene of a woman\'s murder, baffling his family and the police.'),('s8304','A dying kung fu master sends his last student to track down five former pupils in order to learn which one of them has become evil.'),('s8305','The Flintstones hit the big screen in this live-action comedy that finds Fred and Barney struggling to cope with the pressures of work and family.'),('s8306','Yabba-dabba-doo! Digital dinosaurs rule the day when Fred, Barney, Betty and Wilma take Vegas by storm in this prequel that posits their lives before marriage.'),('s8307','In Qing-dynasty China, the emperor commands that a weapon be invented to kill at a distance without a trace. Then he orders it used on its wielders.'),('s8308','Jackie Chan and Jet Li star in this rousing adventure about a martial arts movie fan who finds a mystical staff that transports him to ancient China.'),('s8309','This documentary follows the police of Oakland, California, as they reform and face the challenges of corruption, commitment and cataclysmic change.'),('s8310','After his daughter is killed by terrorists, a sullen restaurateur seeks the identities of those responsible and travels to Ireland to take vengeance.'),('s8311','After a teenager goes to live with his father in abandoned public housing, he hears strange noises and decides to investigate with his new friend.'),('s8312','This offbeat drama charts the ups and downs of an interracial lesbian couple and their multiethnic brood of biological, adopted and foster children.'),('s8313','After a fateful encounter with the McDonald brothers, struggling salesman Ray Kroc becomes driven to change the way hamburgers are made and sold.'),('s8314','Olympic freestyle skier Jossi Wells learns the dangerous extreme sport of highlining with help from death-defying daredevils the Flying Frenchies.'),('s8315','In this fact-based thriller, an Alaska state trooper pursuing a serial killer teams with a 17-year-old-prostitute who escaped the predator\'s clutches.'),('s8316','Elmo hops across the pond to help his extended monster family solve problems at their \"almost\"\" world-class establishment'),('s8317','A look at the deeply intertwined history of humanity and fresh water reveals looming challenges that could upend power structures around the world.'),('s8318','Between divorce, bad relationships and coming out as gay, a group of affluent friends realize that none of their lives are as easy as they seem.'),('s8319','This documentary follows four tycoons who moonlight as motorsport competitors and examines what fuels them to succeed, both at work and on the track.'),('s8320','Desperate to meet his daughter, a convict cuts a deal by ratting out his old boss. Free and searching for his family, he must dodge a hit on his life.'),('s8321','When a young computer hacker is tasked with investigating a prying journalist, their separate missions become entangled amid a decades-old conspiracy.'),('s8322','Writer, poet and lyricist Javed Akhtar hosts this musical trip down memory lane, revealing untold stories behind India\'s best songs of 1950-75.'),('s8323','As sickness spreads throughout the countryside, an infertile woman conjures a living child out of clay and sets it loose on her enemies.'),('s8324','A young priest’s faith is tested when he finds himself attracted to a woman he meets at confession and his ideals are shaken to the core.'),('s8325','Two tech-savvy teens plot to fool a cranky old neighbor into believing his house is haunted, but their cruel prank soon takes some unexpected turns.'),('s8326','Hired to rescue a flagging car dealership during a major sale, a fast-talking closer spends his days on the lot and his nights at local strip clubs.'),('s8327','In the first of four word-for-word film adaptations, Aramaic-speaking actors re-create the stories of Jesus\' life from the fourth gospel.'),('s8328','Word-for-word Bible texts of the entire book of Luke are narrated and re-enacted in this epic production of the Gospel\'s accounts of Jesus\'s life.'),('s8329','See Jesus from a disciple\'s point of view in this first-ever, word-for-word film adaptation of the Gospel of Mark, lauded for its historical accuracy.'),('s8330','The Apostle Matthew is highlighted in this word-for-word film adaptation of the former tax collector\'s Biblical writings about working with Jesus.'),('s8331','In seventh-century Korea, the commander of Ansi Fortress, Yang Man-chun, combats Tang invaders in a retelling of an epic clash against all odds.'),('s8332','Hosts Mary Berry and Paul Hollywood leave the tent and go into the kitchen to put their professional spin on baking techniques used in the show.'),('s8333','After unwittingly using his skills to obtain military secrets, a gambler is pursued by a police officer who happens to be his doppelgänger.'),('s8334','In World War II, a battalion goes on a daring rescue mission to liberate the Americans and Filipinos who\'ve been captured by the Japanese.'),('s8335','This two-part tale delivers the true story of the Great Train Robbery of 1963, the biggest one in England\'s history.'),('s8336','A hard-partying heir dons a disguise to fight crime after hours. But with no talents or skills, he relies on his friend, a martial-arts genius.'),('s8337','Fantasy and reality collide when a surprisingly diverse group of online video-game addicts struggle to balance the game with personal relationships.'),('s8338','Four young women head to a country house for an idyllic weekend retreat. But what lies in store for them is far from the dreamy getaway they imagined.'),('s8339','A troubled teenage girl hopes to start fresh at a new school, but the horrifying truth about her past is destined to catch up with her.'),('s8340','A handyman who has hit rock bottom agrees to live with his distant uncle, who insists that his ability to fix things extends beyond the repair shop.'),('s8341','Seven female chefs describe what it’s like breaking into the restaurant industry\'s notorious boys\' club.'),('s8342','A young, white writer stirs up the status quo in 1960s Mississippi by interviewing Black housemaids and bringing their stories to the masses.'),('s8343','A withdrawn young woman hunted by a malicious cult is abducted by a brooding stranger and undergoes a bizarre transformation.'),('s8344','Three teenage misfits find camaraderie in sex, violence and petty crime. But what starts as a lark soon threatens to damage them beyond repair.'),('s8345','An all-star cast brings to life the short stories of author Robert Boswell in this anthology series of vignettes set in modern-day America.'),('s8346','New straight-arrow sheriff Wallace finds he must join forces with brutal ex-lawman Leland to protect a troubled border town from a cartel hit man.'),('s8347','Formerly a troubled youth, a monk is given charge of a Buddhist temple neglected by superstitious villagers under the spell of a fake psychic.'),('s8348','Panelists from the Korean show \"Abnormal Summit\"\" lead cast mates on tours of their home countries'),('s8349','This film chronicles the journey of Fannie Haughton, an Oakland activist who fled to Grenada with her family just prior to the U.S. invasion in 1983.'),('s8350','With host Vinay Pathak, Indian celebrities return to their childhood homes to reconnect with the past and share stories of their journey to success.'),('s8351','A family of Parsi musicians collectively works for over 60 years scoring the orchestral soundtracks for some of Bollywood\'s most memorable films.'),('s8352','In a dystopian, near-future United States, a deportation caseworker who has begun to question authority tries to safeguard a woman and her young son.'),('s8353','A chef and his family leave India to open an eatery in the south of France, where they clash with the haughty restaurateur across the street.'),('s8354','Witness some of the most riveting showdowns in the animal kingdom as cameras capture leopards, polar bears and other predators targeting their prey.'),('s8355','A deadly hurricane with mile-high waves provides the perfect cover for stealing $600 million from a U.S. Treasury outpost in Mississippi.'),('s8356','Featuring legendary and up-and-coming MMA fighters, this documentary details the history of the brutal sport and the fighters\' struggles and triumphs.'),('s8357','When a deal with the devil comes due, the immortal Doctor Parnassus must renegotiate the pact to save his daughter and right the wrongs of his past.'),('s8358','This rib-tickling series follows four English lads as they try – and fail spectacularly – to navigate the wretched no-man\'s land of adolescence.'),('s8359','Two criminals race down a stairwell, a cop close behind. A bickering family begins a road trip. Their journeys will take far longer than expected.'),('s8360','Sebastian the elephant and his feline friend Mithco sail on a gigantic peach to rescue Sunnytown\'s beloved mayor, who\'s stranded on a mysterious island.'),('s8361','When Elastigirl gets recruited for a high-profile crime-fighting mission, Mr. Incredible takes on his toughest assignment ever: full-time parenting.'),('s8362','A boy receives a wooden cupboard, antique keys and an Iroquois warrior figurine for his birthday. The figurine comes to life overnight in the cabinet.'),('s8363','While gathering evidence against his employer to help the FBI build a price-fixing case, Mark Whitacre begins to piece together a fantasy world.'),('s8364','After burgeoning criminal Gunz joins the increasingly violent TIC crew, the gang finds itself dealing with threats from all sides.'),('s8365','During a trip to Jamaica, a London gang targets a disloyal member who has been meeting with rivals. Meanwhile, an undercover cop stands among them.'),('s8366','In a world where no one fibs, a screenwriter gains fame and fortune – and maybe the girl of his dreams – by saying things that aren\'t true.'),('s8367','After 40 years of inconclusive evidence, renowned criminologist Mark Williams-Thomas re-examines a string of mysterious murders.'),('s8368','A man accepts an invitation to a dinner party hosted by his ex-wife, an unsettling affair that reopens old wounds and creates new tensions.'),('s8369','This documentary crime series charts the rise of the Irish Mob in America, from urban immigrant poverty to political power and wealth.'),('s8370','Margaret Thatcher, the first female prime minister of Britain, navigates a career destined to change the rules of leadership and politics.'),('s8371','This documentary explores a bold World War II operation in which an MI5 agent infiltrated a fascist network to intercept stolen documents.'),('s8372','Mexican journalist and UFO investigator Jaime Maussan travels the world collecting evidence and firsthand accounts of extraterrestrial phenomena.'),('s8373','Six book club members find their lives resemble a modern-day version of Jane Austen\'s novels in this drama.'),('s8374','This animated series follows young Mowgli and his animal mentors Bagheera and Baloo, who do their best to protect him from fierce tiger Shere Khan.'),('s8375','An idealistic young woman travels to the jungles of Indonesia to teach literacy – and much more – to local children.'),('s8376','Years after the death of their only child and subsequent divorce, a couple discovers that their son\'s ghost continues to inhabit their former home.'),('s8377','Host Leon Logothetis travels the world with only a vintage motorbike and the kindness of strangers, which he pays back in unexpected, inspiring ways.'),('s8378','In this biographical drama, Britain\'s King George VI struggles with an embarrassing stutter until he seeks help from speech therapist Lionel Logue.'),('s8379','This trailblazing series follows the tangled lives and ever-changing relationships among a close-knit group of lesbians who call Los Angeles home.'),('s8380','The wife of a corporate heir finds her luxurious life overturned by a mysterious woman who joins the household as a caregiver for her father-in-law.'),('s8381','A lonely doctor begins writing letters to the frustrated architect who lives in her former home, only to discover that they\'re living two years apart.'),('s8382','A big-dreaming donkey escapes his menial existence and befriends some free-spirited animal pals in thi