'),('s8409','A priest\'s duties are tested when a young guerrilla asks for absolution while confessing his plans to murder a local man he believes is a traitor.'),('s8410','To avoid punishment for his misdeeds, an arrogant god accepts a mission to reform three mortals on earth, where he must also contend with a demon.'),('s8411','Doctors, farmers, chefs and others weigh in on the controversial ketogenic diet and its potential to eradicate common illnesses.'),('s8412','Documentary crew members brave Earth\'s most frigid regions to capture the majesty and mystery found in the chillier side of the animal kingdom.'),('s8413','This irreverent documentary reveals how charming entertainer Jan Lewan bilked investors out of millions in a complicated investment scam.'),('s8414','An aging Zorro passes the torch to a young successor, schooling him in discipline and training him to take up the sword against crooked officials.'),('s8415','A computer hacker learns that what most people perceive as reality is actually a simulation created by machines, and joins a rebellion to break free.'),('s8416','The crew must protect Zion, the last outpost still under human control, after it is pinpointed by the machines responsible for the Matrix.'),('s8417','The final installment in the Matrix trilogy finds an unconscious Neo trapped in a subway station in a zone between the Matrix and the machine world.'),('s8418','A look at how a world-renowned medical institution prioritizes patients\' needs and has adapted to healthcare\'s evolving demands for over 150 years.'),('s8419','With the presidency in mind, the incumbent mayor of Seoul runs for an unprecedented third term – and will stop at nothing to keep his secrets hidden.'),('s8420','This documentary centers on the crew of the B-17 Flying Fortress Memphis Belle as it prepares to execute a strategic bombing mission over Germany.'),('s8421','A journalist latches onto an unbelievable story in Iraq when he meets Lyn, a man of mysterious origins w