on Garden is framed – and the only evidence that proves his innocence is a videotape locked inside a bank vault.'),('s8448','The lives and careers of two professional soccer players are profoundly impacted by a single moment of intimacy that took place between them.'),('s8449','After terrorists trigger a nuclear blast in Russia, a U.S. Special Forces intelligence agent and a nuclear weapons expert come to the rescue.'),('s8450','When law student Darby Shaw theorizes about the assassinations of two Supreme Court justices, she is put in danger and turns to a reporter for help.'),('s8451','French soccer fans, celebrities and athletes retrace the exhilarating events of July 12, 1998, as France earned a historic win in the World Cup final.'),('s8452','A shy freshman struggling with depression deals with his best friend\'s suicide and his first love in this engaging coming-of-age tale.'),('s8453','In 1870, a disfigured recluse roams beneath a Parisian opera house and takes under his wing a young soprano, with whom a love triangle develops.'),('s8454','A medical apprentice in 11th-century Persia disguises himself as a Jew to study at a school that does not admit Christians.'),('s8455','Bumbling Inspector Clouseau must solve the murder of a world-famous soccer coach and catch the thief who stole his priceless diamond ring.'),('s8456','In this spritely tale, Tinker Bell and her friends set out to find free-spirited fairy Zarina after she makes off with some precious Blue Pixie Dust.'),('s8457','An aspiring journalist travels to Somalia in hopes of making a name for himself by covering dangerous pirates and hijackers.'),('s8458','An egotistical pirate captain strives to win the Pirate of the Year Award, but to snag the coveted prize, he\'ll have to outwit his dreaded rivals.'),('s8459','A violent confrontation between a motorcycle-riding bank robber and a rookie cop spirals into a tense generational feud.'),('s8460','After being sent to a remote prison, three young men suffer under the watchful eye of their jailer and make a meticulous plan to escape.'),('s8461','To save his father’s company from bankruptcy, a rich, spoiled playboy is forced to wed a no-nonsense woman, who\'s just as unhappy to be marrying him.'),('s8462','In this warm-hearted tale, a young boy\'s faith in the holiday spirit is revived after he makes his way by train to the North Pole on Christmas Eve.'),('s8463','This colorful documentary explores the origins and impact of He-Man, a character whose power stretched well beyond a toy line and children\'s TV show.'),('s8464','The personal barber to the president, as well as his wife and only son, get tangled in the political chaos that gripped South Korea in the late 1900s.'),('s8465','A former Mafia hit man living quietly as a mechanic veers back into his old world after his daughter is abducted and faces an old foe in New Orleans.'),('s8466','A hardworking Wisconsin college student falls for her arrogant yet charming classmate, unaware that he\'s a Danish prince attending school incognito.'),('s8467','In New Orleans during the Jazz Age, a beautiful girl named Tiana has a fateful encounter with frog prince who desperately wants to be human again.'),('s8468','A cop-turned-convict discovers a crime syndicate inside a prison lorded over by an inmate crime boss – and joins in on their nightly heists.'),('s8469','In a time of turbulence for the free market system, one economist explores how it has lifted billions out of poverty, and might just save us all.'),('s8470','When Chris and his son are evicted, they face trying times as a desperate Chris accepts an unpaid internship at a stock brokerage firm.'),('s8471','After a snowmobile accident paralyzed him, Grant Korgan became the first athlete with a spinal cord injury to push himself to the South Pole.'),('s8472','How was the scientific understanding of the ancients so advanced? A team of experts answers this and other questions in this fascinating series.'),('s8473','Two Indonesian teachers embrace an inspiring crop of gifted young students who\'ve come to study at their crumbling Islamic primary school.'),('s8474','A young attorney and a scrappy paralegal work to help the parents of a terminally ill boy in their suit against an insurance company.'),('s8475','Young lyricists between the ages of 12 and 16 compete for a chance to sign to Jermaine Dupri\'s label while being mentored by hip-hop and R&B\'s finest.'),('s8476','Examine the troublesome coexistence of humans and rodents in Mumbai, where the byproducts of a big economy have led to a thriving rat population.'),('s8477','Examine the troubling history of football hooliganism and hear from real hooligans about their bitter rivalries and rowdiest brawls.'),('s8478','A look at the life of karate master Fumio Demura shows how he spread the discipline in the West, winning countless devotees and influencing Hollywood.'),('s8479','This documentary follows three players on the Miami Heat Wheels, who face long odds on the way to the national wheelchair basketball championship.'),('s8480','Questions about endurance, doping and overall toughness surround a group of elite athletes as they compete fiercely at the Reebok Crossfit Games.'),('s8481','A drama student is torn between creative possibility and ethical boundaries when his girlfriend\'s family gets caught up in a sex scandal.'),('s8482','Living on the edges of Cairo’s Embabah neighborhood, several residents seek to better their circumstances following the January 25 Revolution.'),('s8483','On returning home and finding they\'re believed to be dead, a collection of near-strangers from the same village try to find a reason for their plight.'),('s8484','After a global zombie war, the living dead are confined to a luxury island resort and hunted by tourists on safari – until the security system fails.'),('s8485','When a team of special agents is sent to recover the wreckage of a downed satellite in Serbia, their mission takes a horrifying turn.'),('s8486','Under pressure to marry, a rich playboy is conflicted between four women who each possess a different quality he desires in his ideal wife.'),('s8487','A reporter watches a video that supposedly sets in motion the viewer\'s death in seven days. Can she unravel the mystery before her own time is up?'),('s8488','After being drafted into an elite secret society, a pair of students at Oxford University see the group\'s extreme debauchery spiral out of control.'),('s8489','A heedless teen drifter who falls for a small-town waitress makes the mistake of robbing a drug lord, putting his life and newfound love in jeopardy.'),('s8490','A turbulent vacation turns deadly when a fugitive and his crew kidnap a river rafting guide and her family, forcing them down the dangerous river.'),('s8491','Swept up in political unrest during World War I, two sisters in St. Petersburg cope with turbulent romances as Russian history is made around them.'),('s8492','Follow the Rolling Stones as the iconic group breaks new ground in Latin America, wrapping a 10-city tour as the first-ever rock band to play in Cuba.'),('s8493','While acclimating to campus life, college freshman Sara begins to realize that her new roommate, Rebecca, is becoming obsessed with her.'),('s8494','Set in a chaotic future, this Outback saga follows loner Eric\'s brutal ordeal when a criminal gang takes his car and leaves him nowhere with nothing.'),('s8495','Johnny Depp stars in this adaptation of Hunter S. Thompson\'s novel about a boozy journalist who moves to Puerto Rico and falls for a taken woman.'),('s8496','A New Orleans politician finds his idealistic plans for rebuilding after a toxic oil spill unraveling thanks to a sex scandal.'),('s8497','In the Old West, a Danish homesteader avenges the murder of his wife and son, only to unleash a gang leader\'s brutal fury.'),('s8498','Sisters Gail, Cynthia and Julie have talent, but their career takes off when promoter Dave convinces them to tour for U.S. troops in Vietnam.'),('s8499','Ready-to-retire safecracker Nick, flamboyant fence Max and talented but volatile thief Jackie team up to rob the Montreal Customs House.'),('s8500','A brooding American unable to cope with personal crisis travels to \"suicide forest\"\" near Mount Fuji'),('s8501','To determine whether we\'re alone in the universe, astrobiologists look to Jupiter, Mars and, closer to home, extreme environments on Earth.'),('s8502','On a farm outside New York, Max aims to boost his confidence while in the city, Snowball attempts to rescue a tiger cub and Gidget pretends to be a cat.'),('s8503','This riveting film examines the case of Mike Dowd, a corrupt Brooklyn cop who became dirtier than the drug dealers he was supposed to be policing.'),('s8504','This series examines 1970s America, focusing on the major political and historical landmarks of the decade and the cultural response to those events.'),('s8505','Three sexually frustrated men in their 60s have the adventure of a lifetime after meeting an intriguing young woman during a holiday in Mauritius.'),('s8506','A disillusioned reality TV host and an idealistic producer are lured by their network into producing a show in which participants kill themselves.'),('s8507','While suitors swoon over her cousin, a single woman takes initiative in finding herself a partner after receiving a favorable romantic fortune.'),('s8508','During their drive across the country, college pals Nick and Jonah – accompanied by Nick\'s girlfriend – run into major trouble in the Nevada desert.'),('s8509','Stranded in a transit station one stormy night in 1968, eight strangers begin to fall victim to seizures, only to wake up disturbingly altered.'),('s8510','When a young man leaves home to fulfill the wishes of his late father, he meets and falls in love with a woman from a very different background.'),('s8511','An extraordinary sense of smell gives a crime investigator unique insight into solving mysteries, but his gift takes a toll on his personal life.'),('s8512','Director David Fincher\'s biographical drama chronicles the meteoric rise of Facebook CEO Mark Zuckerberg from Harvard sophomore to Internet superstar.'),('s8513','After years of limited contact with Earth, an inquisitive teen who lives on Mars makes an interplanetary trek to discover his own origins.'),('s8514','Classmates Aimee and Sutter form an unlikely friendship, and after helping Aimee raise her social confidence, Sutter begins falling for his creation.'),('s8515','When an unbearable stranger arrives at a winter mountain resort and vanishes overnight, his dark past comes to light.'),('s8516','While babysitting, an undercover agent is thrust back into the world of top-secret adventure when one his young charges downloads a classified file.'),('s8517','Based on Dr. Ahron Bregman\'s book, this documentary examines the life and mysterious death of Ashraf Marwan, an Egyptian billionaire and Israeli spy.'),('s8518','Conducting a study on the psychology of incarceration, a Stanford professor assigns guard and prisoner roles to 24 male test subjects in a mock jail.'),('s8519','Host Morgan Freeman explores religion\'s role in human history, how our beliefs connect us and possible answers to life\'s million-dollar questions.'),('s8520','Explore the forces of love, belief, power, war, peace, rebellion and freedom in this series about the ties that bind – and destroy – humanity.'),('s8521','When a law professor fails an ambitious student for academic dishonesty, he goes to terrifying lengths to seek revenge for more than just his grade.'),('s8522','Take a trip and witness the rise and fall of Tim Scully and Nicholas Sand, improbable pioneers of the drug counterculture during the 1960s.'),('s8523','When an ex-cop becomes a superintendent of an apartment building, he suspects the sinister janitor is behind the eerie disappearances of its tenants.'),('s8524','Mixing live action and animation, this classic series brought the beloved Super Mario Bros. video game characters to television screens everywhere.'),('s8525','Teens in America dedicate themselves to the Asian game of Go, which originated in ancient China, drawing meaningful life lessons along the way.'),('s8526','When a group of hijackers takes passengers aboard a subway train hostage and demand a ransom, it\'s up to dispatcher Walter Garber to bring them down.'),('s8527','A charming sociopath maneuvers into the lush life of a young heir. But as he embraces the posh lifestyle, he\'ll stop at nothing to hold onto it.'),('s8528','When some friends visit a vandalized graveyard, they come upon a chainsaw-wielding maniac, and it\'s a fight to the bloody death between good and evil.'),('s8529','A street beggar befriends a man who lost his eye in a brawl, unaware that his new acquaintance is plotting to make him his unwitting organ donor.'),('s8530','It\'s 1979, and engineer Sami is excited to leave his Indian village for a job in Chicago. But he soon runs into problems achieving his American dream.'),('s8531','This documentary highlights the endangered existence of the Scottish wildcats, and the conservation efforts required to prevent their extinction.'),('s8532','Based on the H.G. Wells classic, this adventure follows a scientist and inventor who\'s determined to prove to doubters that time travel is possible.'),('s8533','Due to a genetic disorder, handsome librarian Henry involuntarily zips through time, appearing at various moments in the life of his true love.'),('s8534','In this hard-hitting series, journalist Nelufar Hedayat travels the globe to expose an array of black markets, from guns and gold to human body parts.'),('s8535','When a move to an exclusive seaside community sends her mother and twin brother into a downward spiral, teenager Medina finds solace in surfing.'),('s8536','When a power failure throws their suburban town into chaos, Matthew and his wife stoop to desperate measures to secure medication for their child.'),('s8537','Comedians Steve Coogan and Rob Brydon gorge on local delicacies and celebrity impressions as they reunite for a hilarious road trip through Spain.'),('s8538','Discovering the location of a vault where a drug ring keeps its riches, two run-of-the-mill Las Vegas cops hatch a dicey plan to burgle it.'),('s8539','Emergency room doctor Javid Abdelmoneim endeavors to learn the truth about alcohol, both its benefits and risks, by exploring the science of drinking.'),('s8540','All the splendor and scandal of England\'s 16th-century royal court comes to life in this series that follows notorious Tudor monarch Henry VIII.'),('s8541','After a government spy is hospitalized, New York City cab driver Jimmy unwillingly takes over the spy\'s role – with the aid of a computerized tuxedo.'),('s8542','Hosted by creator Rod Serling, this groundbreaking anthology series presents tales of the supernatural that are often tinged with social commentary.'),('s8543','A chauvinistic morning-show commentator tries to prove the relationship theories he espouses on a segment called \"The Ugly Truth.\"\"\"'),('s8544','A couple and their young daughter are haunted by a paranormal, malicious presence – which is soon linked to a temple and a series of abortions.'),('s8545','Virtual and real worlds collide as a group of teenagers who are grappling with matters of the heart cross paths in a cafe and on an anonymous website.'),('s8546','Discover the secrets of the universe in this series that pairs animation with insights on distant planets, black holes and other celestial marvels.'),('s8547','A guilt-ridden doctor in a Belgian town tries to uncover the identity of a woman who died after being turned away from her office.'),('s8548','Donald Rumsfeld reviews his long political career, from his time in Congress to serving as secretary of defense under Gerald Ford and George W. Bush.'),('s8549','A young woman hospitalized for an infected wound becomes possessed by a satanic force that will take a priest and two Vatican exorcists to defeat.'),('s8550','Ken Burns presents an epic 10-part, 18-hour chronicle of the Vietnam War, featuring the soldiers, protesters, politicians and families that lived it.'),('s8551','After losing her eyesight in an accident, a woman lands in a love triangle as she looks for meaning in her life.'),('s8552','A seven-part series brings World War II to life through the harrowing personal accounts of soldiers and others from \"typical\"\" American towns.\"'),('s8553','Years after the presumed death of his three sons in battle, a grieving farmer journeys to Turkey to find them and return them to their homeland.'),('s8554','A boy watches an egg he found hatch into something incredible. But how long can he keep such a big secret from his mom – and the Scottish government?'),('s8555','A water boy for a college football team has a rage that makes him a tackling machine whose bone-crushing power might vault his team into the playoffs.'),('s8556','Two weddings marred by tragedy lead the respective brides to believe that that they\'ve been cursed by an old cultural superstition.'),('s8557','In this sequel to the 2016 hit \"The Wedding Party'),('s8558','This powerful political epic chronicles the triumphs and travails of White House senior staff under the administration of President Josiah Bartlet.'),('s8559','Believing that a witch has cursed their family, pilgrims homesteading on the edge of a primeval New England forest become increasingly paranoid.'),('s8560','A disparate group of teenage girls discovers how to obtain supernatural abilities, but abusing their newfound power has disturbing consequences.'),('s8561','Libertine He-jie finds himself torn between the lovely Amanda and fiery Xiao-qian. But now he faces a new problem: arrogant rival suitor Cheng-en.'),('s8562','Experience an up-close look at the controversial passion and resulting infamy of big-game hunters Rebecca Francis and Jacine Jadresko.'),('s8563','A conservative rabbi steps in to lead a congregation reeling from an accident, but his controversial plans incite a gender war among the congregation.'),('s8564','In an old shipyard town in France, sociopolitical tensions beset a writing workshop where the instructor notices a student with a dark side.'),('s8565','Greed, revenge, world domination: It\'s all in a day\'s work for James Bond, who\'s on a mission to protect an oil heiress from a notorious terrorist.'),('s8566','A conservationist shares her emotional journey in helping save rare, scaly mammals that have been illegally trafficked and now face extinction.'),('s8567','A widow searches for her missing teenage daughter, not knowing that her seemingly helpful neighbor is hiding a terrible secret.'),('s8568','Jiang Chen-bo is a loser without prospects for success, until a surprise promotion becomes the catalyst for his entire family\'s upturn in fortune.'),('s8569','Never ones to think things through, two Irish teens steal bicycles and set off to the coast to find a bale of cocaine from a smuggler’s capsized ship.'),('s8570','To avenge his master, a wine-loving young man steps up his fighting skills to defeat a powerful thief in a life-or-death match.'),('s8571','This documentary follows chef Massimo Bottura as he opens a soup kitchen to cook gourmet meals for the needy from food waste at the 2015 Milan Expo.'),('s8572','An auto rickshaw driver harbors a deep affection for a young woman, but his troubled past threatens to stand between them.'),('s8573','The spotlight shines on iconic jazz pianist and composer Thelonious Monk in this 1988 documentary featuring vintage performance clips and interviews.'),('s8574','American journalist Theo Padnos retraces the Middle Eastern journey that led to his 2012 kidnapping and brutal torture by an al-Qaida faction.'),('s8575','A group of teens searches for the dark truth behind their school\'s mysterious and brutal history.'),('s8576','A renowned actor who is still pining over the loss of his first real love writes an autobiography about his memories of her, hoping to reconnect.'),('s8577','Romance and cuisine mix when a perpetually dissatisfied hotel executive finally encounters the perfect meal, and the sous chef that made it.'),('s8578','The Tomorrowland music festival marks its 10th anniversary in Belgium, the U.S. and Brazil, with all the diverse excitement of the annual event.'),('s8579','In a South Indian village, a centenarian\'s funeral brings together his free-spirited son, inheritance-hungry grandson and girl-crazy great-grandson.'),('s8580','After losing a boxing match, a talented Muay Thai fighter leaves home to train with the best. On his quest, he finds friends, foes and lots of action.'),('s8581','To save Asgard from a bloodthirsty goddess of death, the mighty Thor will have to battle his way to freedom and find a way back home.'),('s8582','Thor, the Marvel comic book character, comes to life in this animated feature that explores his earliest adventures with his brother Loki.'),('s8583','Heading a new team whose aim is to crack the cases that leave others stumped, detective Tom Thorne finds himself on the hunt for two serial killers.'),('s8584','Investigating a series of attacks on young women, detective Tom Thorne is dragged back into the nightmares of his past as he races to find a killer.'),('s8585','A master criminal engineers his own shooting during a police raid, then refuses treatment while awaiting rescue in a tense standoff at a hospital.'),('s8586','Determined to fight corruption in his country, a newspaper cartoonist debuts a new take-no-prisoners attitude.'),('s8587','After moving to a hardscrabble suburban California town, a young woman becomes dangerously entangled with a local drug enterprise.'),('s8588','A P-47 Thunderbolt squadron is shown in preparation, at play and in bombing raids aiming to halt Nazi supply lines and aid Allied ground troops.'),('s8589','In an otherworldly river town, a policeman follows the trail of a sinister force to save his community from deadly spells.'),('s8590','A police officer and a psychologist learn of a sinister threat at a highly anticipated soccer match and team up in hopes of preventing disaster.'),('s8591','Two frustrated sex workers cut out the middlemen from their business affairs and start a cooperative that\'s run entirely by women.'),('s8592','Personality differences, an old friend and a past flame poke holes in the way a husband and wife perceive their marriage.'),('s8593','A decade after college, a wake reunites five female friends struggling with illness, infidelity, toxic in-laws, spousal abuse and other life issues.'),('s8594','Firsthand accounts, re-enactments and computer-generated graphics retell in detail Thailand\'s biggest news stories from the past.'),('s8595','When suspicious scout fairies scheme to capture the fearsome-looking NeverBeast, Tinker Bell and Fawn set out to save the wondrous creature.'),('s8596','While building a revolutionary machine outlined in his late father\'s journal, a recluse farmer becomes the guardian for his gifted six-year-old nephew.'),('s8597','In his tiny meadow village, curious little mouse Tip enjoys fun and adventure while learning about the world with his furry friends and family.'),('s8598','Explore how the media and nationalism have fueled Venezuela\'s passion for physical appearance and the multibillion-dollar beauty pageant industry.'),('s8599','Three New York drag queens on their way to Hollywood for a beauty pageant get stranded in a small Midwestern town when their car breaks down.'),('s8600','After a divorce and fatal career move, a classically trained British stage actor navigates single life with his odd roommate and takes on horrid jobs.'),('s8601','They’re robots that can transform into cars – and the Tobots are committed to fighting villains to protect the city and root out crime.'),('s8602','This documentary follows J-Pop idol Rio and her predominantly middle-aged fans, and their seemingly transactional interactions.'),('s8603','When a young wizard leaves Tom to guard his priceless magic ring, Jerry gets the ring stuck on his head, igniting a series of slapstick antics.'),('s8604','Pierce Brosnan stars in this 007 installment, which teams the secret agent and a sexy Chinese superspy against a megalomaniacal media mogul.'),('s8605','This series investigates mysteries that persistently elude scientific explanation, such as mythical creatures, UFOs, sacred sites and more.'),('s8606','Social media star Hayes Grier returns to North Carolina for a reality series packed with action sports, pranks and romantic escapades.'),('s8607','The tales of an eccentric aristocrat, a tightrope walking nomad and a postman-turned-soothsayer unspool in this visual poem of rural life in India.'),('s8608','Widower Martin is a restaurateur with a booming business and three headstrong daughters who leave the house to pursue their individual destinies.'),('s8609','A disbanded fraternity tries to get their act together by finding new members, but beer bongs, bad grades and a demented dean stand in their way.'),('s8610','Australia\'s toughest tow truck operators work to keep Queensland\'s streets clear of overturned semis and other automotive disasters.'),('s8611','When a bike messenger falls into debt with organized criminals, a sexy woman draws him into her high-stakes world of parkour, teaching him new skills.'),('s8612','Four characters coexist at an urban traffic signal, where all manage to make a meager living until events threaten the source of their livelihood.'),('s8613','Five teenagers on the lam hide out in an empty train. Little do they realize that the train is inhabited by ghosts on their way to final judgment.'),('s8614','As a zombie outbreak sweeps the country, a dad and his daughter take a harrowing train journey in an attempt to reach the only city that\'s still safe.'),('s8615','Renton and his mates cope with the gritty realities of heroin addiction. But when Renton gets clean, he can\'t get away from his friends\' nasty habits.'),('s8616','An FBI agent assigned to pursue an ex-Special Ops soldier who joined a terrorist organization begins to question his target\'s true intentions.'),('s8617','Two computer scientists work to achieve technological singularity to create a world where computers can transcend the abilities of the human brain.'),('s8618','Three poor Brazilian teens find something suspicious in a garbage heap, then end up on the run from the law as they try to set things right.'),('s8619','Surprise news that his girlfriend is pregnant sends loutish Owen on an ill-advised trip to reconnect with his twisted sister and sadistic grandmother.'),('s8620','This cinematic journey into the waters off East Africa chronicles the story behind artist Damien Hirst\'s massive exhibition of oceanic treasures.'),('s8621','Entrepreneurs from Vermont and Quebec sell Christmas trees on the streets of New York, becoming a cherished part of neighborhood holiday traditions.'),('s8622','After a seismologist gets unusual readings on her equipment, handymen discover 30-foot-long carnivorous worms that suck their prey underground.'),('s8623','A rag-tag team of survivalists and scientists battle supersucking desert creatures that are worming their way through the oil fields of Mexico.'),('s8624','When a theme park\'s simulated giant worm attacks turn real, Burt Gummer and two young entrepreneurs team up to battle the flesh-eating graboids.'),('s8625','Residents of a abandoned mining town attempt to get to the bottom of a series of recent, mysterious deaths before their own fates are sealed.'),('s8626','When he is hired to capture a deadly creature terrorizing South Africa, survivalist Burt Gummer brings along a new tech-savvy partner.'),('s8627','The subterranean, worm-like creatures are back, and Graboid-hunter Burt Gummer suspects they\'ve been weaponized.'),('s8628','A man from a criminal family yearns to break away and find a better life, but his father\'s staunch opposition puts his dreams of freedom in jeopardy.'),('s8629','A Goan native returns to his now-derelict, palatial childhood home, recalling his family’s interpersonal drama during the end of Portuguese rule.'),('s8630','After being framed, a policewoman languishing in prison hopes that her three sons will deliver justice and restore her honor.'),('s8631','To amuse themselves, six college friends decide to pay a visit to a fortress believed by some to be the most haunted place in Asia.'),('s8632','Drag queen Trixie Mattel deals with the bittersweet reality of success in this documentary that explores her rise to fame and subsequent music career.'),('s8633','This documentary explores the tensions between the lucrative big-game hunting business and wildlife conservation from a variety of perspectives.'),('s8634','The complex historical figure of Leon Trotsky comes to life in this epic biography that depicts the tumultuous life of the Russian revolutionary.'),('s8635','Starting with the Trojan Horse attack, this modest re-telling of Homer\'s epic covers well-known highlights of Odysseus\'s long journey home.'),('s8636','Teenage tomboy Mattie Ross enlists the help of crusty lawman Rooster Cogburn to track down the hired hand who murdered her father.'),('s8637','When a drug kingpin looking to go legit falls for a Philadelphia college student, it doesn\'t take long for his dangerous world to bleed into her life.'),('s8638','When he is blacklisted by Hollywood for his leftist political views, screenwriter Dalton Trumbo struggles to find work in secret as a ghost writer.'),('s8639','Expecting to relax at their \"vacation\"\" cabin'),('s8640','A child whose innocence and devotion set him apart from the other children of his village grows up to be one of the foremost saints of India.'),('s8641','British and American troops join forces to liberate a Nazi stranglehold in North Africa, sharing battles, hard work and a peaceful Christmas dinner.'),('s8642','A speed-obsessed snail who dreams of being the world\'s greatest race car driver gets his chance when an accident imbues him with high-octane speed.'),('s8643','When a wise-guy podcaster interviews a disabled seafarer, he decides to embark on a transformational quest to track down a dangerous walrus-monster.'),('s8644','This documentary reenacts the experiences of late activist Tsutomu Yamaguchi, a survivor of both atomic bombings on Japan in 1945.'),('s8645','\"Who killed Laura Palmer?\"\" is the question on everyone\'s lips in a secretive small town'),('s8646','When a yoga enthusiast begins to pull away from her identical twin sister and business partner, their lifelong bond turns deadly.'),('s8647','The colorful and curious family of Twirlywoos bounces around their boat and visits new places, turning learning into adventures wherever they land.'),('s8648','After terrorists place a bomb inside a toy Lord Ganesha, a child takes off with the dangerous doll, setting it on a course throughout all of Mumbai.'),('s8649','A doctor and a drug addict kidnap the son of a local gangster, seeking revenge for the death of a loved one.'),('s8650','A troubled couple living near the North Pole begins a perilous journey south in an attempt to find peace and vanquish ghosts from the past.'),('s8651','This documentary recounts a 1994 incident in Honolulu in which a circus elephant attacked and killed its trainer, then ran loose on the city streets.'),('s8652','In this surprisingly emotional documentary, heavyweight champ Mike Tyson analyzes the controversies surrounding his career and turbulent private life.'),('s8653','When a 10-year-old goes missing while her father, an actor, is out on an audition, the girl\'s stepfather – Mumbai\'s police chief – leads the search.'),('s8654','Young women face up to their insecurities and circumstances, finding love and laughs along the way. Featuring a different storyline every season.'),('s8655','A young woman tracks down the older man who preyed on her as a child, forcing them both to confront the damage done by what happened 15 years earlier.'),('s8656','Five disparate kids, snowed in at the airport on Christmas Eve, try to get back to their families and outsmart a disgruntled airport official.'),('s8657','Noted UFO expert Dr. Steven Greer interviews witnesses and presents classified documents concerning the existence of extraterrestrials.'),('s8658','Six fearless surfers travel to the north coast of Iceland to ride waves unlike anything they\'ve ever experienced, captured with high-tech cameras.'),('s8659','A seductive alien prowls the streets in search of prey: unsuspecting men who fall under her spell, only to be consumed by a strange liquid pool.'),('s8660','Jake\'s date with his dream girl takes a turn when she disappears, and Jake\'s grandpa – a former intelligence officer – sets out to find her.'),('s8661','This World War II-era training film dramatizes how secret agents should act while undercover and how to avoid capture by enemies.'),('s8662','With his wife terminally ill, Arthur\'s future seems grim. But he learns to find joy in life again when he joins an unconventional church choir.'),('s8663','Toxic conditions and a corrupt union leader prompt a chemical plant worker and earnest family man to fight for justice for his fellow laborers.'),('s8664','A young woman discovers that familial and psychological traumas can be difficult to leave behind.'),('s8665','Ryan Bingham flies around the country firing employees on behalf of companies, but he faces losing the job he savors to recent college grad Natalie.'),('s8666','After getting tricked into working at a brothel, a medical student joins forces with two of her co-workers to fight their unscrupulous exploiters.'),('s8667','To evade greedy pharmaceutical crooks, a medical scientist disguises himself as a struggling salesman to protect his groundbreaking cancer research.'),('s8668','After becoming stranded in the Philippine Sea during World War II, a tenacious Navy crew faces a dire lack of supplies and a string of shark attacks.'),('s8669','A masked freedom fighter known as \"V\"\" takes up arms against a totalitarian government and finds an unlikely ally in a young woman.\"'),('s8670','Three friends who study martial arts find themselves defending humanity from a criminal mastermind and his invading army from another dimension.'),('s8671','Moments after he arrives in Spain for an antiterrorism summit, U.S. President Ashton is shot.'),('s8672','A police official assembles an elaborate network of spies and undercover operatives to bring down a ruthless bandit with a private army.'),('s8673','Quick to throw punches in the name of justice, a young man must find a calmer way to win over the pacifist father of the girl he wishes to marry.'),('s8674','A Las Vegas doctor\'s controversial online contest sees anxious entrants vie for free in vitro fertilization, a procedure rarely covered by insurance.'),('s8675','As viceroy Lord Mountbatten arrives in Delhi to oversee a transfer of power from Britain to India in 1947, war looms between religious factions.'),('s8676','In 1962 Brooklyn, a Puerto Rican teen who joins a gang is seduced by violence and heroin. But can his mother\'s love and faith in God save him?'),('s8677','Framed for her father’s murder, an exiled Viking princess is guided by the god Odin as she prepares to return to her kingdom and reclaim the throne.'),('s8678','Archaeologist Sarah Parcak follows clues to early Viking explorations and discusses just what these notoriously fierce warriors were really like.'),('s8679','In rural Louisiana, a terse loner forges a redemptive bond with a woman he saved from a killer, but a violent past soon catches up with both of them.'),('s8680','Humanoid robot boy ViR lives with his inventor, Dr. Prem Sahay, and, with his best friends, is always ready to use his superpowers to save the day.'),('s8681','When a mother and her daughter arrive to stay in his home in Kerala, a young Muslim man becomes torn between love, faith and clashing political views.'),('s8682','In a remote village in colonial India, an old man and his grandson display strong differences in their attitudes toward the country\'s British rulers.'),('s8683','With civil war looming, a TV-obsessed Turkish town is bemused when a bureaucrat and his daughter arrive to modernize their library.'),('s8684','While investigating a series of murders and the nightclub that links them, a detective’s case takes an alarming turn when his wife goes missing.'),('s8685','For these half-car, half-animal friends, each day in Zippy City is a chance to have fun, be creative and use teamwork to solve difficult problems.'),('s8686','A young man in foster care finds his voice in the underground rap battle scene. But when his mother returns, a lifetime of pain comes with her.'),('s8687','When Pakistani authorities learn of a looming terrorist strike, they ask a retired intelligence officer to counter the attack before it\'s too late.'),('s8688','In a modern adaptation of a mythological tale, a devoted wife is willing to do whatever it takes to rescue her husband from the clutches of death.'),('s8689','While visiting his comatose wife in the hospital, a serene old professor befriends a vibrant young woman whose husband has also fallen into a coma.'),('s8690','Employees turn up the antics during an eight-hour shift at the restaurant Shenaniganz when new opportunities call and boredom gets the best of them.'),('s8691','After taking the blame for a patient death, an anesthesiologist battling psychiatric trauma fights to stay afloat in the corrupt hospital system.'),('s8692','An unhappy father and lawyer quits his suburban life and vanishes into the attic above his garage, where he watches his family move on without him.'),('s8693','A community of monks in France led by Zen Buddhist master Thich Nhat Hanh offers an intimate glimpse into mindfulness practice and the monastic life.'),('s8694','A suburban teen goes hunting with his estranged father. When a mishap with a bear occurs, he must his use his survival skills to save them both.'),('s8695','When his partner is killed and all clues point to a notorious assassin, FBI agent Jack Crawford sets out for revenge in this taut action-thriller.'),('s8696','Set in an India-Pakistan border post, this satirical but thought-provoking comedy about war deals with serious events in a humorous manner.'),('s8697','During World War I, the bond between a young Englishman and his loyal horse, Joey, is tested when Joey is sold to the cavalry and sent to France.'),('s8698','Terry and Bob excel at blackmailing small-time crooks. But when the two cops target a big score, they learn not all criminals are easily intimidated.'),('s8699','When an aspiring documentarian returns to his hometown to investigate paranormal happenings, his girlfriend\'s mental health takes a troubling turn.'),('s8700','A soon-to-be-retiring Mr. Lino teaches 20-something Nin the strict rules of his new warehouse job in this dramedy about the absurdities of work life.'),('s8701','Part live-action and part animation, this visually inventive series offers striking portrayals of some of the unsung heroes of World War II.'),('s8702','California residents and farmers face powerful barons in the struggle to secure water rights in this fresh historical account of profit and interests.'),('s8703','Six young women, who each live near one of Earth\'s major rivers, share how the Waterschool environmental education program has impacted their lives.'),('s8704','An ambitious young DJ who knows how to work a crowd puts everything at risk for a budding relationship with his mentor\'s girlfriend.'),('s8705','A divorced professor shares a night of passion with a troubled student who quickly develops an unhealthy – perhaps deadly – infatuation.'),('s8706','A happy woman\'s new love is going great, but she needs one thing: divorce papers from her depressed ex. To get them, trickery may be in order.'),('s8707','A trio of brothers cope with their parents\' volatile relationship by running wild and unchecked, and one of them experiences a visceral awakening.'),('s8708','Narrated by actor and former Marine Gene Hackman, this documentary showcases the experience of becoming a member of the US Marine Corps.'),('s8709','Unhappy with his commercial film work, a jaded Hollywood actor moves to Argentina to participate in an experimental thesis on social philosophy.'),('s8710','When a delivery of coffins foreshadows a harsh winter, residents of a retirement home escape their confines and rediscover the world outside.'),('s8711','A suburban mother starts selling marijuana to her affluent neighbors so she can maintain her comfortable lifestyle after her husband\'s sudden death.'),('s8712','In 1980s Hong Kong, a school principal forms a baseball team with an eclectic crew of local students who soon fight their way to the top of the league.'),('s8713','From animal oddities and bizarre science to medical marvels, scientists and experts examine some of the world\'s strangest mysteries and phenomena.'),('s8714','Denied a U.S. visa, two dim Indian men decide to sneak into America on a boat. Fate, however, leaves them stranded on a beach – in Karachi, Pakistan.'),('s8715','Dracula\'s daughter Draculaura sets out to create a new kind of school where monsters of all kinds can be themselves and have a scary good time.'),('s8716','A lecherous World Bank official sees his reputation crumbling when he\'s accused of raping a hotel maid during a trip to New York.'),('s8717','A marijuana farmer\'s extraterrestrial paranoia creates trouble for a group of young campers who pitch their tent on his land in Northern California.'),('s8718','At the onset of World War II, a Polish infantry lacking firepower fight to build a strong defense and protect their peninsula against enemy forces.'),('s8719','A look into the journey of influential strength coach Louie Simmons and the Westside Barbell gym he founded, evolving the sport of powerlifting.'),('s8720','In a large family living under one roof, a storm brews when the matriarch requests a divorce from her husband on their 50th anniversary.'),('s8721','A naïve young woman goes to Istanbul to meet the now-grown boy who jokingly promised to marry her in 11 years after she saved his life as a child.'),('s8722','A 32-year-old romantic looking for a long-term, monogamous relationship meets a handsome bad boy who only believes in one-night stands.'),('s8723','When Claire Spencer starts hearing ghostly voices and seeing spooky images, her husband tries to reassure her by telling her it\'s all in her head.'),('s8724','This wide-ranging documentary examines the behaviors considered in a diagnosis of psychopathy and includes nonviolent, successful figures in history.'),('s8725','Struggling to survive alone post-apocalypse, a young woman is offered protection by an unknown man, but his village may not be the haven she imagines.'),('s8726','A popular high school girl strains her relationship with her close-knit clique when she begins falling for a reclusive, lower-class schoolmate.'),('s8727','Leaving behind her upper-crust city roots, a woman journeys west in the early 1900s to become a teacher in a small Canadian mining community.'),('s8728','A small-town taxi driver is arranged to be married, resulting in an intimate look at the clash between modernity and tradition in India.'),('s8729','This documentary takes a hard look at how indigenous peoples clashed violently with the Peruvian government over land and economics in the Amazon.'),('s8730','Paul Newman proves he\'s still got prodigious acting chops, playing an aging bank robber who may have one last job in him. Faking a stroke, the incarcerated Newman is transferred to a nursing home and the care of a skeptical nurse.'),('s8731','Hunting for a stash of stolen money, a sharp-witted slacker from South Central Los Angeles infiltrates an all-white college fraternity.'),('s8732','A documentary filmmaker struggling with a creative block meets a vibrant young hipster couple who, initially, bring new energy into his life and work.'),('s8733','When a civil war ravages the UK, a scientist awakens in a futuristic cell and is tortured by her captor for information she claims she doesn\'t possess.'),('s8734','Returning to Ibiza after several years walking the straight and narrow in London, Connor falls back in with a criminal crowd. It\'s like he never left.'),('s8735','Take a ride through the life of record exec Michael Alago, a gay Puerto Rican New Yorker who signed a slew of musical acts, including Metallica.'),('s8736','A woman\'s revelation that she was once raped sends her boyfriend, a reformed street thug, into an emotional and spiritual tailspin.'),('s8737','A doctor performs plastic surgery on a fat man who\'s been jilted, and continues his transformation by turning him into a handsome, desirable man.'),('s8738','A Cambridge geneticist dispels misconceptions about living with obesity and explores why the epidemic continues to expand across the UK and America.'),('s8739','Pressured by his traditional family to marry, a filmmaker explores the idea of monogamy and the possibility of lifelong union without sexual fidelity.'),('s8740','This installment of Frank Capra\'s acclaimed documentary series highlights the need for a Russo-American alliance to defeat the Nazis.'),('s8741','The natural bounty of Alaska sustains its diverse species through extreme weather conditions in three seasons, each with its rewards and challenges.'),('s8742','The widely varied geology and dramatic landscapes in the continental crossroads of Arabia harbors a rich history and an abundance of wildlife.'),('s8743','Armed with an ingenious arsenal, two top-notch government agents are tasked with tracking down a diabolical scientist in this futuristic Western.'),('s8744','A teen’s life in 1960 Montana grows complicated when his father is fired, his mother returns to work, and the strain on the family begins to show.'),('s8745','This inspiring documentary charts the birth of Sir Frank Williams\'s renowned racing empire – and the near-fatal crash that nearly stalled its future.'),('s8746','Zany Willy Wonka causes a stir when he announces that golden tickets hidden inside his candy bars will admit holders into his secret confectionary.'),('s8747','Winnie Mandela speaks about her extraordinary and controversial career, from her early life to her marriage to her ongoing efforts to end apartheid.'),('s8748','Actor Donald Faison hosts this game show in which contestants must arrange numerical-based trivia tidbits from largest to smallest for various prizes.'),('s8749','After the death of a long-ago lover, married philanderer Rob tracks down her friend, a drug-addicted prostitute desperate to escape her dead-end life.'),('s8750','Years after ruthless businessmen kill his father and order the death of his twin brother, a modest fisherman adopts a new persona to exact revenge.'),('s8751','In this unflinching noir drama, a resilient teen goes on the trail of her missing, drug-dealing father when his absence threatens the family\'s safety.'),('s8752','With his acting career moribund, Aidan Bloom steers a new tack in life, taking over his children\'s education when private school becomes too costly.'),('s8753','After surviving a life-threatening accident, a troubled cop finds new purpose when he bonds with a terminally ill little boy. Based on a true story.'),('s8754','Unable to pay bills and unwilling to change his slacker lifestyle, twentysomething Aaron hatches a defrauding scheme when he finds a lost credit card.'),('s8755','A promising high school basketball player has his eye on an Ivy League scholarship. But his father\'s secret addictions could ruin everything.'),('s8756','This reality series recounts true stories of women who have been convicted for murder, including an in-depth examination of each crime.'),('s8757','For the 50th anniversary of the legendary Woodstock festival, organizers and attendees reminisce about one of the defining moments of the 1960s.'),('s8758','Working under treacherous conditions, an army of dedicated rescuers struggles to find anyone who survived the World Trade Center\'s tragic collapse.'),('s8759','From Moscow to Mexico City, three BBC journalists delve into the inner workings of some of the most burgeoning metropolises on Earth.'),('s8760','From a bubble-shaped palace to an island built on plastic bottles, tour the world’s most fantastically bizarre residences.'),('s8761','In need of cash to help her sick brother, a young woman agrees to take part in a lethal winner-takes-all parlor game hosted by a sadistic millionaire.'),('s8762','Two identical strangers pursue their respective dreams after exchanging lives and getting out from under the thumb of their controlling loved ones.'),('s8763','The life of a chauffeur and part-time bootlegger takes a turn toward the dramatic when a girl approaches him to buy illicit alcohol.'),('s8764','Filmmaker John Huston narrates this Oscar-nominated World War II-era film about life among the U.S. soldiers protecting Alaska’s Aleutian Islands.'),('s8765','Legendary lawman Wyatt Earp is continually at odds with a gang of renegade cowboys, culminating in a fiery showdown with the outlaws at the OK Corral.'),('s8766','This four-part anthology of short horror films features stories that include some traditional themes but all are shown from a female point of view.'),('s8767','A notorious underground rush-seeker deemed untouchable by the law is coerced into cooperating with the government to infiltrate a Russian crime ring.'),('s8768','In this action-packed follow-up to XXX, U.S. intelligence officer Augustus Gibbons must thwart a massive conspiracy to overthrow the government.'),('s8769','When rich teens Tenoch and Julio meet the alluring, older Luisa, they try to impress her with stories of a road trip, then convince her to join them.'),('s8770','The lives of a middle-aged soap opera addict, an ambitious career woman, a fervent activist and nine others from different walks of Indian life intersect in Mumbai. But this vibrant melting pot threatens to bubble over with bias and bigotry.'),('s8771','Two young lovers set out to overcome the obstacles that stand in the way of their marriage, beginning with the objections of the girl\'s father.'),('s8772','The patriarch of a wealthy family with one industrious son and one who\'s a playboy arranges for the marriage of one to the woman the other loves.'),('s8773','Up to his old tricks, con man Dharam poses as a millionaire to get his younger son married to the daughter of a wealthy businessman.'),('s8774','Thanks to an arranged marriage that was designed to make an ailing grandmother happy, newlyweds Rahul and Swati are virtually strangers. Can a four-day honeymoon make a difference when it comes to the couple\'s feelings about each other?'),('s8775','A man cured of leprosy and a young orphan leave their colony for the first time to travel across Egypt, hoping to find the families they lost.'),('s8776','In the summer of 1998, middle child Harshu balances school, family, friendship and other challenges of growing up.'),('s8777','An orphaned bird tags along with a flock on their long migration to Africa and becomes a hero when his newfound \"family\"\" runs into trouble.\"'),('s8778','Traditional girl Pie is initially uncomfortable with her tomboyish new roommate. But as time goes on, she finds herself increasingly attracted to her.'),('s8779','No longer university girls, Kim and Pie face new hurdles in their relationship, including work, new friends and other distractions.'),('s8780','Roommates Wine and Pie find their lives turned upside down when two more ladies move in next door, bringing up past heartaches and new attractions.'),('s8781','Nate frees a mythical being trapped in a magic capsule, and the two new friends have adventures with all sorts of troublesome supernatural creatures.'),('s8782','Nate\'s special Yo-Kai Watch is missing. He travels back in time to meet the watch\'s inventor, his grandfather. Together, they must restore history!'),('s8783','With an all-important high school party at stake, two teen yoga fanatics enlist a man hunter to help fight an army of monsters created by Nazis.'),('s8784','Friends Mai, Oto and Vik\'s games at the park become magical adventures, thanks to Yoko, who can turn playgrounds into spaceships and camping sites.'),('s8785','Vik meets new friends in a new city, where they go on exciting adventures together with a magical being. But soon, his family must move again.'),('s8786','With the mind of a human being, and the body of whichever animal he chooses to be, a young boy protects the world from danger.'),('s8787','A gifted young ballet dancer struggles to find her footing in an uptight ballet school that brings her and her family to a brand-new neighborhood.'),('s8788','After stepping in to revitalize his family\'s hotel, a money-minded businessman clashes with the hotel\'s cheery, Christmas-loving decorator.'),('s8789','A soap opera producer, director and makeup artist each face wrenching family turmoil, from teen rebellion and marital infidelity to Alzheimer\'s.'),('s8790','Laida and Miggy think they\'ve found perfect happiness with each other, until their burgeoning careers force them into a long-distance relationship.'),('s8791','An Israeli counterterrorism soldier with a secretly fabulous ambition to become a Manhattan hairstylist will do anything to make his dreams come true.'),('s8792','When a divorced writer gets a letter from an old boyfriend announcing his wife\'s had a baby, she returns to her hometown to reconnect with her ex.'),('s8793','Aided only by a tough female police officer, a Hong Kong taxi driver tries to escape from gangsters pursuing incriminating evidence left in his cab.'),('s8794','When a father of eight and a mother of 10 prepare to wed, the couple\'s children attempt to sabotage the union in this remake of a 1968 comedy.'),('s8795','Amid the tumult following Egyptian President Morsi\'s ouster, demonstrators from divergent backgrounds are brought together inside a police truck.'),('s8796','Now that he\'s discovered the Pendulum Summoning technique, Yuya\'s dream of becoming the greatest \"dueltainer\"\" is in reach – but it won\'t be easy!\"'),('s8797','During the Mongol invasions, Yunus Emre leaves his home to travel across the Ottoman Empire, defying hardships and temptations to become a dervish.'),('s8798','Teen surfer Zak Storm is mysteriously transported to the Bermuda Triangle, where he becomes the captain of a magical ship full of misfits.'),('s8799','A philandering small-town mechanic\'s political ambitions are sparked when the visiting prime minister mistakenly grants him special security clearance.'),('s8800','A change in the leadership of a political party sparks bitter conflict and the party\'s division into two rival factions.'),('s8801','Strong-willed, middle-class Kashaf and carefree, wealthy Zaroon meet in college, but before love can take root, they each have some growing up to do.'),('s8802','Recovering alcoholic Talal wakes up inside a small-town police station cell, where he\'s subject to the mind games of a psychotic sadist.'),('s8803','A political cartoonist, a crime reporter and a pair of cops investigate San Francisco\'s infamous Zodiac Killer in this thriller based on a true story.'),('s8804','While living alone in a spooky town, a young girl befriends a motley crew of zombie children with diverse personalities.'),('s8805','Looking to survive in a world taken over by zombies, a dorky college student teams with an urban roughneck and a pair of grifter sisters.'),('s8806','Dragged from civilian life, a former superhero must train a new crop of youthful saviors when the military preps for an attack by a familiar villain.'),('s8807','A scrappy but poor boy worms his way into a tycoon\'s dysfunctional family, while facing his fear of music and the truth about his past.');
